<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">- Makua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Ikitabu yo Itorati</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ikitabu yo Itorati</para>
  <para style="toc2">Itorati</para>
  <para style="toc3">Itor</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ikitabu yo</para>
  <para style="mt1">Itorati</para>
  <para style="imt">Malhove o uhoolhelha</para>
  <para style="ip">Ikitabu yo Itorati phi machokholhelho o malhehero anophwanyiya nhina ikitabu chikina nthanu chilhe, yaani ikitabu nthanu nhina Malhehano o Khalhayi. Wo nuulhumo no Ieburaniya, nchina no ilha ikitabu ilha maana aya “Malhove”. Ashinna Musa phi norumelhelhiya wiira phi ayo aalhempe ikitabu yo Itorati, yaahikhalhe vanomalha aya, vanohimiachiya mwaha wo ukhwa waya. Ikitabu inochokholha wo uimiacha wiira, “alha phi malhove ashinna Musa oolhumanche aya wa attu o Israeli.” Urumelhelhiya wiira ashinna Musa phi lhepilhe ikitabu yo Itorati unoolhuyita moono venchi ni Malhehano o Naanano. Thoko chinoonia aya nhina ikitabu yo Mitheko cha Akarumiya nlhako wo 3:22-23, Napeturo vanohokolhelha aya ikitabu yo Itorati nlhako wo 18:15-18 ahimiaka wiira aari malhove a ashinna Musa. Ashinna Musa phi alhempe ikitabu yo Itorati, vamoka ni ivitabu cho Uchokholha, Uthama, Alawi, ni Ihesabu iyaakha 300 ama 1400 hinaaya uyaria Kuristo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ikitabu yo Itorati yaalhepiye thoko nkataba wa mwene mmoka ni imwene yaatawara awe, thoko vaapangiye aya khalhayi. Nkataba wa Nlhuku ni attu o Israeli. Nlhuku aahalheha attu wiira nowaavaha ibarakha arumelhelhaka malhehero awe. Ni attu o Israeli vaahilhe aya urumelhelha malhehero a Nlhuku, ahotwarushiya. Yoyo phi mwaha uri nhina ikitabu yonkhaye ilha, nansho hasa milhako cho 27 ni 28 chinohimiacha mwaha unaacha ibarakha ni ulhaviya waakhumelhenlhe wa attu o Israeli wo nlhatu wo urumelhelha ni uhirumelhelha waya. Makosho a attu o Israeli eemenlhe mipata miilhi umiakoni ibarakha ni ulhaviya uwo voolhumachiya aya wo ukhuwelhiya uhimiechesha malhehano ayo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Chiri nhina:</para>
  <para style="io">Nhina milhako cho 1 mpaka wo 3 ashinna Musa anohimiaca mwaha waakhumelhenlhe ikatema attu o Israeli vaari aya munkwahani uthakoni.</para>
  <para style="io">Milhako cho 4 mpaka wo 26 unohimiya chittu chaathananiya ni malhehano a Nlhuku ni attu awe.</para>
  <para style="io">Tho, milhako cho 27 mpaka wo 30 attu o Israeli anohimiacha ibarakha ni ulhaviya wo ukhuwelhiya wooniha wiira malhehano aari o ukhulhuvelhiya.</para>
  <para style="io">Wo umalihera, nhina milhako cho 31 mpaka wo 34 ashinna Musa anoohimiacha malhove o umalhihera u Nayoshua, ni wo kila nikosho na attu o Israeli, ahinaaya ukhwa.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DEU 1" />
  <para style="s">Cho uhoolhelha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 1:1" />Ilha ikitabu ilha phi yo malhove a ashinna Musa aahimenrie aya attu onkhaye o Israeli ikatema yaakhanlhe aya uthakoni, unoshelha nchuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani. Yaari unikoteni Uyorodani vakhiviru ni Usufu, variyari wo iwani yo Uparani mpata mmoka, ni mpata nkina iwani cho Utofeli, Ulabani, Uhaserothi ni Udizahabu. <verse eid="DEU 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 1:2" />Nkwaha wo ukhuma umwaakoni Uhorebu weehaniya tho mwaako wo Usinai, waari wo mahuku khumi ni moka mpaka Ukadesh Barnea wo iphiro yo umwaakoni Useiri. <verse eid="DEU 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 1:3" />Nihuku no upacha no mweri wo khumi ni mmoka, iyaakha yo makhumi ncheshe, toka attu vaathamilhe aya Umisri, ashinna Musa ahaalheheracha attu kila ittu yaahimeriye aya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku wiira yaahimerie attu. <verse eid="DEU 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 1:4" />Aapannge chiicho vaamanlhe aya waakottolha amwene Nasihoni o ilhapo yo Uamori aatawara iwani yo Uheshboni, ni amwene Naogu o ilhapo yo Ubashani aatawara iwani cho Uashtarothi ni Uedrei. <verse eid="DEU 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 1:5" />Attu vaari aya ukhopelhelhe mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, wi ilhapo yo Umoabu, ashinna Musa ahochokholha waahimiachera malhehero a Apwiiya Nlhuku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 1:5">Yeerenlhe wiira, <verse eid="DEU 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 1:6" />“Vaari ihu umwaakoni Usinai, Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku ihu ahoniirelha wiira, ‘Nhokhalhacha mahuku o uthosha vamwaakoni vaa. <verse eid="DEU 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 1:7" />Vano etu mphomolheke nipuro ninyu nthepeke urwaa nkwaha inyu. Nrweeke ilhapo yo umiakoni ya attu o Uamori ni ilhapo cho vachereshere waya, chinaatamana ni Uaraba, umiakoni ni mmakoteni, Unegebu ni umbwaani. Eiyo, nrwaacheke mpaka ilhapo ya attu o Ukanaani, ni ilhapo yo Ulebanoni, mpaka uri mwoolhoko mulhupalhe wo Uyufrati ulhe. <verse eid="DEU 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 1:8" />Mwooneke, kihovahani umihoolho winyu ilhapo yonkhaye iyo. Paahi, nrwaacheke mwakhalhe yeyo ilhapo iyo, mii Apwiiya Nlhuku yaalhapenlhe aka waavaha manyaapwiiya inyu Aburahimu, Naisaka, Nayakhobo ni iyari chaya.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ashinna Musa anowaathanlha attu o waamulha milhatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 18:13-27">Utt 18:13-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 1:9" />Yamalheke, ashinna Musa aheerelha attu wiira, “Vaari ihu khaninaya uthama umwaakoni Usinai, mii kahouhimeriani wiira, ‘Ntheko wo uholhelhani mwaatti, mulhupalhe chinene, akinooria mii vekha aka. <verse eid="DEU 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 1:10" />Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ahoupangani ukhalha attu enchi, lhelho va nri attu enchi thoko ittotwa cho wiirimu. <verse eid="DEU 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 1:11" />Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku a manyaapwiiya inyu, athepeke etu uwunchererani mikwaha elufu uthepa chiri inyu vano va, ni uvahani ibarakha thoko chilhenhe aya! <verse eid="DEU 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 1:12" />Nansho mii vekha aka kinohalha wooria chani ukusha ntheko muulhupalhe wo waamulha indewo chinyu uyo? <verse eid="DEU 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 1:13" />Mwaathanlheke attu arii ni irusho, o umanya, aneewelhelhiya, o ukhuma kila nikosho, wiira khaathanlhe akhalhache ahoolhelhi inyu.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 1:14" />Ni inyu mwaatti mwahorumelhelha, nkamwaakakhulha wo wiira, nhohimia ittu yoombone upanga. <verse eid="DEU 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 1:15" />Paahi etu, kahaakusha ahoolhelhi ari ni irusho, o umanya, aneewelhelhiya ni attu, nkakaapanga ukhalha ahoolhelhi inyu. Kaheesha akina ukhalha o weemelhelha miphingo cha manyaasikari o miphingo cha attu elufu imokaimoka, cha attu imia imokaimoka, cha attu makhumi nthanunthanu, ni cha attu khumikhumi. Kahaathanlha tho manyoolhupalhe akina o ushunga kila nikosho.<verse eid="DEU 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 1:16" />“Yeyo ikatema iyo kahaavaha attu anaamulha milhatu chinyu ayo, alha malheheriyo anottwara alha wiira, ‘Mwiiwelhelhe milhatu cha attu inyu. Nhukumulheke wo ikekhiaye, vanaamulha inyu milhatu cha manyaattu inyu, ni vanaamulha inyu milhatu cha alheto anokhalhacha vamoka ni inyu mwaatti. <verse eid="DEU 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 1:17" />Nhimmwehe wiitho ntu riyoothe vanaamulha inyu milhatu, nlhikaaniheke wa attu onkhaye, olhupalhe ni ashikani. Nhimwoove ntu riyoothe vanohukumulha inyu, ukhalhawaya ihukumu inoromolha inyu inokhuma wa Nlhuku. Nlhatu uriyoothe wakhalhaka wo urikarika chinene uwannyu, mmwiiheke uwannyaka, ni mii kinowiiwelhelha.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 1:18" />Yeyo ikatema, kahoulheherani chittu chonkhaye chinothananiya inyu upanga.<verse eid="DEU 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Attu o uhotelha anoorumiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 13:1-33">Waal 13:1-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 1:19" />“Paahi thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku ihu, chenre aya wo unilhehera, nahochokholha nkwaha ihu ukhuma umwaakoni Uhorebu, nahovira yelhe ithakhwa yulhupalhe yo woopiha nnochuwelha inyu ilhe, wo uttwara iphiro inokelha ilhapo yo umiakoni ya attu o Uamori. Vaaphilhe ihu Ukadesh Barnea, <verse eid="DEU 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 1:20" />mii kahohimiacherani wiira, ‘Vano nhophiya ilhapo yo umiakoni ya attu o Uamori, inivahilhe aya Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku ihu. <verse eid="DEU 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 1:21" />Mwooneke etu, Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, aheesha yelha ilhapo ilha umihoolho winyu. Haya etu, nrweeke mwakhalhelheke thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, cherenlhe aya manyaapwiiya inyu wiira, nhoove mena nhikelhiye nipampa!’<verse eid="DEU 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 1:22" />“Nansho yamalheke, mwaatti onkhaye mwahowa nkamwaakiirelha wiira, ‘Naarumeke etu attu anihoolhelhe, arwee ahotelhe ilhapo iyo. Amalhihaka ahokolhieke awe aanihimeria iphiro irii yorera uttwara, ni iwani chinohalha ihu uphwanya wowo.’<verse eid="DEU 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 1:23" />“Yeyo ittu iyo yahooniya ukhalha yoombone uwannyaka, nkakaathanlha attu khumi ni elhi, ntu mmoka ukhuma kila nikosho. <verse eid="DEU 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 1:24" />Yayo attu ayo ahorwaacha yelhe ilhapo yo umiakoni ilhe, nkayaaphiyacha nikoote no Ueshkoli ni uhotelhacha. <verse eid="DEU 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 1:25" />Vaahokolhelhe aya, ahoniwiihera maphepu o ilhapo iyo ni unihimeria wiira yeyo ilhapo anonivaha aya Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku ihu iyo, yorera.<verse eid="DEU 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 1:26" />“Nansho, mwaattiva khamwattwanre malhehero a Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, wo ukhota urwaa wowo wiilhaponi uwo. <verse eid="DEU 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 1:27" />Nkamwaachukhulhacha mmaheemani mwinyu mwiiraka, ‘Apwiiya Nlhuku anoonivenga, phi nlhatu etu no unithamiha Umisri. Yaathanana unihelha mmathathani mwa attu o Uamori, wiira anirimelhihe. <verse eid="DEU 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 1:28" />Nlhatuni no urwaa wowo uno mirima chihu choovaka? Nihohimeriya wiira, attu o wowo olhupalhe ni orekamacha unipwaha hii, ni iwani chaya chiyo chulhupalhe, ni cho ingome chinophiya umahuteni. Tho, attu aarumilhe ihu ayo ahohimia wiira yahoona manyanttu olhupalhe, iyari i Naanaki!’<verse eid="DEU 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 1:29" />“Nansho mii kahowiirelhani wiira, ‘Nhikelhiye nipampa mena nhoove yayo attu ayo.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 1:30" />Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, anouhoolhelhani, anokowaatakana anene wo nlhatu winyu, thoko choonilhe inyu apangaka Umisri ulhe, <verse eid="DEU 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 1:31" />ni thoko chaapannge aya uthakoni ulhe. Voonne inyu chenre aya wo ukushani nkwaha wonkhaye, thoko naangoro nlhopwana chinonkusha awe mwaamwanawe, mpaka nkamwaaphiya vaa. <verse eid="DEU 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 1:32" />Nansho inakhalhaka ahopanga yayo onkhaye ayo, inyuva khamwaarumelhenlhe Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, <verse eid="DEU 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 1:33" />ohoolhenlheni mphironi ni uwaveriani vakittu wo weesha nipuro ninyu. Uhiyu ohoolhenlheni wo nipoto no mooro, ni uthana wo nihute, wiira owooniheni iphiro.<verse eid="DEU 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Apwiiya Nlhuku anowaatwarusha attu o Israeli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 14:20-45">Waal 14:20-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 1:34" />“Apwiiya Nlhuku aheewa ichuku chinyu, nkayaathunalha nkayaalhupelha yeeraka, <verse eid="DEU 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 1:35" />‘Khaawo mena ata mmoka inyu o iyari yo uhilhoka ilha nohalha ukelha yeyo ilhapo yorera ilha kilhenhe aka waavaha manyaapwiiya inyu. <verse eid="DEU 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 1:36" />Nakalebu anaaya Nayefune, phi nohalha uphiya wowo, ni mii kihaavaha ilhapo ilha inyikanlhe aya ilha ikhalhe yawaya, yayo ni iyari aya, wo nlhatu no ukhalha ntu o ukhulhuvelhiya uwannyaka.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 1:37" />Ni wo nlhatu winyu, Apwiiya Nlhuku ahokithunalhelha mii, nkayeera, ‘Mena, ata ni inyu Namusa khannokelha mwommo mwiilhaponi mmo. <verse eid="DEU 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 1:38" />Nansho akavihi inyu Nayoshua anaaya Nanuni, phi nohalha ukelha mwommo. Paahi mwaahelheke nrima, ukhalhawaya yayo phi nohalha waaholhelha attu o Israeli arwee akhalhelhe yeyo ilhapo iyo.’<verse eid="DEU 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 1:39" />“Yamalheke, Apwiiya Nlhuku ahoniirelha hii onkaye va wiira, ‘Yayo achishaana inyu nnoovacha inyu wiira anokoovarakachiya ni amalhaponi inyu ayo, eiyo, yayo ashinkani ayo ahinochuwelha ittu yoombone ama ittu yo uhilhoka ayo, yayo phi nohalha ukelha wowo, ni mii kinowaavaha yayo ilhapo iyo ikhalhe yawaya. <verse eid="DEU 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 1:40" />Nansho mwaattiva, nrukunuweke nhokolhieke uthakoni, nlhukameke Ibahari yo Ushamu.’<verse eid="DEU 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 1:41" />“Ni inyu mwaatti nkamwaakakhulha wo wiira, ‘Hii nihaawonya Apwiiya Nlhuku, nansho vano ninoorwaa ni waatakana thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku ihu, chinilhehenre aya.’ Paahi kila mmoka inyu eechesheke tayari waatakana ikhoto, mwaanyiheraka wiira khayaarika mwaatti ukelhelha yeyo ilhapo yo umiakoni iyo. <verse eid="DEU 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 1:42" />Ni Apwiiya Nlhuku ahokiirelha wiira, ‘Mwaahimerie attu ayo ahirwee uwaatakanani ikhoto, ukhalhawaya akiri vamoka ni ayo. Ahirwee, ahiwe aakottolhiya ni amalhaponi aya.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 1:43" />Paahi mii kahohimeriani chiicho, nansho mwaatti khamwewelhenlhe. Utulhi waya nkamwaakhota uttwara malhehero a Apwiiya Nlhuku, wo itiyamaru inyu nkamwaakelha mwiilhaponi uri miako. <verse eid="DEU 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 1:44" />Vavawo, attu o Uamori yaakhalhacha wowo umiakoni uwo, vaakhuruwilhe aya ni ukelhelhani mwaatti thoko inwii chineera aya, mwahaatakachiya, ukhuma wowo Useiri uwo mpaka Uhorma. <verse eid="DEU 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 1:45" />Phi vavawo vaahokolhelhe inyu ni wonlhelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, nansho Apwiiya Nlhuku, khayewelhenlhe wala ulhohani. <verse eid="DEU 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 1:46" />Paahi, nkamwaahalha Ukadeshi uwo, waakhanlhe inyu wo mahuku menchi.<verse eid="DEU 1:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DEU 2" />
  <para style="s1">Attu o Israeli anoothemwacha uthakoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 2:1" />“Yamalheke, nahorukunuwa nkanaarwaa uthakoni niviraka iphiro yo ibahari yo Ushamu, thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku chaakihimenrie aya, nansho nahothemwathemwa mahuku menchi vakhiviru mwaako wo Useiri.<verse eid="DEU 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 2:2" />“Yamalheke, Apwiiya Nlhuku ahokiirelha wiira, <verse eid="DEU 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 2:3" />‘Nhothemwathemwa wo uthosha ilhapo yo umiakoni ilha, vano etu nrukunuweke nrweeke mpata wo uchulhu. <verse eid="DEU 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 2:4" />Nri vakhiviru uvira ilhapo yo miako cho Useiri, ilhapo ya ashilhoko inyu, iyari i Naesau. Yayo anokowoovani, nansho nhikelha mweettialha, <verse eid="DEU 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 2:5" />nhaatakane ni ayo ukhalhawaya akinouvahani vakittu variwoothe nhina yeyo ilhapo iyo. Akinouvahani mena ata vakittu vakani vo unyikalha. Kihaavaha iyari i Naesau yeyo ilhapo yo miako yo Useiri iyo, wiira ikhalhe yawaya. <verse eid="DEU 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 2:6" />Mwathananaka yoolhia ama maashi ukhuma uwannyaya, mwathumeke.’<verse eid="DEU 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 2:7" />“Paahi muupuwelheke Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu chenre aya wo uvahani ibarakha wo kila ittu yaapannge inyu. Ahoushungani vaathemwathemwa inyu, vaari inyu uthako mulhupalhe ulha. Ahokhalha vamoka ni inyu iyaakha makhumi ncheshe chonkhaye chi, nansho khamwawukuwelhiye ittu iriyoothe.<verse eid="DEU 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 2:8" />“Wo chiichammo nahothepa urwaa nkwaha ihu, nkanaavira ashilhoko ihu, iyari i Naesau yaakhalha Useiri, nkanaahiya utulhi iphiro yo Uaraba ni iwani cho Uelathi ni Uesion Geberi. Yamalheke, nahorukunuwa nkanaattwara iphiro inovira ithakhwa yo Umoabu. <verse eid="DEU 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 2:9" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaakiirelha wiira, ‘Nhaahuvihe attu o Umoabu, mena nhaatakane ni ayo, ukhalhawaya akinouvahani vakittu variwoothe yo ilhapo aya. Ukhalhawaya ilhapo yo Uari iyo, kihaavaha achishaana a Nalutu wiira ikhalhe yawaya.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 2:10" />(Khalhayi vawo ilhapo yo Uari iyo yaari ikhalhiyaka ni attu enchi, attu o machiri ni orekama nchusha thoko attu o nikosho ni Naanaki. <verse eid="DEU 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 2:11" />Thoko achishaana a Naanaki, yalha attu alha ahochuwaniya tho thoko Arefai, nansho attu o Umoabu yeehanne Aemi. <verse eid="DEU 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 2:12" />Attu o Uhori ni ayo tho ahokhalha wowo Useiri uwo mpacho vawo, nansho achishaana a Naesau ahoomolhacha ni waarimelhiha, yamalheke ashinene ayo aheesha nipuro naya vavawo vakittu vawo. Attu o Israeli ahopanga thoko chiicho mwiilhaponi mwaavahiye aya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku wiira ikhalhe yawaya.)<verse eid="DEU 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 2:13" />“Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaanirelha wiira, ‘Nthamacheke vano, nlhapuweke mwoolhoko wo Uzeredi.’ Paahi naholhapuwa mwoolhoko wo Uzeredi uyo. <verse eid="DEU 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 2:14" />Nkachaavira iyaakha makhumi mararu ni nane toka uthama Ukadesh Barnea mpaka ulhapuwa mwoolhoko wo Uzeredi. Yeyo ikatema iyo, iyari yonkhaye ya attu o nchusha no urwaa ukhottoni naari ninamanlhe, thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku chenre aya wo waalhupelhelha. <verse eid="DEU 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 2:15" />Apwiiya Nlhuku anene ahaatakana ni yayo, wiira aarimelhihe wowo unipuroni uwo, mpaka onkhaye nkayaamalha.<verse eid="DEU 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 2:16" />“Paahi, attu onkhaye vaamanlhe aya ukhwaacha, <verse eid="DEU 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 2:17" />Apwiiya Nlhuku ahokiirelha wiira, <verse eid="DEU 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 2:18" />‘Lhelho nna nlhapuweke mwiinano wo Umoabu wo uvira ilhapo yo Uari. <verse eid="DEU 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 2:19" />Nnoophiya ilhapo ya attu o Uamoni. Nansho nhikelhe mwaahuviha mena nhikelha mwaatakana ikhoto ni yayo attu ayo, ukhalhawaya akinouvahani vakittu variwoothe mwiilhaponi mwa yayo achishaana a Naamoni ayo, vakhalhe nhakhu inyu. Mena! Ukhalhawaya yayo phi iyari i Nalutu, ni ayo kihaavaha ilhapo iyo ikhalhe yawaya’ ”<verse eid="DEU 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 2:20" />Yeyo ilhapo iyo yahochuwania tho, ukhalha ilhapo ya Arefai. Arefai yaakhanlhe wowo khalhayi vawo, ni attu o nikosho ni Naamoni yeehanne yayo manyaattu ayo, Azanzumi. <verse eid="DEU 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 2:21" />Yayo aari attu enchi, o machiri ni orekamacha thoko achishaana a Naanaki. Nansho Apwiiya Nlhuku ahaarimelhihacha vaaphilhe aya ilhapo ya attu o Uamori, yaakunshe ilhapo aya iyo, nkayaakhalha mwommo vakittu waya. <verse eid="DEU 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 2:22" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaapanga Aedomu anokhalha ilhapo yo Useiri, thoko chaapangenlhe aya achishaana a Naesau. Ahaarimeelhiha Ahori ikatema Aedomu vaaphiyanche aya wowo, nkayaakusha ilhapo aya ni ukhalha mwommo mpaka lhelho. <verse eid="DEU 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 2:23" />Attu o Uavi yaari vavawo mpacho, akhalhaka ilhapo cho umbwaani cho ibahari yo Umediteraniya mpaka Ugaza. Akaftori, attu aakhumme ichirumba yo Ukirete ahowaacha ni waarimelhiha, nkayaakhalha mwommo vanipuroni waya.<verse eid="DEU 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 2:24" />“Yamalheke, Apwiiya Nlhuku ahoniirelha wiira, ‘Haya etu! Nchokholheke vano nkwaha. Nlhapuweke nikoote no Uarnoni. Mii kihookottolhelhani Nasihoni, amwene o ilhapo ya Uamori, ni Naheshboni ni ilhapo aya. Mwaakelhelheke ni uchokholha ukhalhelha ilhapo aya. <verse eid="DEU 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 2:25" />Lhelho kinoochokholha waapanga attu onkaye o velhaponi va, owooveni ni akelhiyeke ni woova, anowiiwacha mwaha unowaachani mwaatti, ni ayo anoothukumelhacha ni ukelhiya nipampa.’<verse eid="DEU 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Attu o Israeli anowaakottolha amwene Nasihoni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 21:21-30">Waal 21:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 2:26" />“Paahi etu, kahaaruma attu ukhuma uthakhwani Ukedemothi arwaache wa amwene Nasihoni o Uheshboni ni nttenga unowiiha mpuha. <verse eid="DEU 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 2:27" />Wo wiira, ‘Nnihiyereke nivire mwiilhaponi mwinyu. Ninovira muntalhani, ni urwaa wo uhirukunuwa wiimonono ama moono wiimushi. <verse eid="DEU 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 2:28" />Ninoothumacha yolhia ihu ni maashi ninohalha ihu uwuria. Iruusa yo uvira wo mieto mwiilhaponi mwinyu phi ittu inolhepelha ihu, <verse eid="DEU 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 2:29" />wiira nilhapuwe mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani ni ukelha ilhapo ya Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku ihu anonivaha aya. Achishaana a Naesau anokhalha Useiri ni Umoabu ni anokhalha ilhapo yo Uari yahonihiyerera wiira nivire mwiilhaponi mwaya.’<verse eid="DEU 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 2:30" />“Nansho amwene Nasihoni o Uheshboni, khayaanihiyerenre wiira nivire mwiilhaponi mwaya. Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku ihu ahaalhipiha muru ni waahelha itiyamaru wiira naakottolhe ni ukusha ilhapo aya ninokhalhelha ihu mpaka lhelho nna va.<verse eid="DEU 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 2:31" />“Baada yo vavawo, Apwiiya Nlhuku nkaakiirelha wiira, ‘Mmweheke! Kihochokholha waahelha amwene Nasihoni ni ilhapo aya mmathathani mwinyu, nchokholheke etu ukusha ilhapo aya ikhalheke yawinyu.’ <verse eid="DEU 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 2:32" />Yamalheke, Nasihoni ahowa ni attu aya onkhaye uwa waatakana ni hii vakhiviru ni iwani yo Uyahasa. <verse eid="DEU 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 2:33" />Nansho Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku ihu ahonivaha naakottolhe, nkaneeva anene ayo, achishaana aya vamoka ni attu aya onkhaye. <verse eid="DEU 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 2:34" />Nkanaavara mateeka ni ulhakalhiha ilhapo aya yonkhaye, nkaneevakacha manyaalhopwana, manyaathiyana ni achishaana, khananhilhe ntu riyoothe nari nkumi. <verse eid="DEU 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 2:35" />Chittu chaavanre ihu ni ukusha, chaari mihuwo ni mihakhu chikina chonkhaye chaaphwanyilhe ihu mmawani. <verse eid="DEU 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 2:36" />Uchokholhelha Uaroeri, iwani irii mwiinano wo nikoote na Uarnoni ni iwani irii nhina nikoote nna, mpaka Ugileadi, khiiwo iwani iriyoothe yemenlhe rata, wiira noochelhe ukottolha. Ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku ahonooriha ukottolha iwani chonkhaye. <verse eid="DEU 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 2:37" />Nansho khanaatamenrie ilhapo ya attu o Uamoni ama mwiinano wo mwoolhoko wo Uyaboki, mena ilhapo yo umiakoni, mena vakittu variwoothe, vaachiichihiye ihu ni Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku ihu wiira nihirwee.<verse eid="DEU 2:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DEU 3" />
  <para style="s1">Attu o Israeli anowaakottolha amwene Naogu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 21-31">Waal 21-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 3:1" />“Yamalheke, nahorukunuwa ni urwaa mpaka Ubashani. Amwene Naogu nkayaawa ni attu aya onkhaye, uwaatakanani ikhoto ni hii vakhiviru ni iwani yo Uedrei. <verse eid="DEU 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 3:2" />Nansho Apwiiya Nlhuku ahokiirelha wiira, ‘Nhoove, ukhalhawaya kihaahelha mmathathani mwinyu, vamoka ni attu aya ni ilhapo aya. Nnowaapangelha thoko chaapangenlhe inyu Nasihoni amwene o Uamori, aatawanre Uheshboni ulhe.’<verse eid="DEU 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 3:3" />“Paahi, Apwiiya Nlhuku ahaahelha amwene Naogu o Ubashani ni attu aya mmathathani mwihu, nkanaalhakalhiha, wo uhinhalhiha ntu riyoothe. <verse eid="DEU 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 3:4" />Ni yeyo ikatema iyo nahovara mateeka iwani chonkhaye, khanaahilhe iwani iriyoothe. Iwani chonkhaye chaari makhumi sita, yaani nipuro nonkhaye no Uargobu naatawariya ni amwene Naogu o Ubashani. <verse eid="DEU 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 3:5" />Iwani chonkhaye chaari cho urukureriya ni ingome cho urekama, cho milhako ni iparatata chaya. Chahaawo tho, iwani chahaarukurerie ni ingome. <verse eid="DEU 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 3:6" />Wowo nahopahacha mooro kila ittu, nkanaatanganyacha kila iwani ni weevakacha manyaalhopwana, manyaathiyana ni achishaana thoko chenre ihu iwani chikina cha mwene Nasihoni o Uheshboni. <verse eid="DEU 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 3:7" />Nkanaakusha mihuwo chonkhaye ni mihakhu chikina.<verse eid="DEU 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 3:8" />“Yeyo ikatema iyo, nahokusha ilhapo yo mamwene elhi a Aamori, aakhalhacha ukhopelhelhe mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani alhe, variyari ni mwaako wo Uhermoni iyo. <verse eid="DEU 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 3:9" />Attu o Usidoni aneehana yoyo mwaako uyo, mwaako wo Uhermoni, ni attu o Uamori aneehana, mwaako wo Useniri. <verse eid="DEU 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 3:10" />Nahovara iwani chonkhaye cha amwene Naogu o Ubashani, ilhapo yo umakooteni, ni yo umiakoni. Yaani ilhapo yonkhaye yo Ugileadi ni Ubashani, mpaka Usaleke ni Uedrei.”<verse eid="DEU 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 3:11" />(Amwene Naogu vekha aya phi ahanlhe munlhokoni mwa attu o Urefai. Ikori aya yo iyuuma, yaari yo urekama imita ncheshe ni makhuvi imita piilhi, thoko wo maphimelho o mahuku ene. Yeyo ikori iyo ihaawo mpaka nna, Uraaba, iwani ya attu o Uamori.)<verse eid="DEU 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makosho aahanlhe ni ukhalha Unoshelha nchuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 32:1-42">Waal 32:1-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 3:12" />“Vaakunshe ihu ilhapo iyo, kahaavaha attu o makosho a Narobeni ni Nagadi, ilhapo yo uchokholha uchulhu wo Uaroeri vakhiviru ni mwoolhoko wo Uarnoni, nusu yo miako cho Ugileadi, vamoka ni iwani chaya. <verse eid="DEU 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 3:13" />Yamalheke, kahaavaha attu o nikosho ni Namanase, nusu yo vakittu vaahalhenlhe yo Ugileadi vamoka ni Ubashani wonkhaye, waatawariya ni Naogu, yaani ilhapo yonkhaye yo Uargobu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 3:13">Ilhapo yonkhaye ya attu o Ubashani yeehaniya ilhapo ya attu o Urefai. <verse eid="DEU 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 3:14" />Ni ntu mmoka eehaniya Yairi, o nikosho ni Namanase ahokottolha ni ukusha ilhapo yonkhaye yo Uargobu, yaani Ubashani mpaka mwiinano wo Ugeshuri ni Umaaka. Nkeehanacha iwani chonkhaye chiyo wo nchina nawe, ni mpaka nna chineehaniya Hawoth Yairi, yaani iwani chi Nayairi.<verse eid="DEU 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 3:15" />“Nkakaavaha attu o nihimo ni Namakiri o nikosho ni Namanase, iwani yo Ugileadi, <verse eid="DEU 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 3:16" />ni attu o makosho a Narobeni ni Nagadi, kahaavaha ilhapo yonkhaye ukhuma Ugileadi mpaka nikoote no mwoolhoko wo Uarnoni. Mwiinano wo uchawa waari variyari mwoolhoko, ni mwiinano wo uchulhu waari mwoolhoko wo Uyaboki, unaatamana ni ilhapo ya attu o Uamoni. <verse eid="DEU 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 3:17" />Mpata wo uneelha nchuwa, mwiinano aya wahowanelha mpaka mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, toka nttiya no Ugalilaya mpata wo uchulhu, nkawaakhuruwa mpaka ibahari yo Uaraba, yaani ibahari yo Maakha, mpaka unokhuruwelha Upisga, mpata unosha nchuwa.<verse eid="DEU 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 3:18" />“Yeyo ikatema iyo kahaalhehera attu o makosho mararu, wiira, ‘Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu ahouvahani ilhapo yo unosha nchuwa, yo mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani ilha, ikhalhe yawinyu. Mwaatti vano nhokhalha mashujaa munlhokoni mwa ashilhoko inyu, nkusheke etu ikerero chinyu nlhapuweke mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, mwaaholhelhaka ashilhoko inyu attu o Israeli. <verse eid="DEU 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 3:19" />Nansho manyaahanu inyu, achishaana inyu, ni ashinama inyu, kihochuwelha wiira nhanaa mihuwo chinchi, ahalhacheke mmawani kuvahilhe akani mmo. <verse eid="DEU 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 3:20" />Mwaakavihacheke ashilhoko inyu attu o Israeli mpaka Apwiiya Nlhuku vanohalha aya uvaherani wiira akhalheke vakittu waya, thoko chinre inyu mwaatti ni ukhalha ni vakittu winyu, yaani ni ayo akhalheke ni ilhapo aya, Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu inaavaha aya, ukhopelhelhe mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani uwo. Mwamalhihaka, nnowooria uhokolhia wiilhaponi winyu uno, kuuvanheakani ikhalhe phi ilhapo inyu.’<verse eid="DEU 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 3:21" />“Yamalheke, nkakaalhehera Nayoshua wiira, ‘Inyuva nhoona wo miitho inyu mwaashinene chittu chonkhaye Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu chipannge aya wo mamwene eelhi, Nasihoni ni Naogu. Paahi yayo anowaapangelha thoko chiicho mamwene o ilhapo chinohalha inyu uvirelha. <verse eid="DEU 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 3:22" />Nhoovache ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu phi nohalha waatakacha wo nlhatu winyu.’<verse eid="DEU 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ashinna Musa anoochiichihiya ukelha Ukanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 3:23" />“Yeyo ikatema iyo kahaalhepelha Apwiiya Nlhuku kiiraka, <verse eid="DEU 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 3:24" />‘Inyu Pwiiya, Apwiiya Nlhuku, kihochuwelha wiira, nhokooniha mii karumiya inyu uchokholha tu wo uyulhupalhe winyu ni wooria winyu. Ukhalhawaya nlhuku ani wiirimu uwo ama velhaponi va nooria upangacha chittu chulhupalhe, ni cho ushangiha thoko chinopangacha inyu inyuva? <verse eid="DEU 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 3:25" />Kinoulhepelhani wiira kilhapuwe etu mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, koone ilhapo yorera yo ukhopelhelhe mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani iyo. Eiyo, koone ilhapo yorera ni yo ushichira yo miako, vamoka ni miako cho Ulebanoni iyo.’<verse eid="DEU 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 3:26" />“Nansho wo nlhatu winyu mwaatti, Apwiiya Nlhuku ahokithunalhelha mii, nkayaakhota ukiiwelhelha. Ni kaanyuma aya nkayaakiirelha, ‘Ihothosha. Nhuulhumache nenna nlhove nna tho! <verse eid="DEU 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 3:27" />Mmwelheke vachulhu mwaako wo Upisga, mmwe mwoona yeyo ilhapo iyo, mwoone uneelha nchuwa, uchulhu, uchawa ni unosha nchuwa. Mmweheke rata chittu chinoona inyu, ukhalhawaya inyuva khannolhapuwa ulha mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani ulha. <verse eid="DEU 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 3:28" />Nansho mwaahelheke nrima Nayoshua ni waalhipiha, ni waavaha malhehero, ukhalhawaya yayo phi nohalha waaholhelha attu alhapuwe mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, arwee akhalhelhe ilhapo inohalha inyu woona iyo.’<verse eid="DEU 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 3:29" />“Paahi, nkanaahalha vava vanikoteni va, vakhiviru ni iwani yo Ubeth Peori va.”<verse eid="DEU 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DEU 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ashinna Musa anowaalhaka attu o Israeli ukhalha o wiitimarikha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 4:1" />Yamalheke, ashinna Musa ahothepa wuulhumacha eeraka, “Inyu mwaatti, attu o Israeli va, nvarechesheke etu iamuri chinowiittuchihaakani chilha, wiira nkhalhe ni ukumi ni ukhalhelha ilhapo, yaalhenhe aya Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku a manyaapwiiya inyu, uuvahani mwaatti. <verse eid="DEU 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 4:2" />Nhuncherere ittu iriyoothe nhina chilha iamuri chinouvahaakani chilha, ni mena nhiwukulhe ittu, nansho nvarechesheke iamuri cha Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, alha chinouvahaakani chilha. <verse eid="DEU 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 4:3" />Mwaatti mwahoonechesha chittu chaapannge awe Nlhuku chinaacha mwaha wa nlhuku Baali Peori. Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu ahaarimeelhiha attu onkhaye munlhokoni mwinyu, anthimicha yoyo nlhuku Baali uyo. <verse eid="DEU 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 4:4" />Nansho mwaatti mwaakhulhuvenlhe Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, mwa akumi mpaka lhelho nna va.<verse eid="DEU 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 4:5" />“Haya, kihowiittuchihani malhehero ni iamuri chonkhaye thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku aka chinre aya wo ukilhehera wiira kipange, wiira nvarecheshe wiilhaponi unokelhelha inyu ni ukhalha uwo. <verse eid="DEU 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 4:6" />Nvarelheke ni upanga thoko chineera aya wo uhimia yayo malhehero ayo, ukhalhawaya mweeraka chiicho, attu o makosho makina vanohalha aya wiiwa ni uchuwelha yayo malhehero ayo, anoowa aachuwelha wiira mwaatti attu o irusho. Ni ayo anowa yeera, ‘Wo ikekhiaye attu o ilha ilhapo ilha, atu o irusho ni o uchuwelha chittu!’<verse eid="DEU 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 4:7" />“Khaniwo nikosho nirinoothe ata nunnuwaka chani niiri vakhiviru ni nlhuku aya thoko chinre awe Nlhuku wo unaatameria hii, Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku ihu vanaalhapelha ihu wiira anikavihere. <verse eid="DEU 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 4:8" />Ni wala khaniwo nikosho nikina nirinoothe ata ninonnuwaka chani, niri ni iamuri cho ikekhiaye thoko chuwiittuchinheakani lhelho chi.<verse eid="DEU 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 4:9" />“Nansho inyuva nkhalheke miitho mwiiichinanelhaka chinene nhiwe mwaalhiyalha chittu choonilhe inyu wo miitho inyu mwaashinene chilhe. Ihiwe yaakhumelhelha ata vamoka muukumini mwinyu chechiyo chittu chiyo, nkachaalhiyalhiya mmamirimani mwinyu. Mmweeke mwaahimiachera achishaana inyu ni ashichulhu inyu. <verse eid="DEU 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 4:10" />Muupuwelheke mwaha wo nihuku nne neemenlhe inyu umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu nne, Uhorebu ulhe vaakiirenlhe aya wiira, ‘Mwaathukumanihacheke attu alha, wiira mwettuchihe ukithimicha mii mahuku onkhaye muukumini mwaya ni weettuchihacha achishaana aya ni ayo eere chiicho.’<verse eid="DEU 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 4:11" />“Paahi mwaahimiachereke achishaana inyu, chenre inyu wo waatameria ni weemelha vathi mwaako waapharelha mooro ulhe, mooro waaphiya mpaka uchulhu umahuteni nkawaakhunelha nihute nulhuphalhe, nkanaakelhiya ipiphi. <verse eid="DEU 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 4:12" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayoolhumacha ni inyu mwaatti, oolhumacha ukhuma variyari mooro uyo, ni inyu mwaheewa malhove yoolhumacha aya, nansho khamwonne chiri aya anene ayo, mwaahowiiraka wiiwa tu nlhove naya. <verse eid="DEU 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 4:13" />Ni ayo ahouhimeriani malhehano aya, nkayootangelhani wiira, nvarecheshe ni urumelhelha iamuri khumi chaalhempe aya vachulhu ivibau piilhi cho malhuku chilhe. <verse eid="DEU 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 4:14" />Yeyo ikatema iyo Apwiiya Nlhuku ahokilheehera wiira, kuwiittuchiheni iamuri chonkhaye chinothananiya inyu upanga wiilhaponi unokelha inyu ukhalha uwo.<verse eid="DEU 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Waamukiya uhiya mwaha wo ulhapelha isinyago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 4:15" />“Paahi etu nhiitialhe, nhiwe mwaalhiyalha wiira, Apwiiya Nlhuku voolhumanche aya ni inyu mwaati umwaakoni Uhorebu ulhe, khamwonne chiri aya. Paahi wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu mwiishungeke chinene, <verse eid="DEU 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 4:16" />nhiwonye ni wiikooroshelha isinyago iriyoothe yo uhemiya yo ulhikaanihiya uriwoothe, ikhalhe ilhopwana ama ithiyana, <verse eid="DEU 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 4:17" />yo mwannama riyoothe velhaponi, ama yo ashinuni o uvava, <verse eid="DEU 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 4:18" />ama yo ulhikaaniha ni mwannama riyoothe o wiipurulha, ama yo ulhikaanihiya ihopa yo mmaashini. <verse eid="DEU 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 4:19" />Mwiishungeke rata wiira, ikatema vanohalha inyu uweha nchuwa, mweeri ni ittotwa ni chittu chonkhaye cho wiirimu, vavawo nhiwe mwaachivelhiya, nkamwaachokholhacha uthimicha ni ukavihera chechiyo chittu chiyo. Apwiiya Nlhuku oopilhe chechiyo chittu chiyo wo nlhatu no attu onkhaye o velhaponi. <verse eid="DEU 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 4:20" />Nansho mwaatti phi inyu attu okhonlhe aya Umisri, uchiparani waathulhusheriya iyuuma. Okumihilheni wowo wiira, mmwe mwaakhalha attu aya thoko chiri inyu lhelho chi. <verse eid="DEU 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 4:21" />Wo nlhatu winyu Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu ahokithunalhelha nkayaalhupelha wiira mii akinolhapuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani ni ukelha ilhapo yorera inouvaha ayani ilhe. <verse eid="DEU 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 4:22" />Mii kinohalha ukhwelha momu mwiilhaponi mu, ni wala akinolhapuwa mwoolhoko, nansho inyu mwaatti nhaatameria ulhapuwa ni ukelha uukhalhani ilhapo nnovahiya inyu ukhalha yawinyu. <verse eid="DEU 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 4:23" />Mwiishungeke chinene, nhiwe mwaalhiyalha malhehano apangilhe aya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu ni inyu mwaatti, wiira nhikooroshe isinyago yo ulhikaana ni ittu iriyoothe ichiichihiye ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, wiira nhaalhikaanihe. <verse eid="DEU 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 4:24" />Ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, phi mooro unopaha.” Yayo phi Nlhuku o ihache.<verse eid="DEU 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 4:25" />“Vanohalha inyu ukhalha mwommo mwiilhaponi mmo, nkamwaayaracha achishaana ni upata uchuulhu nkamwoolhuvalha, nhikelha mwaachokholha upanga chittu cho unanara, ni ukooroshacha isinyago yo ulhikaanihiya ni ittu iriyoothe, nkamwaawonya mmiithoni mwa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, nkamwaathunalhiha. <verse eid="DEU 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 4:26" />Paahi mii lhelho va, kinowiihana irimu ni ilhapo chiwe choonechesha chittu chinopangacha inyu. Kinouhimeriani wiira, nnoowa mwaarimelha wowo wiilhaponi unokelha inyu ukhalha ukhopelhelhe mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani uwo. Khannokelha mwaalhokelha chinene wowo, nansho nnokoolhakalhihiya onkhaye. <verse eid="DEU 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 4:27" />Apwiiya Nlhuku anokoumwarushachani munlhokoni mwa attu o ilhapo chikina, ni wowo nnokorimeelhacha, ni attu vakani tu munlhokoni mwinyu phi nowa aahalha wowo. <verse eid="DEU 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 4:28" />Wowo nnokookavihera milhuku cho miri ni cho malhuku chikooroshiye ni miono cha attu, chihinooria woona ni wala khachineewa, khachinolhia ni wala khachinooria unukha. <verse eid="DEU 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 4:29" />Kaanyuma aya mwommo mwiilhaponi mmo, nnokowaathotha Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ni vavawo nnoowa mwaapatta mwaathothaka wo nrima wonkhaye ni wo nnepa wonkhaye. <verse eid="DEU 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 4:30" />Vanohalha inyu uhuva, nkawoopattani yoyo mwaha wonkhaye uyo, vavawo nnoowa mwaarukunuwa ni waahokolhelha Apwiiya Nlhuku ni waarumelhelha. <verse eid="DEU 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 4:31" />Ni ayo, Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, phi Nlhuku o ikiriri, khanowa oohiyani wo urimeelhihani, ukhalhawaya khanolhiyalha malhehano aalhenanne aya ni manyaapwiiya inyu wo ulhupelhihana.<verse eid="DEU 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 4:32" />“Nkoherereke chinene mwaha waakhumelhenlhe khalhayi, mwaha waapangelhe mwaatti nhinayaria, uchokholha nihuku Nlhuku vaamupilhe awe ntu velhaponi nne. Nkoheke velhaponi vonkhaye, ukhuma mpata mmoka mpaka mpata nkina, yakhalhaka mwaha wo ushangiha thoko yoyo uhopacha ukhumelhelha ama wiiwiya. <verse eid="DEU 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 4:33" />Chani, ahawo attu aapanche wiiwa nlhove na Nlhuku nuulhumachaka variyari mooro, nkayaakhalha akumi wo uhikhwa thoko cheewilhe inyu mwaatti? <verse eid="DEU 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 4:34" />Chani, hawo nlhuku riyoothe nkina panche urwaa uuhokolhoshani nikosho na attu awe ukhuma wa attu o nikosho nikina thoko chinre aya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu. Nkaapanga chittu cho woopiha chonne inyu mwaashinene Umisri ulhe. Wo waalhakalhiha attu, wo upanga cho uthikineeha ni cho ushangiha, ama wo waatakana ikhoto, ama wo machiri aya molhupalhe, mwaashinene mwoonaka? <verse eid="DEU 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 4:35" />Nansho mwaatti mwahovaheriya woona chechiyo, nchuwelhe wiira, Apwiiya Nlhuku phi o vekha aya, arii Nlhuku ni wala khaawo nkina tho. <verse eid="DEU 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 4:36" />Ahowiiwihani nlhove naya naakhuma wiirimu wiira, owiittuchiheni wiira owaamukeni nkhalhe ni irusho ni nkayowoonihani velhaponi va, mooro aya muulhupalhe ni wiiwa malhove aya aakhuma variyari mooro. <verse eid="DEU 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 4:37" />Ukhalhawaya ahaattunacha manyaapwiiya inyu, ahouthanlhani mwaattiva iyari chaya, nkookumihani anene, ukhuma Umisri wo machiri aya molhupalhe. <verse eid="DEU 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 4:38" />Ahoomolhacha attu o makosho molhupalhe ni o machiri uupwahani mwaattiva, mwoonecheshaka mwaashinene, wiira mmwe mwaavahiya mwaatti ilhapo aya, ikhalhe yawinyu thoko chiri aya mpaka lhelho va! <verse eid="DEU 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 4:39" />Paahi etu, muupuwelheke lhelho ni ushungerera mmamirimani mwinyu wiira, Apwiiya Nlhuku, phi Nlhuku rii uchulhu wiirimu, ni vathi velhaponi va, mena khaawo nkina tho. <verse eid="DEU 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 4:40" />Paahi, vano etu nvarelheke malhehero aya, ni iamuri chaya chinouvahaakani lhelho, wiira nkhalhe rata mwaattiva vamoka ni iyari chinyu, mmwe mwaalhokelha mahuku menchi wiilhaponi unovahiya inyu ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu mwakhalhelhe mahuku o uhimalha.”<verse eid="DEU 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iwani cho uttawelhelha unoshelha nchuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 4:41" />Phi vavawo ashinna Musa vaatennge aya iwani ttaaru cho mpata unoshelha nchuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani <verse eid="DEU 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 4:42" />chinohalha awe ntu uttawelha ni wiichookholha, yakhalhaka noomwiiva wo uhilhakelha ntu hiri mmalhaponi awe. Ntu thoko yoyo nowooria uttawelha iwani imoka aya ni wookholha ukumi awe. <verse eid="DEU 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 4:43" />Aatennge iwani yo Ubeseri, wi ichirimo yo uthakoni wo nlhatu wo nikosho ni Narobeni, nkayaatenga iwani yo Uramothi, ilhapo yo Ugileadi wo nlhatu wo nikosho ni Nagadi, ni ahotenga iwani yo Ugolani, ilhapo yo Ubashani wo nlhatu wo nikosho ni Namanase.<verse eid="DEU 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maholhelho o uvahiya Malhehero a Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 4:44" />Alha phi malhehero a ashinna Musa aavanhe aya attu o Uisraeli. <verse eid="DEU 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 4:45" />Alha phi malhove, malhehero ni iamuri, ashinna Musa chaavanhe aya attu o Israeli ikatema vaathama aya Umisri, <verse eid="DEU 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 4:46" />vaari aya ukhopelhelhe mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani unikooteni umihoolho wo Ubeth Peori, ilhapo yaatawariya ni amwene Nasihoni o Uamori, yaakhalha iwani yo Uheshboni. Amwene aakottolhiye ni ashinna Musa vamoka ni attu o Israeli ikatema vaathama aya Umisri. <verse eid="DEU 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 4:47" />Nkayaakusha ilhapo aya, vamoka ni ilhapo ya amwene Naogu o Ubashani. Yayo mamwene eelhi ayo phi attu aatawara unosha nchuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani uwo. <verse eid="DEU 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 4:48" />Yeyo ilhapo iyo yahowanelha ukhuma iwani yo Uaroeri vachereshere mwoolhoko wo Uarnoni, mpaka mwaako wo Usirioni yaani mwaako wo Uhermoni, <verse eid="DEU 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 4:49" />vamoka ni ilhapo yo unoshelha nchuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani mpaka ibahari yo Maakha, umwiinanoni, mpaka unokhuruwelha mwaako wo Upisga.<verse eid="DEU 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DEU 5" />
  <para style="s1">Iamuri khumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 20:1-17">Utt 20:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 5:1" />Yamalheke, ashinna Musa aheehanacha vamoka attu o Israeli ni weerelha wiira, “Mwaatti attu o Israeli, mwiiwelhelheke ikano ni malhehero kinohalha aka uhimiacha uwannyu lheho alha. Mwiittucheke yayo ni upanga rata thoko chinothananiya aya. <verse eid="DEU 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 5:2" />Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku ihu ahopanga malhehano ni hii umwaakoni Uhorebu, yaani mwaako wo Usinai. <verse eid="DEU 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 5:3" />Khaapange yayo malhehano ayo ni manyaapwiiya ihu vekha aya, nansho aapange ni hii onkhaye nirii akumi lhelho va. <verse eid="DEU 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 5:4" />Mwaattiva mwaheewa Apwiiya Nlhuku voolhumacha aya ni inyu mwaatti anari variyari mooro, thoko ntu chinomulhumana awe nkhunanawe, wowo umwaakoni uwo. <verse eid="DEU 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 5:5" />Yeyo ikatema iyo mii kaari karumiya variyari, inyu mwaatti ni Apwiiya Nlhuku, nkakootangacherani alhe oolhumanche aya alhe. Nansho ukhalhawaya mwaatti mwahoova mooro ulhe, khamwaawenlhe umwaakoni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 5:5">“Apwiiya Nlhuku yenre wiira, <verse eid="DEU 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 5:6" />‘Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu kookuminheni Umisri waari inyu ipotta.<verse eid="DEU 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 5:7" />“ ‘Nhithimiche milhuku chikina kaahikhalhe mii.’<verse eid="DEU 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 5:8" />“ ‘Nhikooroshelhe milhuku cho isinyago cho uhemiya, wala ittu yo ulhikaanihera ittu iriyoothe iri uchulhu wiirimu, wala vathi velhaponi va, wala ittu iri mmashini wuuthi ilhapo. <verse eid="DEU 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 5:9" />Nhikhoromelhe wala ukavihera, ukhalhawaya mii Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu ki Nlhuku o ihache. Kinowaatwarusha attu onkhaye uwonya wa manyaapwiiya aya, ata mpaka o iyari yo neraru ama yo necheshe ya attu ahinokittuna ayo. <verse eid="DEU 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 5:10" />Nansho kinowooniha uttuna waka maelufu a attu anokittuna, ni urumelhelha malhehero aka alhe.<verse eid="DEU 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 5:11" />“ ‘Nhiromolhache pufia nchina naka, mii Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ukhalhawaya kinontwarusha ntu riyoothe nohalha upanga chiicho.<verse eid="DEU 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 5:12" />“ ‘Nshungeeheke Nihuku no Wiittuwa, mpangeke ukhalha nihuku nitakatifu, thoko mii Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu chinre aka wo ulheherani. <verse eid="DEU 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 5:13" />Mpangeke ntheko mahuku sita, vavawo mpangeke chittu chinyu chonkhaye, <verse eid="DEU 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 5:14" />nansho nihuku no saba phi Nihuku no Wiittuwa neeshiye wo nlhatu waka. Nenno nihuku nno, nhiwe mwaapanga ntheko uriiyothe inyuva mwaanene, wala achishaana inyu ashilhopwana, wala ashithiyana, wala ipotta inyu ilhopwana wala yeethiyana, wala ashinama inyu, wala nlheto rii uwaninyu, wiira ipotta inyu ilhopwana ama ithiyana yiittuwe chiichammo thoko inyuva. <verse eid="DEU 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 5:15" />Nhilhiyalhe wiira ni inyu mwaari ipotta Umisri, ni mii Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu kahoukumihani wowo wo moono aka wo machiri, moono wookolhiye. Phi nlhatu etu mii Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu kihoulheherani ushungerera Nihuku no Wiittuwa.<verse eid="DEU 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 5:16" />“ ‘Mwaathimicheke athumwaninyu ni anumwaninyu, thoko chinokithimicha inyu mii Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu chulhehenreakani mpange. Mpangeke chiicho wiira mpatte mahuku menchi o ulhokelha velhaponi va, ni ushichira thoko chineera aka wo uvaherani.<verse eid="DEU 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 5:17" />“ ‘Nhiive.<verse eid="DEU 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 5:18" />“ ‘Nhilhuve.<verse eid="DEU 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 5:19" />“ ‘Nhiiye.<verse eid="DEU 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 5:20" />“ ‘Nhoothachere amwaatamana inyu.<verse eid="DEU 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 5:21" />“ ‘Nhaamirelhe ishenye ahanu a amwaatamana inyu, wala nhimirelhe ishenye inupa aya, wala imata aya, wala iphuta aya ilhopwana ama ithiyana, wala ing'ope aya, wala ittu iriyoothe irina aya amwaatamana inyu.’<verse eid="DEU 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 5:22" />“Chilha phi iamuri chaahimmie aya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu uwannyu mwaatti onkhaye, wo nlhove nuulhupalhe neewania ukhuma vamooroni, ni nihute nolhemelha nne, ni ipiphi totoro ilhe. Ohimenrieni vaari inyu nnathukumananche umwaakoni ulhe ni vavawo wala khayoocherenre iamuri ikina. Amalheke aholhepa chechiyo iamuri chaya chiyo vachulhu ivibau piilhi cho malhuku, nkayaakivaha mii.”<verse eid="DEU 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Woova wa attu o Israeli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 20:18-21">Utt 20:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 5:23" />“Ikatema yeewilhe inyu nenno nlhove nno nikhumaka variyari ipiphi ilhe, vachulhu mwaako waapharelha aya mooro ulhe, manyaahoolhelhi onkhaye o makosho inyu ni ashulhupalhe inyu ahowaacha vaari aka, <verse eid="DEU 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 5:24" />nkayeera, ‘Mwiiwelhelheke! Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku ihu anoononiha uyulhupalhe aya ni nchakarimia wo nthimicho waya, niheewa nlhove naya nikhumaka variyari mooro ulhe. Lelho nihomwoona Nlhuku olhumachaka ni ntu, nansho ntu noothepa ukhalha nkumi! <verse eid="DEU 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 5:25" />Nansho yeeshiyani wiihelha ntatakoni, ukhwa wo upahiya mooro muulhupalhe ulhe tho? Neewaka nlhove na Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku ihu tho ninookhwa! <verse eid="DEU 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 5:26" />Chani, ntu ani apantte umwiiwa Nlhuku ri nkumi oolhumachaka ukhuma variyari mooro thoko chinre ihu wo wiiwa hii, nkaathepa ukhalha nkumi? <verse eid="DEU 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 5:27" />Nansho inyuva ashinna Musa nrweeke vakhiviru waya, mweewelhelheke chonkhaye chinohalha aya wuulhumacha Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku ihu chiyo. Yamalhaka nhokolhieke mmweeke mwaanihimeria yayo malhove onkhaye anohalha aya uuhimeriani ayo. Hii ninoweewelhelha ni urumelhelha thoko chilheeheriye aya.’<verse eid="DEU 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 5:28" />“Apwiiya Nlhuku aheewa malhove inyu ayo nkayaakiirelha, ‘Kiheewa malhove ahimmie aya alha attu aka alha, malhove ahimmie aya onkhaye oreraru. <verse eid="DEU 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 5:29" />Yakaari ikatema yonkhaye ahokhalha ni irusho thoko chii! Yakaari ahokithimicha ni urumelhelha iamuri chaka! Chittu chaya chonkhaye, chaanopangia rata uwannyaya ashinene ayo, ni iyari chaya, wo mahuku o uhimalha. <verse eid="DEU 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 5:30" />Nrweeke mwaahimerieke attu wiira ahokolhiacheke mmaheemani mwaya. <verse eid="DEU 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 5:31" />Nansho inyuva Namusa, mweemelheke mwaanene vakhiviru mii vaa, ni mii kinoohimeriani iamuri, malhehero onkhaye ni ikano chinohalha inyu weettuchihacha, wiira ilhapo kaavahilhe aka iyo ikhalhe yawaya.’<verse eid="DEU 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 5:32" />“Mwaatti attu o Israeli, nkhalhacheke rata wiira mpangacheke thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku chinre aya wo ulhehera. Nhihiye urumelhelha iamuri aya iriyoothe. <verse eid="DEU 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 5:33" />Nrumelhelheke chonkhaye, wiira mitheko chinyu chipangie rata, ni wiira mwalhokelhe chinene wiilhaponi unokelha inyu uvahiya ukhalha wawinyu uwo.”<verse eid="DEU 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DEU 6" />
  <para style="s1">Iamuri yuulhupalhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 6:1" />“Chilha phi iamuri, ikano ni malhehero a Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu chaalhehenre aya wiira kuwiittuchiheni, wiira nrumelhelhe ni upangacha wowo wiilhaponi unorwaa inyu uukhalhani uwo. <verse eid="DEU 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 6:2" />Ikatema yonkhaye varii inyu akumi va, nnothananiya wiira mwooveke Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu ni urumelhelha iamuri chaya chonkhaye ni malhehero anouvahaakani mwaattiva, ni iyari chinyu wiira nkhalhe ni ukumi wo makhuku menchi. <verse eid="DEU 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 6:3" />Mwiiwelhelheke, mwaatti attu o Uisraeli ni uvarechesha. Phi vavawo chittu chonkhaye chinootimira, nnoovaheriya ni ukhalha nikosho no machiri chinene wowo wiilhaponi uwo, ilhapo inolhoka ulhima ni uhuwa mihuwo, thoko chenre aya Apwiiya Nlhuku wo waalheha manyaapwiiya inyu.<verse eid="DEU 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 6:4" />“Paahi nkeewani inyu mwaatti attu o Israeli! Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu phi Apwiiya Nlhuku ari o vekha. <verse eid="DEU 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 6:5" />Mwaattuneke Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, wo nrima inyu wonkhaye, ni wo nnepa winyu wonkhaye, ni wo irusho chinyu chonkhaye, ni wo machiri inyu onkhaye. <verse eid="DEU 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 6:6" />Nshungeeheke mmamirimani mwinyu alha malhove anoulheheraakani lhelho alha. <verse eid="DEU 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 6:7" />Mweettuchiheke rata achishaana inyu, ni waahimiachera ikatema vanohalha inyu ukhalha mmanupani, vanorwaa inyu munkwahani, ama vanorupa inyu ama vanonkwa inyu. <verse eid="DEU 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 6:8" />Mmwareke mmiononi mwinyu ni vayuchi winyu, wo uwupushani. <verse eid="DEU 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 6:9" />Nlhepacheke alha malhehero alha vachulhu milhako cho inupa chinyu, ni vachulhu milhako cho ukelha mmawani mwinyu.<verse eid="DEU 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Waamukiya attu o itiyamaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 6:10" />“Thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu chenre aya wo weerelha manyaapwiiya inyu Aburahimu ni Naisaka ni Nayakhobo, wiira anowa waavaha ilhapo yo iwani chulhupalhe ni chorera, cho manupa o ushichira, chihithekilhe inyu mwaattiva mwaashinene. <verse eid="DEU 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 6:11" />Apwiiya Nlhuku anokouvahani manupa aya ayo, anachanre chittu chorera chiheeshilhe inyu mwaashinene, nnokoophwanya ilhushi chihithipilhe inyu mwaatti, ni imata cho mizabibu ni mizeituni chihilhimme inyu mwaatti. Ni Apwiiya Nlhuku vanohalha aya urwehani wowo wiilhaponi uwo, nnokoopatta choolhia chonkhaye chinothanana inyu. <verse eid="DEU 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 6:12" />Ni vavawo nansho nhiwe mwaalhiyalha Apwiiya Nlhuku ookumihulheni Umisri waari inyu ipotta. <verse eid="DEU 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 6:13" />Mwaathimicheke Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, mwaakavihereke yayo vekha aya, ni ulhupelha wo uromolha nchina naya vekha aya. <verse eid="DEU 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 6:14" />Nhithimiche milhuku chikina, milhuku cha attu anaatamana inyu, <verse eid="DEU 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 6:15" />urushiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku uhiwe waapharelha vachulhu winyu nkayofutani velhaponi va. Ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu arii variyari inyu, phi Nlhuku o ihache.<verse eid="DEU 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 6:16" />“Nhaalhikache Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, thoko chenre inyu wo waalhikacha vaari inyu Umaasa. <verse eid="DEU 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 6:17" />Mwavarechesheke iamuri cha Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, chonkhaye chilhehenre aya. <verse eid="DEU 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 6:18" />Mpangeke chittu chinaateelhiha nrima Apwiiya Nlhuku wiira nvaheriye. Vavawo nnoowa mwaapatta ilhapo yorera yaalhehilhe aya Apwiiya Nlhuku wiira anowaavaha manyaapwiiya inyu ilhe, <verse eid="DEU 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 6:19" />ni woomolhacha amalhaponi inyu thoko chenre aya wo ulheha.<verse eid="DEU 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 6:20" />“Mahuku anowa achishaana inyu ookohakani, ‘Maana aya phi ishiyani nhina chi ikano chinilhehenre aya Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku ihu wiira nipangache chi?’ <verse eid="DEU 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 6:21" />Mmweke mwaakhulha wiira, ‘Hii naari ipotta chi Nafarao amwene o Umisri, ni Apwiiya Nlhuku ahonookholha ukhuma wowo wo moono aya wo machiri. <verse eid="DEU 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 6:22" />Nahoona wo miitho ihu naashinene apangaka ithikineeha ni chittu cho woopiha, wa attu o Umisri ni amwene aya ni wa attu aya o ikuru. <verse eid="DEU 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 6:23" />Ahonikumiha ukhuma Umisri nkayaaniwiiha va, ni univaha ilha ilhapo ilha, thoko chaalhupenlhe aya manyaapwiiya ihu wiira anowaavaha. <verse eid="DEU 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 6:24" />Paahi, Apwiiya Nlhuku ahonilhehera wiira nivarecheshe iamuri chonkhaye chi, ni waathimicha wo mahalha ihu naashinene, wiira athepeke uniinanelha mahuku onkhaye thoko chiri ihu lhelho va. <verse eid="DEU 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 6:25" />Navarecheshaka kila ittu inilhehenre aya Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku ihu, ninowateelhiha nrima, ni mitheko chihu chinoopangia rata, wowo wiilhaponi unokelha ihu ukhalha uwo.’<verse eid="DEU 6:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DEU 7" />
  <para style="s1">Attu athanlhiye ni Apwiiya Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:11-16">Utt 34:11-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 7:1" />“Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu anoupiihani ilhapo inohalha inyu urwaa ni ukhalha, ni anokowoomolhacha attu o makosho makina anokhalhacha wowo ayo. Vanohalha inyu ukelha wowo, anokowoomolhacha umihoolho winyu, makosho saba molhupalhe, ni machiri uupwahani mwaatti. Yaani; Ahiti, Agirgashi, Aamori, Akanaani, Aperizi, Ahivi ni Ayebusi. <verse eid="DEU 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 7:2" />Tho, Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, amalhihaka waahelha mmathathani mwinyu nkamwaakottolhacha, ni weevakacha yayo attu ayo onkhaye, nhiwe etu mwaalhehana nlhove nirinoothe ni ayo, ni mena nhoonelhe ikiriri. <verse eid="DEU 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 7:3" />Nhaathelhe manyaathiyana aya, mena nhaathelhihe achishaana inyu ashithiyana wa yayo attu ayo, ama nhaathelhihe achishaana inyu ashilhopwana. <verse eid="DEU 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 7:4" />Mwapangaka chiicho, anowaakukureha achishaana inyu ayo, wiira ahaathimiche Apwiiya Nlhuku, ni weettuchiha wiira athimicheke milhuku chikina. Vavawo urushiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku unoopharelha vachulhu winyu, ni ulhakalhihani wo uhipicha. <verse eid="DEU 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 7:5" />Nansho, mwaphomolhacheke madhubahu aya ni ukakha mapoto aya. Ni mwaphomolhacheke isinyago cho nlhuku aya nthiyana Ashera chiyo, ni upahacha mooro isinyago chaya cho uhemiya chiyo. <verse eid="DEU 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 7:6" />Mwapangeke chiicho ukhalhawaya mwaatti nhothanlhiya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu. Munlhokoni mwa attu onkhaye o velhaponi va, mwaatti vekha inyu phi thanlhiye ukhalha phi attu aya.<verse eid="DEU 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 7:7" />“Apwiiya Nlhuku khayottunneni mwaatti ni uthanlhani wiira mwaari enchi chinene waapwaha attu akina, mwaatti mwaari vakani upwaha makosho makina velhaponi va. <verse eid="DEU 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 7:8" />Nansho ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku anouttunani, ni anoovarechesha ulhupelha waalhupenlhe aya wa manyaapwiiya inyu, phi nlhatu etu no uwookholhani wo machiri aya molhupalhe ni ukumihani upottani, mmiononi mwa Nafarao, amwene o Umisri. <verse eid="DEU 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 7:9" />Paahi, nchuwelheke etu wiira, Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu phi Nlhuku, Nlhuku o ukhulhuvelhiya, novarechesha malhehano awe, ni nowooniha urera wawe iyari chinchi cha attu anovarechesha iamuri chawe. <verse eid="DEU 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 7:10" />Nansho nowaatwarusha attu ahinonrumelhelha ayo thoko chinophwanelhiya aya. <verse eid="DEU 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 7:11" />Paahi etu nvarechesheke rata, malhehero ni iamuri chinouvahaakani lhelho chilha.<verse eid="DEU 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibarakha wa attu anorumelhelha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 28:1-14">Itor 28:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 7:12" />“Mweewelhelhaka malhehero alha ni uvarechesha, ni upanga thoko chinothananiya aya, Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, anoovarelha malhehano aya ni inyu mwaatti, ni anowoonihani urera waya waalhupenlhe aya manyaapwiiya inyu. <verse eid="DEU 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 7:13" />Anouttunani ni uvahani ibarakha, ni inyu nnowunchereria ni ukhalha ni achishaana enchi, anoohelha ibarakha mmamatani mwinyu wiira nruwerie choolhia chinchi, idivai ni makhura. Anouvahani ibarakha yo ukhalha ni ing'ope ni ikhondoro chinchi mwiilhaponi mwaalhehilhe aya manyaapwiiya inyu wiira anouvahani mwaattiva. <verse eid="DEU 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 7:14" />Nnoovahiya ibarakha waapwaha attu onkhaye akina velhaponi va. Munlhokoni mwinyu khanowa aakhalha nlhopwana wala nthiyana o uhiyara, ni ata mihuwo chinyu khachinowa chaahiya uyara. <verse eid="DEU 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 7:15" />Apwiiya Nlhuku anoothamihacha mareta onkhaye ni mena khannowereiya mareta o woopiha thoko yaapattilhe inyu Umisri, nansho mareta ayo anokoovahiya amalhaponi inyu. <verse eid="DEU 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 7:16" />Mwalhakalhiheke nikosho nirinoothe, Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu ninohalha aya uhelha mmathathani mwinyu, ni mena nhikelhe mwoonelha ikiriri. Nhithimiche milhuku chaya, kwaani yoyo nlhatu uyo unouwayihani.<verse eid="DEU 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 7:17" />“Nhiwe mweerelhana mwaashineneru wiira, ‘Yalha attu alha ari enchi unipwaha hii, ninohalha wooria chani woomolhacha mwiilhaponi mu?’ <verse eid="DEU 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 7:18" />Nhikelhe mwoova, mwoopuwelheke Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu chenre aya wo waapangelha Nafarao ni ilhapo aya yo Umisri. <verse eid="DEU 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 7:19" />Mwoopuwelheke mariro onne inyu wo miitho inyu, cho ushangiha ni ithikineha chulhupalhe cho wooria wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, chenre aya wo uwookholhani, phi chiichammo chinohalha aya waapanga attu anoova inyu ayo. <verse eid="DEU 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 7:20" />Wo uthepa vavawo, Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu anooruma matendehu munlhokoni mwaya, aalhumakache attu onkhaye anohalha ukulhuphuwa ni wiivitha, wiira athepe woova. <verse eid="DEU 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 7:21" />Paahi etu nhoove, ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ari munlhokoni mwinyu. Yayo phi Nlhuku muulhupalhe o woopiha. <verse eid="DEU 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 7:22" />Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu anowoomolhacha makosho ayo wo ulhikaana ni chinohalha inyu urwaa miholhoholho vakanivakani. Mwaashinene khannoria ulhakalhiha makosho onkhaye ayo nkwaha mmoka, ukhalhawaya mwapangaka chiicho, ashinama o mwiithuphini anowunchereria ni uhuvihani. <verse eid="DEU 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 7:23" />Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, anowaahelha amalhaponi inyu mmathathani mwinyu, ni waapanga ukhalha attu o uthemwathemwa mpaka vanohalha aya waalhakalhiha. <verse eid="DEU 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 7:24" />Anowaahelha mamwene aya mmathathani mwinyu. Nnoowevekacha ni ulhiyalhiya. Khaawo ata ntu mmoka nohalha wooria uchiichihani, mpaka vanohalha inyu waalhakalhihacha onkhaye. <verse eid="DEU 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 7:25" />Mwapahacheke mooro isinyago cho milhuku chaya. Nhikelhe mwamirelha ishenye malhuku aya o isiliva, mena idhahabu chaya, ni mena nhikelhe mwakusha ukhalha chawinyu. Upanga chiicho phi wiiwayiha winyu, ni phi ittu inaarusha chinene Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu. <verse eid="DEU 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 7:26" />Nhiwe mwaakusha ni urweeha umanupani winyu ittu iriyoothe inaarusha Apwiiya Nlhuku. Mweeraka chiicho nnoolhaviya thoko yeyo ittu iyo. Nvengeke ni uheulhacha, ukhalhawaya yeyo phi ittu ilhaviye ni Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="DEU 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DEU 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ilhapo yo urera inohalha inyu ukhalhelha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 8:1" />“Nttwareke iamuri chonkhaye chinouvahaakani lhelho chilha, nttwareke rata wiira nkhalhe akumi ni wunchereria, wiira mwakelhe ni ukhalhelha ilhapo inouvaha ayani Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, yaalhenhe aya manyaapwiiya inyu wiira anowaavaha. <verse eid="DEU 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 8:2" />Muupuwelheke chenre aya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, wo uholhelhani nkwaha wo urekama ulhe, vaavira inyu uthakoni iyaakha makhumi ncheshe, wiira otimarihekeni ni ulhikachani wiira achuwelhe choopuwelha inyu mmamirimani mwinyu, ni yakhalhaka mwanvarechesha malhehero aya, ama kuhiwe. <verse eid="DEU 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 8:3" />Ahoupangani wiira mwiitimarikhe, nkoohiyani wiira mmwolhiye ithalha, ni kaanyuma aya ahoovahani imana wiira nlhieke, yoolhia yaari inyu nhichuwelhaka, mena manyaapwiiya inyu khayaachuwenlhe. Enre chiicho wiira owiittuchiheni wiira, Ntu khanolhama wo nkatte vekha, nansho wo nlhove ninohimiya ni Nlhuku. <verse eid="DEU 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 8:4" />Chechiyo iyaakha makhumi ncheshe chiyo, ikuwo chinyu khachaathakhanlhe, mena mieto chinyu khacheepilhe. <verse eid="DEU 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 8:5" />Ni vavawo, muupuwelheke wiira, Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, anowookolhani thoko naangoro chinomwookolha awe mwaamwanawe. <verse eid="DEU 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 8:6" />Paahi etu, nvarechesheke iamuri cha Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, wiira nttware iphiro chaya ni waathimicha yayo. <verse eid="DEU 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 8:7" />Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, anouwiihani urii ilhapo yorera, ilhapo yo mashepa ni marapo, yo maashi anokhuma umiakoni ni umakooteni, <verse eid="DEU 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 8:8" />ilhapo unolhimiya ingaano ni ishayiri, izabibu, ikhuyu, ikomamanga, izeituni ni waakiya urawo. <verse eid="DEU 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 8:9" />Wowo nnokoopatta choolhia chinchi, ni mena khannowukuwelhiya ittu. Mialha chaya cho iyuuma, ni umiakoni waya nnowooria uthipa ishaaba. <verse eid="DEU 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 8:10" />Nnokoolhia ni urupalhacha, ni nnokowaashukuru Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, wo ilhapo yorera anouvaha ayani.<verse eid="DEU 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waamukiya mwaha wo waalhiyalha Apwiiya Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 8:11" />“Mwoonechesheke wiira, khannaalhiyalha Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, wo uhiya uvarechesha iamuri chaya, ikano chaya ni malhehero aya, anolhehera aka uwannyu lhelho alha. <verse eid="DEU 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 8:12" />Mwalhiaka ni urupalha, nkamwaathekacha manupa orera, ni ukhalha mwommo, <verse eid="DEU 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 8:13" />ni ikatema ing'ope ni ikhondoro chinyu, idhahabu ni isiliva chinyu ni kila ittu irina inyu vanohalha aya wunchereria, <verse eid="DEU 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 8:14" />nhikelhiye itiyamaru ni waalhiyalha Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, othamihilheni ukhuma ilhapo yo Umisri, waari inyu ipotta. <verse eid="DEU 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 8:15" />Phi yayo oholhenlheni uthako muulhupalhe wo woopiha ulhe, wo inwaa cho uhapalha ni makharang'andha, ilhapo yo nttona no maashi ilhe, ahoukumiherani maashi ukhuma vamwalhani. <verse eid="DEU 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 8:16" />Tho, phi yayo olhinheni imana uthakoni, yolhia manyaapwiiya inyu yahaachuwenlhe aya. Enre yayo onkhaye wiira, otimarihekeni ni ulhikachani, ophimeni, awe oovahani moombone vanomalhelha aya. <verse eid="DEU 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 8:17" />Paahi etu, mwiishungeke, nhiwe mweeracha mmamirimani mwinyu wiira, ‘Nipantte nhakhu wo wooria ni machiri ihu naashinene.’ <verse eid="DEU 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 8:18" />Muupuwelheke wiira, Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, phi nowoorihani upatta nhakhu. Anopanga chiicho wo nlhatu no uhimiechesha malhehano aapannge aya ni manyaapwiiya inyu mpaka lhelho va. <verse eid="DEU 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 8:19" />Nansho mwaalhiyalhaka Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ni uttwara milhuku chikina, wiira nkavihere ni uthimicha, kinowaamukani chinene lhelho va wiira wo ikekhiaye nnookhwa. <verse eid="DEU 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 8:20" />Mwaaharumelhelheke Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, nnookhwa thoko makosho anaalhakalhiha aya umihoolho winyu.<verse eid="DEU 8:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DEU 9" />
  <para style="s1">Itiyamaru ya attu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 9:1" />“Mwiiwelhelheke mwaatti attu o Israeli! Lhelho va nhaatameria ulhapuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, nrwee mwakhalhelhe ilhapo ya attu o makosho molhupalhe o machiri uupwahani mwaattiva. Iwani chaya chulhupalhe cho urukureriya ni ingome cho urekama mpaka wiirimu. <verse eid="DEU 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 9:2" />Attu ayo wowo, o urekamacha ni o machiri, Aanaki thoko chinochuwelha inyu, ni chinre inyu wo wiiwa, attu vaakohanacha aya wo wiira, ‘Mpani nohalha weemelha umihoolho waya yayo attu ayo?’ <verse eid="DEU 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 9:3" />Nchuwelheke lhelho wiira, Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu unouholhelhani thoko mooro unopaha miri. Yayo anowaalhakalhiha yayo attu ayo ni waakottolha mwoonaka, paahi etu nnokowoomolhacha ni weevakacha wo nkwaha mmoka, thoko chinre ya wo ulhehani.<verse eid="DEU 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 9:4" />“Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, amalhihaka woomolhacha yayo attu ayo umihoolho winyu, nhiwe mweera mmamirimani mwinyu wiira, ‘Wo nlhatu no ukhalha wihu makhalhelho oombone, phi ittu etu Apwiiya Nlhuku ahoniwiiha uno wiira nikhalhelhe ilha ilhapo ilha’. Mena, Apwiiya Nlhuku oomolhanche mwaatti mwoonaka, ukhalhawaya yayo attu ayo o uwonya. <verse eid="DEU 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 9:5" />Nnokhalhelha ilhapo aya kuhii wo nlhatu no ukhalha attu o nrima woombone ama o mirima chorera, nansho Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, anoomolhacha yayo attu ayo mwoonaka ukhalhawaya attu o uwonya, ni anothanana ushungerera nlhove naahimmie aya wa manyaapwiiya inyu Aburahimu, Naisaka ni Nayakhobo. <verse eid="DEU 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 9:6" />Paahi etu, nchuwelheke wiira Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, khanouvahani ilhapo yorera ilha wiira nkhalhelhe, ukhalhawaya nhophwanelhiya chiicho. Mena, mwaatti attu o itiyamaru.<verse eid="DEU 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 9:7" />“Muupuwelheke ni nhilhiyalhe chenre inyu wo waathunalhiha Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, uthakoni ulhe. Toka nihuku naathamme inyu Umisri, mpaka nihuku naaphilhe inyu va vakittu va, mwaatti nhokhalha mwaarukuwanachaka Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="DEU 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 9:8" />Ata umwaakoni Uhorebu uwo, mwahaathunalhiha Apwiiya Nlhuku, ni ayo ahothunalha chinene, mpaka nkayaathanana ulhakalhihani. <verse eid="DEU 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 9:9" />Vaawenlhe aka umwaakoni upocherani ivibau cho malhuku chaalhepiye iamuri chaalhehenre aya Apwiiya Nlhuku wa inyu mwaatti, kahokhalha wowo mahuku makhumi ncheshe, uthana ni uhiyu, wo uhilhia wala uwuria ittu iriyoothe. <verse eid="DEU 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 9:10" />Yamalhekeru, Apwiiya Nlhuku ahokivaha ivibau piilhi cho malhuku chaalhempe aya Apwiiya Nlhuku anene wo moono aya, chaalhepiye malhove onkhaye ohimenrieni ayani Apwiiya Nlhuku umwaakoni ukhuma umooroni toka nihuku no nkutano nne. <verse eid="DEU 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 9:11" />Eiyo, baada yo yayo mahuku makhumi ncheshe ayo, uthana ni uhiyu, Apwiiya Nlhuku ahokivaha ivibau piilhi cho malhuku chiyo, chaalhempe aya iamuri.<verse eid="DEU 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 9:12" />“Paahi, Apwiiya Nlhuku ahokiirelha wiira, ‘Nthameke, mwaakuvieke nkhuruweke vathi mwaako vawo, ukhalhawaya attu inyu mwaathamihilhe inyu Umisri ahopanga ittu yo unanara. Ahohiya phiyaru iphiro kaalhehenre aka wiira attware, ahokooroshacha isinyago yo uhaniya.’<verse eid="DEU 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 9:13" />“Tho, Apwiiya Nlhuku ahokiirelha wiira, ‘Kihoona alha attu alha, ukhalha attu o itiyamaru chinene, <verse eid="DEU 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 9:14" />nkihiyeke etu kaalhakalhihe, kifute nchina naya velhaponi, ni mii kinoupangani inyuva ukhalha nikosho nulhupalhe, ni no machiri waapwaha yayo.’<verse eid="DEU 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 9:15" />“Paahi, kahorukunuwa, nkakaakhuruwa ukhuma umwaakoni, kinakushilhe ivibau piilhi cho malhuku chilhe, ni uyo mooro waari upharelhaka umwaakoni. <verse eid="DEU 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 9:16" />Kahoweha, nkakaashanga woona wiira wo uhipicha nhohiya iphiro nlheheriye inyu ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ukhalhawaya tayari nheekoroshelha isinyago yo mwaang'ope o uhaniya. <verse eid="DEU 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 9:17" />Paahi etu, kahothesha ivibau piilhi chilhe nkakaarihelha vathi, nkakonthacha umihoolho winyu. <verse eid="DEU 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 9:18" />Nkakaarupa makukhu vathi umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, thoko chaapannge aka mpacho vawo, wo mahuku makhumi ncheshe uthana ni uhiyu, wo uhilhia mena uwuria ittu iriyoothe. Kaapannge chiicho wo nlhatu no uwonya waapangilhe inyu umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, nkamwaathunalhiha. <verse eid="DEU 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 9:19" />Kahoova wiira urushiya ni ichuku ya Apwiiya Nlhuku uwannyu mwaatti, yaanolhakalhihani, nansho Apwiiya Nlhuku ahokiiwelheha tho yoyo nkwaha uyo. <verse eid="DEU 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 9:20" />Ni tho, Apwiiya Nlhuku ahothunalha chinene wo nlhatu ni Naharuni no ukoorosha isinyago yo mwaang'ope o idhahabu, athananaka weeva. Nansho tho, yeyo ikatema kahaalhapelhelha Naharuni, ni ayo Apwiiya Nlhuku ahokiiwelhelha. <verse eid="DEU 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 9:21" />Kahokusha ittu yo unanara ilhe, yaani isinyago yo mwaang'ope mwankoroshilhe inyu ilhe, ni upaha vamooroni. Nkakaanyakathacha ni ushiriria, ni ukhalha thoko ntukurukhu no ushilhia, nkakaarihelha ntukurukhu nno munshepani, nshepa naakhoolha vathi umwaakoni.<verse eid="DEU 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 9:22" />“Tho, mwahaathunalhiha Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, Utabera ulhe, Umasa ni Ukibroth Hataava. <verse eid="DEU 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 9:23" />Ni Apwiiya Nlhuku vorummeni aya ukhuma Ukadesh Barnea yeeraka, ‘Nrweeke mwakhalhelhe ilhapo kuvahilheakani,’ mwahokhotacha. Khamwaarumelhenlhe wala wiiwelhelha malhove ohimenrieni aya alhe. <verse eid="DEU 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 9:24" />Nhokhalha attu o itiyamaru, nhineewelhelha Apwiiya Nlhuku toka nihuku nochuwenlheakani mwaatti nne.<verse eid="DEU 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 9:25" />“Paahi etu, kahorupa makukhu umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku mahuku makhumi ncheshe ayo, uthana ni uhiyu, ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku aari aneenre wiira anoulhakalhihani mwaattiva. <verse eid="DEU 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 9:26" />Kahaalhepelha Apwiiya Nlhuku kiiraka, ‘Inyu Apwiiya Nlhuku, yalha phi attu mwookhonlhe inyu ni waakumiha ilhapo yo Umisri wo wooria ni wo machiri inyu molhupalhe, paahi etu nhaalhakalhihe attu inyu. <verse eid="DEU 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 9:27" />Mwoopuwelhacheke akarumiya inyu, Aburahimu, Naisaka ni Nayakhobo, mena nhilhohe itiyamaru aya, uhilhoka waya ni uwonya wa alha attu alha. <verse eid="DEU 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 9:28" />Mwapangaka chiicho, attu o Umisri, ilhapo inithamihilhe inyu ulhe anowiira, Apwiiya Nlhuku aathaminhe wiira eevakachere uthakoni, ukhalhawaya khoonrie waapiiha ilhapo yaalhenhe aya, ni ukhalhawaya khanaattuna. <verse eid="DEU 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 9:29" />Ukhalhawaya, alha phi attu inyu, attu mwaathamihilhe inyu ukhuma Umisri, wo wooria ni wo machiri inyu molhupalhe.’<verse eid="DEU 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DEU 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ashinna Musa anoopochera iamuri malhehero khumi tho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:1-10">Utt 34:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 10:1" />“Tho, Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaakiirelha wiira, ‘Nhemeke ivibau piilhi cho malhuku thoko cho mpacho chilhe, ni nsanduku no imbau no uthokoreria ivibau chiyo, mwamalhihaka mmweeke uri aka umwaakoni uno. <verse eid="DEU 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 10:2" />Ni mii kinoolhepa vachulhu ivibau chiyo, malhove aalhepiye vachulhu ivibau choothakanche inyu chilhe, yamalhaka nthokorerieke munsandukuni mmo.’<verse eid="DEU 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 10:3" />“Paahi kahokoorosha nsanduku no imbau cho mwiri wo nsonobari ni ivibau piilhi cho malhuku thoko cho mpacho chilhe, nkakaavarelha mmathathani nkakaawelhana umwaakoni. <verse eid="DEU 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 10:4" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaalhepa vachulhu ivibau chiyo malhove thoko aalhempe aya mpacho alhe, iamuri khumi choovanhe ayani voolhumanche aya ukhumehelha vamooroni nihuku no uthukumaniya umwaakoni nne. Amalhihekeru, Apwiiya Nlhuku ahokivaha ivibau chiyo, <verse eid="DEU 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 10:5" />nkakaarukunuwa ni ukhuruwa ukhuma umwaakoni thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku chenre aya wo ukilheehera. Nkakeesha ivibau chiyo munsandukuni mmo thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku chenre aya wo ukilheehera, ni chiyo chiri mwommo.”<verse eid="DEU 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 10:6" />Attu o Israeli aheeta nkwaha wo ukhuma ulhushi wa attu o Uyakaani mpaka Umosera. Vavawo Naharuni ahorihiaa, nkayaavithiya. Naeleazari anaya ayo, ahokhalhelha ihiche aya ni ukhalha phi opochera ishaani. <verse eid="DEU 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 10:7" />Ukhuma wowo, yahorwaa mpaka Ugudgoda, ni ukhuma Ugudgoda ahorwaa mpaka Uyoth Batha, ilhapo yo mashepa menchi o maashi. <verse eid="DEU 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 10:8" />Yeyo ikatema iyo Apwiiya Nlhuku ahaathanlha attu o nikosho ni Alawi akhalhe phi attu o utwiichira Nsanduku no Malhehano a Apwiiya Nlhuku, avare ntheko wo ukhalha opochera ishaani ni o waavaha attu ibarakha mpaka lheho va. <verse eid="DEU 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 10:9" />Phi nhatu etu attu o nikosho ni Alawi khayaapante nipuro no uhiyeriya mwiilhaponi, yayo vamoka ni ashilhoko aya. Ittu iponchere aya iri phi nthimicho wo ukhalha attu opochera ishaani a Apwiiya Nlhuku, thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu chinre aya wo ulheha.<verse eid="DEU 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 10:10" />Yamalheke, ashinna Musa ahothepa uhimia wiira, “Kahokhalha umwaakoni uwo mahuku makhumi ncheshe uthana ni uhiyu, thoko chenre aka mpacho valhe. Apwiiya Nlhuku ahokiiwelhelha tho, ni urumelhelha wiira khanowiivakachani. <verse eid="DEU 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 10:11" />Tho, ahokiirelha wiira, ‘Nthameke nthepeke urwaa nkwaha inyu mwaaholhelhaka attu, wiira oorie ukelha ni ukhalhelha ilhapo yaalhupenlhe aka manyaapwiiya inyu wiira kinowaavaha.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 10:12" />“Vano inyu mwaatti attu o Uisraeli, Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ittu anothanana aya phi ilha: Mwaathimicheke ni uttwara iphiro chaya chonkhaye. Mwaattuneke wo mirima chinyu chonkhaye ni wo minepa chinyu chonkhaye, <verse eid="DEU 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 10:13" />nrumelhelheke iamuri ni malhehero aya, alha anouvahaakani lhelho alha, wo nlhatu winyu mwaashinene. <verse eid="DEU 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 10:14" />Mwooneke, irimu ata irimu cho uchulhu chinene phi chawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ilhapo ni chittu chonkhaye chiriwo chawaya. <verse eid="DEU 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 10:15" />Tho, Apwiiya Nlhuku ahaattuna chinene manyaapwiiya inyu, nkayoothanlhani mwaatti ukhalha achishaana aya, vakittu va attu akina onkhaye thoko chiri aya lhelho va. <verse eid="DEU 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 10:16" />Paahi etu toka lhelho, mwaarumelhelheke Apwiiya Nlhuku, nhikhalhe tho attu o itiyamaru. <verse eid="DEU 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 10:17" />Ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, phi Nlhuku o milhuku ni Athithi a manyaathithi inyu. Yayo phi Nlhuku mulhupalhe o machiri, ni o woopiha, khanommweha ntu wiitho, ni wala khanopochera irushwa. <verse eid="DEU 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 10:18" />Anowaalhoha rata achishaana ohiiya, manyanankhwelhi ni alheto, phi naavaha yolhia ni ikuwo. <verse eid="DEU 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 10:19" />Paahi etu, mwaattuneke alheto ni waakhalhana rata, ukhalhawaya ni inyu mwaatti mwaari alheto chiicho, Umisri. <verse eid="DEU 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 10:20" />Mwaarumelhelheke Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, mwaathimicheke yayo vekha aya. Nvareke mitheko chaya, mwaalhutaaneke ni ulhupelha wo uromolha nchina naya. <verse eid="DEU 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 10:21" />Mwaashipeke yayo, yayo phi Nlhuku inyu oopangenlheni chittu chulhupalhe ni cho woopiha chonne inyu wo miitho inyu mwaashinene chi. <verse eid="DEU 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 10:22" />Manyaapwiiya inyu vaarwelhe aya Umisri, yaari attu makhumi saba. Nansho vano Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ahoupangani mwaatti ukhalha attu enchi thoko ittotwa cho wiirimu.<verse eid="DEU 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DEU 11" />
  <para style="s1">Uyupalhe wa Apwiiya Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 11:1" />“Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu, mwaattuneke Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ni uvarechesha malheheriyo ni iamuri chaya mahuku onkhaye. <verse eid="DEU 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 11:2" />Lhelho muupuwelheke rata ittu yiittuchilhe inyu ukhuma wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. Mwiireke chiicho ukhalhawaya achishaana inyu, khachuwenlhe wala khayoonilhe ntwarusho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, wooria waya ni machiri aya, <verse eid="DEU 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 11:3" />ithikineeha chaya ni cho ushangiha chaya, chaapannge wa Nafarao amwene o Umisri ni ilhapo aya yonkhaye. <verse eid="DEU 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 11:4" />Mwahoona chaapangenlhe aya miphingo cho attu o Umisri, vamoka ni afarasi ni mikukuta chaya cho ikhoto, wo utitimerihiya mbaharini Ushamu, ni chenre aya wo waalhakalhiha attu ottwarani utulhi alhe. <verse eid="DEU 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 11:5" />Tho, muupuwelheke chittu chaapannge aya Apwiiya Nlhuku uwannyu, uthakoni ulhe vaari inyu nhinaaya uphiya vaa. <verse eid="DEU 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 11:6" />Mwaatti muupuwelheke ni chittu chaapangenlhe aya Nadathani ni Naabiramu, achishaana a Naeliabu, aari anaaya Narobeni, ilhapo vaapatakuwilhe aya ni waamiria vamoka ni ashilhoko aya, maheema aya, ashinama aya ni akarumiya aya onkhaye, attu o Israeli onkhaye oonaka. <verse eid="DEU 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 11:7" />Wo ikekhiaye, mwaatti mwahoona wo miitho inyu mitheko chonkhaye chulhupalhe chi, chaapangachilhe aya Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="DEU 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibarakha cho ilhapo ilheehiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 11:8" />“Nrumelhelheke iamuri chonkhaye chinoovahaakani lhelho chi, wiira mwoorie ukelha ni ukhalhelha ilhapo inolhukama inyu, <verse eid="DEU 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 11:9" />wiira mwalhokelhe mahuku menchi yeyo ilhapo yorera ulhima ni uhuwelha mihuwo iyo. Ilhapo yaalhehilhe aya Apwiiya Nlhuku waavaha manyaapwiiya inyu ni iyari chaya. <verse eid="DEU 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 11:10" />Ukhalhawaya ilhapo inokelha inyu ukhalhelha khiri thoko ilhapo yo Umisri ukhumilhe inyu uwo, waalhimilhe inyu choolhia ni upanga ntheko mulhupalhe wo umichera maashi imata chiyo. <verse eid="DEU 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 11:11" />Nansho ilhapo inorwaa inyu ukhalhelha iyo, phi ilhapo yo miako ni yo makoote, ilhapo inotapwihiya ni ipulha yo wiirimu, <verse eid="DEU 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 11:12" />ilhapo Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu inoshunga aya. Apwiiya Nlhuku anoowehaweha yeyo ikatema chonkhaye, toka nchokholha iyaakha mpaka mmalha iyaakha.<verse eid="DEU 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 11:13" />“Paahi, mwavarecheshaka iamuri chaka, chinovahaakani lhelho chilha, ni waattuna Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ni uvara ntheko aya wo nrima winyu wonkhaye ni wo nnepa winyu wonkhaye, <verse eid="DEU 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 11:14" />anoorupiha ipulha ilhapo inyu ikatema aya yaayaka, ntipashilhe ni iyitha, ni inyu nnoruweriacha choolhia chinyu, idivai inyu ni makhura inyu. <verse eid="DEU 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 11:15" />Anoomelhiha manyashi mmamatani mwinyu cho ulhiha mihuwo chinyu, ni inyu chiicho nnokoolhia ni urupalhacha. <verse eid="DEU 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 11:16" />Mwiishungeke, mirima chinyu chihiwe chaathepiachiya, nkamwaarukunuwa ni ukavihera mitheko cho milhuku chikina ni uthimicha, <verse eid="DEU 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 11:17" />Mwapangaka chiicho, urushiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku unouthepelhani. Anoottuka irimu wiira ipulha ihirupe, ilhapo inowuuma ni uhiya umelha mikoko chaya, ni inyu nnookhwacha, inakhalhaka ilhapo yorera inoovaha ayani Apwiiya Nlhuku iyo yorera chinene.<verse eid="DEU 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 11:18" />“Nshungeeheke malhove aka alha mmamirimani mwinyu ni mmaminepani mwinyu. Nttukelheke mmiononi mwinyu thoko ithuphu ni uwara vayuchi winyu, wo uwupushani. <verse eid="DEU 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 11:19" />Mweettuchiheke achishaana inyu alha malhove alha ikatema vanohalha inyu ukhalha mmanupani, kila vanorwaa inyu munkwahani, ama kila vanorwaa inyu urupani, ni kila vanonkwa inyu. <verse eid="DEU 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 11:20" />Nlhepacheke alha malhehero alha vachulhu milhako cho inupa chinyu, ni vachulhu milhako cho ukelha mmawani mwinyu, <verse eid="DEU 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 11:21" />wiira mwaatti ni achishaana inyu nlhokelhe mahuku menchi, aalhenhe aya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, wiira anowaavaha manyaapwiiya inyu, mahuku onkhaye irimu vanohalha aya ukhalha vachulhu ilhapo.<verse eid="DEU 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 11:22" />“Mwarumelhelhaka ni uvarechesha iamuri chonkhaye chinouvahaakani chi, wiira mwaattune Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ni uttwara iphiro chaya chonkhaye ni waalhutaana, <verse eid="DEU 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 11:23" />paahi Apwiiya Nlhuku anowoomolhacha makosho onkhaye ayo umihoolho winyu, ni inyu nnookhalhelha ilhapo yo makosho molhupalhe ni o machiri upwahani mwaatti. <verse eid="DEU 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 11:24" />Kila vakittu vanohalha inyu unyikalha wo mieto chinyu vanookhalha vawinyu, ilhapo inyu inoowanelha ukhuma uthakoni, mpata wo uchawa, mpaka miako cho Ulebanoni, mpata wo uchulhu, ni ukhuma mwoolhoko wo Yufrati urii unosha nchuwa, mpaka ibahari yo Umediteraniya, uneelha nchuwa. <verse eid="DEU 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 11:25" />Khaawo ntu riyoothe nohalha wooria uchiichihani. Vakittu variwoothe vanohalha inyu urwaa uwo, Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, anowoopopiha attu wiira oove, thoko chinre aya wo ulhehera.<verse eid="DEU 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 11:26" />“Mmweheke, lhelho kinouvahani nipesha no uthanlha, variyari wo ibarakha ni ulhaviya, <verse eid="DEU 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 11:27" />ibarakha yakhalhaka nnoovarechesha iamuri cha Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, anouvahaakani lhelho alha, <verse eid="DEU 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 11:28" />ni nnoolhaviya mwaahirumelhelheke iamuri chinolhehera aka chi, ni uhiya iphiro chaya, nkamwaathimicha milhuku chikina chihinapacha inyu uchuwelha. <verse eid="DEU 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 11:29" />Apwiiya Nlhuku vanohalha aya upiihani ilhapo inokelha inyu ukhalhelha iyo, nnokoohimiacha ibarakha ukhuma mwaako wo Ugerizimu, ni ulhaviya ukhuma mwaako wo Uebali. <verse eid="DEU 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 11:30" />Chechiyo miako chiyo chiri ukhopelhelhe mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, uneelhelha nchuwa ilhapo ya attu o Ukanaani, anokhalhacha Uaraba, vakhiviru ni Ugilgali. <verse eid="DEU 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 11:31" />Nnoolhapuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani wiira nkelhe mwakhalhelhe ilhapo inouvaha ayani Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu. Paahi, vanohalha inyu ukelha wowo ni ukhalhelha ilhapo iyo, <verse eid="DEU 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 11:32" />mwakhalheke rata ni uvarechesha iamuri ni malhehero anouvahaakani lhelho alha.<verse eid="DEU 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DEU 12" />
  <para style="s1">Vakittu vo yekha aya vo unlhapelha Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 12:1" />“Anottwara alha phi iamuri ni malhehero anohalha inyu utimiriha wiilhaponi unokelha inyu, uvahiye inyu ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu wiira ikhalhe yawinyu, mahuku inyu onkhaye o ulhokelha winyu vachulhu ilhapo va. <verse eid="DEU 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 12:2" />Wowo mwaphomolhacheke kabisaa mapuro onkhaye unolhapelha aya attu milhuku chaya, vachulhu miako cho urekama ni miako chikani ni mmitholhoni. <verse eid="DEU 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 12:3" />Mwaphomolhacheke madhubahu aya, ni uharariacha mapoto aya. Mwapahacheke mooro isinyago chaya cha nlhuku nthiyana Ashera, ni uparulhacha isinyago chihemanche aya, ni urihelha utayi, wiira nchina naya nihithimichiye tho vavawo vakittu vawo.<verse eid="DEU 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 12:4" />“Ni mena nhaathimiche Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu wo iphiro thoko chinopanga aya yayo attu ayo, wa nlhuku aya. <verse eid="DEU 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 12:5" />Nansho mwarweeke vakittu vanohalha uthanlhiya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, mmakoshoni mwonkhaye wiira attu awaache ni uthimicha nchina naya vavawo vakittu vawo. <verse eid="DEU 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 12:6" />Wowo phi nohalha inyu urweeha isadaka chinyu cho upahiya vamooroni, ni isadaka chikina cho waavaha Apwiiya Nlhuku, izaka chinyu, isadaka cho uttuna winyu ni cho mattara anohalha uyariya ni ing'ope, ipuri ni ikhondoro chinyu. <verse eid="DEU 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 12:7" />Wowo mwalhieke umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ni uteelhiya nrima mwaatti vamoka ni attu o mmawani mwinyu, wo nlhatu no chittu chivaheriye inyu ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu.<verse eid="DEU 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 12:8" />“Yeyo ikatema iyo yaayakaru, nhiwe mwaapanga thoko chinopanga ihu vano, kila ntu nothimicha wo iphiro chinothanana awe mwanene, <verse eid="DEU 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 12:9" />ukhalhawaya khannaaya ukelha mapuro o wiittuwelha winyu ni vakittu vanokelha inyu uvahiya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, nkhalhe wo mpuha. <verse eid="DEU 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 12:10" />Nansho vanohalha inyu ulhapuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani ni ukhalha mwiilhaponi unokelha inyu uvahiya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, wiira ukhalhe wawinyu, ni vanowa inyu wiittuwihiya, nhiwe mwaahuvihachiya ni amalhaponi onkhaye anohalha urukureriani wiira nkhalhache rata. <verse eid="DEU 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 12:11" />Paahi etu wowo, vakittu Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu unohalha aya uthanlha wiira nchina naya nikhalhe wowo, phi vavawo etu vanohalha inyu urweeha kila ittu inoolheheraakani, yaani isadaka chinyu cho upahiya vamooroni, ni isadaka chikina cho waavaha Apwiiya Nlhuku, izaka chinyu, ni isadaka choopenlhe inyu ishaani wiira nnookumiha wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="DEU 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 12:12" />Wowo nnokooteelhiya mirima umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, mwaattiva vamoka na achishaana inyu ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana ni akarumiya inyu ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana, ni Alawi anokhalhacha munlhokoni mwinyu, ukhalhawaya kharina ilhapo aya ashinene munlhokoni mwinyu. <verse eid="DEU 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 12:13" />Mweeshungeke rata nhikelhe mwakumiha isadaka chinyu cho upahiya vamooroni vakittu variwoothe vanohalha inyu woona, <verse eid="DEU 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 12:14" />nansho vakittu vanohalha aya uvahani Apwiiya Nlhuku. Vavawo phi vakittu vanohalha inyu ukumiha isadaka chinyu cho upahiya vamooroni ni upanga chittu chikina cholhehenreakani wiira mpange.<verse eid="DEU 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 12:15" />“Nansho mwaatti nhohiyeriya wiira mwaahitheke ni waakhura ashinama inyu vakittu variwoothe vanothanana inyu, ukhalha phi ibarakha cha Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, chuvahenreayani. Attu onkhaye anorumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku ama ahinorumelhelhiya, akhuureke chechiyo inama chiyo, thoko chinokhuura inyu inama cha anaahe ama cho ipaalha. <verse eid="DEU 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 12:16" />Nansho nhilhie iphome yo yayo ashinama ayo, mwarihelheke iphome aya iyo vathi thoko maashi. <verse eid="DEU 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 12:17" />Tho nhilhelhie mmanupani nnokhalhacha inyu mmo, chi chittu chinottwara chi: Isadaka cho milhipu cho choolhia chinyu, wala yo idivai inyu, ama yo makhura inyu o izeituni, wala cho mattara o ing'ope chinyu, ama o ikhondoro chinyu, ama o ipuri chinyu, ama isadaka chittukenlhe inyu ishaani, ama isadaka chinyu cho uttuna winyu mwaashinene, ama isadaka chikina. <verse eid="DEU 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 12:18" />Nansho mwalhelhieke umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, vakittu vanohalha aya uthanlha Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu ayo vawo. Mwalhieke mwaattiva vamoka ni achishaana inyu ashilhopwana ni achishaana inyu ashithiyana, akarumiya inyu ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana, ni Alawi anokhalha mmawani mwinyu. <verse eid="DEU 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 12:19" />Tho, chonte nhikelha mwaalhiyalha Alawi mahuku onkhaye anohalha inyu ukhalha mwiilhaponi mwinyu.<verse eid="DEU 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 12:20" />“Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu vanohalha aya ukhanulha ilhapo inyu thoko chenre aya wo ulheha, ni inyu nkamweera, ‘Ninothanana ukhuura inama, ukhalhawaya mirima chihu chinoothanana ukhuura inama,’ mwakhuureke etu inama thoko chiriyoothe chinohalha inyu uthanana. <verse eid="DEU 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 12:21" />Paahi etu, vakittu vanohalha aya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu uthanlha wiira nipuro no uthimichelhiya, vavawo phi nohalha inyu uhitha ing'ope ama ikhondoro iriyoothe ivahiye inyu ni Apwiiya Nlhuku, thoko chinre aka wo ulheherani, ni inyu mwalhieke thoko chinothanana inyu, mmawani mwinyu. <verse eid="DEU 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 12:22" />Ntu riyoothe norumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, ama hinorumelhelhiya, nowooria ukhuura yeyo inama iyo thoko chinokhuura inyu inama yo naahe ama yo ipaalha. <verse eid="DEU 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 12:23" />Nansho chonte nhikelha mwalhia iphome, ukhalhawaya iphome phi ukumi, paahi etu nhilhie ukumi vamoka ni inama. <verse eid="DEU 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 12:24" />Nhilhie iphome iyo, nansho nrihelheke vathi thoko maashi. <verse eid="DEU 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 12:25" />Nhilhie iphome, ni inyu nnoovaheriya vamoka ni iyari chinyu, ukhalhawaya nnoopanga ittu yoombone umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="DEU 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 12:26" />Mwakusheke chittu chitakatifu chinohalha inyu ukumiha ni isadaka chinyu cho ishaani, ni urweeha vakittu vanohalha aya uthanlha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="DEU 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 12:27" />Vavawo mwakumiheke isadaka cho upahiya vamooroni, inama ni iphome umadhubahuni wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu. Mwarihelheke vathi vamadhubahuni wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, iphome yo mwannama iyo, nansho inama nhohiyeriya, nkhuureke. <verse eid="DEU 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 12:28" />Mwiishungeke ni uvarelha alha malhove kinoulheheraakani alha, wiira nvaheriye mwaattiva vamoka ni achishaana inyu anowa, wo mahuku o uhimalha, ukhalhawaya nnowa mwaapanga morera ni yo teelhiha umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu.<verse eid="DEU 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Waamukiya mwaha wo ulhapelha isinyago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 12:29" />“Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, amalhihaka ukakhelha utayi makosho o umihoolho winyu, makosho anokelha inyu woomolhacha ayo ni waakumiha, nkamwaakhalha mwiilhaponi mwaya, <verse eid="DEU 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 12:30" />mweeshungeke nhiwe mwaawaya wo nlhatu no waattwara, baada yo uthamihiya umihoolho winyu mwaashinene mwoonaka. Nhikelhe mwakohakoha wo uthanana uchuwelha mwaha wa milhuku chaya, mwiiraka, ‘Alha makosho alha anre chani wo uthimicha milhuku chaya? Wiira ni hii nithimiche thoko chiicho.’ <verse eid="DEU 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 12:31" />Nhikelhe mwaathimicha Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, thoko chiicho, ukhalhawaya kila nrusho nihinottuna aya Apwiiya Nlhuku, yayo attu ayo ahopangacha wo milhuku chaya, ata ahaapahacha vamooroni achishaana aya ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana wiira aakumihe isadaka wo milhuku chaya chiyo.<verse eid="DEU 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 12:32" />“Nshungerereke ni upanga kila ittu ilhehenre aka uwannyu, nhuncherere ittu ama nhiwukulhe ittu.<verse eid="DEU 12:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="DEU 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 13:1" />“Akhumelhelhaka namilhohi, ama ntu o uthaphulha itora munlhokoni mwinyu, owoonihakani ithikineha ni cho ushangiha, <verse eid="DEU 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 13:2" />nkayaakhumelhelha thoko chenre awe chiyo, nkeera, ‘Nittwareke etu milhuku chikina ni uvara mitheko chaya, milhuku chihinapacha inyu uchuwelha’, <verse eid="DEU 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 13:3" />nhiiwelhelhe malhove a yoyo ntu o uthaphulha itora uyo, ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu anaatumia yayo wo nlhatu no ulhikachani wiira achuwelhe yakhalhaka nnowaattuna Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, wo nrima winyu wonkhaye ni wo nnepa winyu wonkhaye. <verse eid="DEU 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 13:4" />Mwaattwareke ni waarumelhelha Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ni uvarechesha iamuri chaya ni wiiwelhelha nlhove naya, mwaathimicheke ni walhutaana. <verse eid="DEU 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 13:5" />Nansho yoyo namilhohi ama ntu o ulhamulha itora uyo eeviyeke. Ukhalhawaya heettuchiha attu ahaarumelhelhe Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, okumihilheni ukhuma Umisri ni uwookholhani ukhuma mpottani, wiira nhiye iphiro yaalhehenre aya wiira nttware. Eeviyeke ukhalhawaya yeyo phi iphiro inohalha inyu uthamiha uwonya munlhokoni winyu.<verse eid="DEU 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 13:6" />“Yakhalhaka munninyu o nthunkwa nimoka, ama mwaamwaninyu mwanlhopwana ama mwanthiyana, ama ahanu inyu anaattuna inyu, ama ampwana inyu, anouthepiachani wo nivitho wiira, ‘Nngwee nathimiche milhuku chikina’ nhichuwenlhe inyu wala uchuwelhiya ni manyaapwiiya inyu, <verse eid="DEU 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 13:7" />ama milhuku chikina cha attu anaatamana inyu, ama milhuku cha attu anokhalha utayi, mpata mmoka wo ilhapo mpaka mpata nkina, <verse eid="DEU 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 13:8" />nhirumelhelhe wowo uthepiachiya uwo, wala nhiiwelhelhe ama umwoonelha ikiriri, wala nhinhiyerere wala umvitha wiira hooniye, <verse eid="DEU 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 13:9" />nansho mmwiiveke. Inyuva nkhalheke o uchokholha umwaata malhuku, ni attu akina onkhaye ayo attwareke. <verse eid="DEU 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 13:10" />Mmwaateke malhuku mpaka akhwe! Ukhalhawaya holhikacha uupurulhani nthame wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, okumihilheni upottani Umisri. <verse eid="DEU 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 13:11" />Paahi vanohalha aya waatiya malhuku ni wiiviya vawo, attu o Israeli onkhaye anowiiwa ni woova, ni mena khanowonya thoko chiicho tho.<verse eid="DEU 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 13:12" />“Vanohalha inyu ukhalhacha mmawani unovahiya inyu ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu mmo, mweewakaru wiira, <verse eid="DEU 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 13:13" />ahaawo attu o uhikhalha marumbo munlhokoni mwinyu, anaathepiacha attu o vavawo, eeraka, ‘Nngwe nathimiche milhuku chikina,’ milhuku chihichuwenlhe inyu, <verse eid="DEU 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 13:14" />paahi mwaaviavieke ni ukoherera rata, yakhalhaka wo ikekhiaye ittu yo uhilhoka ihopangia munlhokoni mwinyu, <verse eid="DEU 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 13:15" />mwalhakalhiheke yeyo iwani iyo. Mweevakacheke wo uphanga attu o yeyo iwani iyo, ni wiivakacha ing'ope chaya wo uphanga chiicho. <verse eid="DEU 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 13:16" />Mwathothokaniheke ikerero chaya chonkhaye va ipuwa wo iwani iyo, ni upaha mooro ukhalha thoko isadaka yo upahiya vamooroni wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ni iwani iyo ikhalheke mathalha mahuku o uhimalha, ihithekiye tho. <verse eid="DEU 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 13:17" />Nhikelhe mwaakusha mmawannyu ittu iriyoothe ilhehenre aya Apwiiya Nlhuku wiira ipahiye vamooroni. Ukhalhawaya mwapangaka chiicho, Apwiiya Nlhuku anoohiya uthunalha waya chinene uwo, anowoonelhani ikiriri, ni uwunchererani chinene thoko chenre aya wo waalheha manyaapwiiya inyu, <verse eid="DEU 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 13:18" />mweewelhelhakaru nlhove na Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu nno, ni uvarechesha iamuri chaya chinouvahaakani lhelho chilha, ni upanga chittu chinothananiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu.<verse eid="DEU 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="DEU 14" />
  <para style="s1">Iphiro chichiichihiye chinaacha mariro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 14:1" />“Mwaatti phi achishaana a Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu. Paahi etu nhiittume veruttuni mena wuuwulha mputhu mmamiuruni mwinyu, ntu vanokhwa awe thoko chinopanga aya attu akina. <verse eid="DEU 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 14:2" />Mwaatti phi attu a Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu. Apwiiya Nlhuku ahouthanlhani mwatti ukhalha attu aya anenene, munlhokoni mwa attu onkhaye anokhalhacha velhaponi va.<verse eid="DEU 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ashinama anoupangani nrumelhelhiye umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 11:1-47">Ala 11:1-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 14:3" />“Nhilhie ittu iriyoothe ihinorumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="DEU 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 14:4" />Ashinama o ukhuura inama chaya phi alha: Ing'ope, ikhondoro, ipuri, <verse eid="DEU 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 14:5" />ipaalha, nachoro, naahe, imbarapi, ittata, imbutuka, <verse eid="DEU 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 14:6" />ni kila mwannama o ikottwa chiparuwilhe velhi, ni nochukhulha, yayo mwaakhureke. <verse eid="DEU 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 14:7" />Nansho nhinkhuure mwannama riyoothe hiparuwilhe ikottwa chawe velhi ni wala khanochukhulha, nhikhure inama yo ingamia, yo hukulha, ama yo ichanga inakhalhaka anoochukhulha, ukhalhawaya ikottwa chaya khachiparuwilhe velhi, yayo uwannyu phi o uhirumelhelhiya. <verse eid="DEU 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 14:8" />Tho, nhikhuure ikulhuwe, ukhalhawaya inakhalhaka ikottwa chaya chihoparuwa velhi, ikulhuwe khachinochukhulha, yayo phi o uhirumelhelhiya uwannyu mwaatti. Nhikhuure inama cho yayo ashinama ayo, ni wala nhivare mitembo chaya.<verse eid="DEU 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 14:9" />“Nkhuureke kila nikosho no ihopa cho mapezi ni cho makakahapa. <verse eid="DEU 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 14:10" />Nansho nhikhuure yo wuupiya iriyoothe yo mmaashini, ihiri ni mapezi wala makakahapa. Mwaakhuuraka yayo khannorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="DEU 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 14:11" />“Mwaakhureke ashinuni onkhaye anorumelhelhiya. <verse eid="DEU 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 14:12" />Nansho nhaakhuure alha ashinuni alha: Iwuku, akapungu, <verse eid="DEU 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 14:13" />akengewa, inaka ni irumaachi cho makosho onkhaye, <verse eid="DEU 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 14:14" />makosho onkhaye a anakhuku, <verse eid="DEU 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 14:15" />imbuni, anakupapara, matipitipi, makosho onkhaye a ashaaka, <verse eid="DEU 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 14:16" />achichi, imumbi, achichi olhupalhe, <verse eid="DEU 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 14:17" />ampicha, miolholho, inderi, anttieku, <verse eid="DEU 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 14:18" />imembe, magolegole, anlhema ni ananthuthu. <verse eid="DEU 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 14:19" />Tho, nhaakhuure ashimweettu onkhaye anovava, aneeta wo mieto micheshe, yayo khanorumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="DEU 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 14:20" />Nansho ashimweettu akina ari ni mapupha, aneeta ni uthupathupha vathi wo mieto micheshe, yayo mwaakhureke.<verse eid="DEU 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 14:21" />“Nhikhuure ichibudu, nansho mwaahiyereke alheto anaakhalhana inyu, akhuureke ama munthumihereke ntu riyoothe o nikosho nikina, ukhalhawaya mwaatti phi inyu attu a Apwiiya Nlhuku ri Nlhuku inyu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 14:21">“Nhimwaapie mwaakhondoro ama mwaapuri wo mapelhe a anumwanawe.<verse eid="DEU 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malhehero o isadaka yo mpatta mmoka wo mipatta khumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 14:22" />“Mweesheke vathetho isadaka cho mpatta wo khumi wo choolhia chiruwenrie inyu mmamatani mwinyu kila iyaakha. <verse eid="DEU 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 14:23" />Mwamalhihaka, nkusheke nrweeke vakittu vathaanlhilhe aya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu wiira mwaathimiche. Wowo, mwalhieke isadaka yo mpatta mmoka wo mipatta khumi wo choolhia chinyu, ni yo idivai inyu, ni yo makhura o izeituni, ni yo inama yo mattara malhopwana o ing'ope ni ikhondoro chinyu chiyo. Mwapangake chiicho wiira mwiittuche waathimicha Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu wo mahuku onkhaye. <verse eid="DEU 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 14:24" />Nansho yakhalhaka wowo uthanlhiye ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu wiira athimichiye uwo, utayi chinene ukhuma uwannyu, ni inyu khannoria ukusha isadaka cho chittu chinyu chivaheriye inyu ni Apwiiya Nlhuku chiyo, paahi etu, <verse eid="DEU 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 14:25" />nthumiheke chittu chinyu chiyo ni ukusha nchurukhu waya uyo mpaka vakittu vathanlhiye ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu vawo. <verse eid="DEU 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 14:26" />Wowo nchurukhu uyo mwathumeke ittu iriyoothe inohalha inyu uthanana, inama yo ing'ope, ama inama yo ikhondoro, inama yo ipuri, ama idivai ama utheka. Mwawurieke ni uteelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, vamoka ni ashilhoko inyu onkhaye.<verse eid="DEU 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 14:27" />“Nansho nhaalhiyalhe Alawi anaakhalhana inyu vamoka munlhokoni mwinyu, yayo kharina ittu mmathathani wala ilhapo ivahiye aya munlhokoni mwinyu. <verse eid="DEU 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 14:28" />Ni kila mmalha iyakha wo iyaakha yo neraru, nkumiheke isadaka yo mpatta mmoka wo mipatta khumi wo choolhia chinyu chonkhaye, ni uthokoreria mmakhupini mmawani mwinyu. <verse eid="DEU 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 14:29" />Chechiyo chinowa ukhalha wo nlhatu na Alawi, ukhalhawaya yayo manyaattu ayo kharina ittu mmathathani wala ilhapo yo uhiyeriya munlhokoni mwinyu. Tho, wo nlhatu no alheto, manyanankhwelhi ni achishaana ohiiya, anokhalhacha mmawani winyu, alhieke ni urupalhacha. Mwiireke chiicho, ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, anouvahani ibarakha mmithekoni nnovara inyu.<verse eid="DEU 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="DEU 15" />
  <para style="s1">Iyaakha yo Wiittuwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 25:1-7">Ala 25:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 15:1" />“Kila mmalha iyaakha wo iyaakha yo saba, mwaahiyerereke attu onkhaye ari ni madeni uwannyu. <verse eid="DEU 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 15:2" />Ilha phi iphiro inowa inyu upanga. Kila ntu nkopihilhe ittu ntu o Israeli nanawe, afuteke n'deni nno, ni wala hilhikache unkohakoha tho, ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku anene phi lhehenre wiira n'deni nno nifutiyeke. <verse eid="DEU 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 15:3" />Nnowooria waakohakoha alheto madeni inyu, nansho nfuteke madeni onkhaye a ashilhoko inyu.<verse eid="DEU 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 15:4" />“Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, anouvahani ibarakha wiilhaponi unokelha aya uuvahani wiira ukhalheke uwannyu. Khaawo ata mmoka nohalha ukhalha nhumaathi munlhokoni mwinyu, <verse eid="DEU 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 15:5" />mwaarumelhelhakaru Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ni mwattwaraka rata malhehero kinouvahaakani lhelho alha. <verse eid="DEU 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 15:6" />Yayo anookhalha chiicho ukhalhawaya, Apwiiya Nlhuku, anouvahani ibarakha thoko chenre aya wo ulhehani. Ni inyu nnoowa mwaakopesha nchurukhu attu o makosho menchi, nansho mwaatti khannowa mwaakopa ittu. Tho, nnoowa mwaatawara attu o makosho menchi, nansho yayo makosho ayo khanowa otawarani mwaattiva.<verse eid="DEU 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 15:7" />“Akhalhakaru ntu nshikini munlhokoni mwinyu, mwiilhaponi unokelha inyu uvahiya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku, nhiwe mwaakhalha ni mirima cho ilhema ni cho ulhipa wa yoyo ntu uyo. <verse eid="DEU 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 15:8" />Nansho mwookolheke miono chinyu, munkopiheke wo uttuna winyu, ittu yulhupalhe thoko chinophavelha aya. <verse eid="DEU 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 15:9" />Mweechinanelheke, nhikelhe mwakhota unkopiha ittu, ukhalhawaya nnoona wiira iyaakha yo saba ihaatameria. Nhihiye wowo uwonya uwo, wala yayo moopuwelho ayo akelhe mmamirimani mwinyu. Ukhalhawaya mwankhotelhaka, yoyo nowooria wonlhelha Apwiiya Nlhuku wo nlhatu winyu ni iyo nkamwoonia wiira nhowonya. <verse eid="DEU 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 15:10" />Mummaheke nlhoko inyu nshikini uyo wo nrima woombone wo uhichukulhacha, ukhalhawaya wo yoyo nlhatu uyo Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, anouvahani ibarakha mmithekoni mwonkhaye nnovara inyu. <verse eid="DEU 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 15:11" />Ukhalhawaya amashikini khanowa aamalha velhaponi, paahi kinoulheherani wiira nkhalheke ni nrima woombone wa attu anohuvelha.<verse eid="DEU 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iphiro cho weeriha ipotta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 21:1-11">Utt 21:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 15:12" />“Yakhalhaka ntu o Israeli naninyu, nowiithumiha uwannyu ukhalha ipotta, ikhalhe mwanlhopwana ama mwanthiyana, avareke ntheko uwannyu iyaakha sita, nansho iyaakha yo saba, munhiyerereke. <verse eid="DEU 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 15:13" />Ni vanohalha inyu unhiyerera vawo, nhinhiye arwaaka mathatharu. <verse eid="DEU 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 15:14" />Mummaheke wo nrima woombone, ittu ivaheriye inyu ni Apwiiya Nlhuku ilhe, ikhondoro, ama choolhia, ama idivai. <verse eid="DEU 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 15:15" />Muupuwelheke wiira ni inyu mwaatti mwaari ipotta Umisri, ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ahowookholhani, phi nlhatu etu ninoulheheraakani lhelho mwiire chiicho.<verse eid="DEU 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 15:16" />“Nansho owiirelhakani, ‘Akinthama vawaninyu va,’ wo nlhatu no uuttunani inyuva ni ashilhoko inyu, ni uthanana ukhalha vamoka ni inyu, <verse eid="DEU 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 15:17" />paahi etu munkusheke mpaka vankhorani, mmwieke ntottelho, muntemulheke nnyaru nawe mpaka ntottelho uyo uperetteke ni uhoma vankhorani vawo. Ni uyo nookhalha ipotta inyu mahuku o uhimalha. Ni chiichammo, mumpangelheke ipotta inyu nthiyana. <verse eid="DEU 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 15:18" />Wala nhoone urikarika unhiyerera ipotta inyu, ukhalhawaya ahovara ntheko inyu iyaakha sita, wo malhivo nusu a karumiya nolhiviya. Mpangeke chiicho ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, anouvahani ibarakha mmithekoni unohalha inyu upanga.<verse eid="DEU 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mattara o ing'ope ni o ikhondoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 15:19" />“Mwaatengeke mattara onkhaye o madume o mmikutironi mwo ing'ope ni ikhondoro chinyu, wo nlhatu no waavaha Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu. Nhivarihe ntheko chechiyo ing'ope chiyo, ni wala nhitupulhe mapururu o chechiyo ikhondoro chiyo. <verse eid="DEU 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 15:20" />Kila iyaakha, mwaakhuureke ashinama ayo umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, vakittu Apwiiya Nlhuku ayo vanohalha aya uthanlha. Mwaakhuureke inyuva mwaanene ni attu o unupani winyu. <verse eid="DEU 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 15:21" />Nansho yoyo mwannama uyo akhalhaka horemara variwoothe, ama akhalhaka o hoona, ama hanaa ittu yo unanara iriyoothe yulhupalhe, nhinkumihe isadaka wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu. <verse eid="DEU 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 15:22" />Mwaakhuureke yayo ashinama uyo uwannyu vanohalha inyu ukhalha. Tho, attu onkhaye anorumelhelhiya ni ahinorumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, anowooria ukhuura yayo ashinama ayo thoko chinokhuura inyu inama yo naahe ni yo ipaalha. <verse eid="DEU 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 15:23" />Nansho nhilhie iphome aya, nansho yeyo nrihelheke vathi thoko maashi.<verse eid="DEU 15:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="DEU 16" />
  <para style="s1">Nihuku no uttapelhelhiya Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 12:1-20">Utt 12:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 16:1" />“Nttapelhelheke mweeri wa Habibu ni unlhia Pasaka wo waathimicha Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu. Ukhalhawaya yoyo mweeri uyo, Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu ahouthamihani Umisri uhiyu. <verse eid="DEU 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 16:2" />Mmweeke mwaakumiha isadaka yo nihuku no Pasaka ukhuma mmikutironi mwo mihuwo chinyu cho ikhondoro ama cho ing'ope wo waathimicha Apwiiya Nlhuku vakittu vanohalha aya uthanlha Apwiiya Nlhuku wiira nchina naya nikhalhe vavawo. <verse eid="DEU 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 16:3" />Nhilhie yeyo isadaka iyo ni mikatte chihelhiye ihengedure iyo, ni chiyo phi mikatte chineehaniya mikatte cho ntwarusho, ukhalhawaya mwaakhumme Umisri wo waakuviacha. Paahi etu ikatema yonkhaye inohalha inyu ukhalha muupuwelheke nihuku naathamilhe inyu Umisri, waahuva inyu nne. <verse eid="DEU 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 16:4" />Wo mahuku saba, ntu riyoothe mwiilhaponi mwinyu heeshe ihengedure unupani wawe. Ni inama yo mwannama hithiye uchechilho nihuku no uchokholha iyo, ihihalhihiye mmithe mpaka wichishu waya.<verse eid="DEU 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 16:5" />“Mwaahitheke ashinama o isadaka yo Pasaka vawani variwoothe unouvaha ayani Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, <verse eid="DEU 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 16:6" />nansho mwakumihereke vakittu vanohalha aya uthanlha Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, wiira mwaathimiche. Vavawo phi vanohalha inyu waakumihera isadaka iyo, uchechilho, nchuwa vanohalha aya wiilha ikatema thoko yelhe yaathamme inyu Umisri ilhe. <verse eid="DEU 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 16:7" />Mwaapieke inama iyo ni ukhuurelha vakittu vanohalha aya uthanlhiya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, wiira mwaathimiche. Ni waashakaru, nrukunuweke nhokolhieke mmapuroni winyu. <verse eid="DEU 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 16:8" />Wo mahuku sita nlhieke mikatte chihihelhiye ihengedure, ni nihuku no saba mweesheke nkutaano muulhupalhe wo waathimicha Apwiiya Nlhuku, ni vavawo nhiwe mwaapanga ntheko uriyoothe nenno nihuku nno.<verse eid="DEU 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isikukuu yo ukhunguriya choolhia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:22">Utt 34:22</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Ala 23:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 16:9" />“Mwaalhakelheke majuma saba, nchokholhelhaka nihuku ninochokholha inyu ukhungura choolhia, <verse eid="DEU 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 16:10" />ni tho, mmweeke mwaattapelhelha isikuukuu yo majuma iri phi isikukuu yo uchokholha ukhunguriya choolhia, wo ukumiha isadaka yo uttuna winyu mwaashinene, inohalha inyu ukumiha thoko chivaheriye inyu ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu. <verse eid="DEU 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 16:11" />Mmweeke mwaattapelhelha umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, mwaattiva mwaashinene ni achishaana inyu ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana, ashikarumiya inyu, Alawi, manyaalheto o makosho makina, manyanankhwelhi ni achishaana ohiiya, anokhalhacha vamoka ni inyu. Mpangeke yayo vakittu vanohalha aya uthanlha Apwiiya Nlhuku wiira athimichiye. <verse eid="DEU 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 16:12" />Mmweeke mwoopuwelha wiira ni inyu mwaatti mwaari ipotta Umisri ulhe, paahi etu mwiiwelhelheke rata ni uttwara alha malhehero alha.<verse eid="DEU 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isikukuu yo marapatta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:33-43">Ala 23:33-43</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 29:12-39">Waal 29:12-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 16:13" />“Mwamalhihaka weepetta choolhia chinyu chonkhaye ni waamakacha izabibu chinyu, mmweeke mwaattapelhelha isikukuu yo marapatta wo mahuku saba. <verse eid="DEU 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 16:14" />Mmweeke mwaattapelhelha umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, mwaattiva mwaashinene ni achishaana inyu ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana, ashikarumiya inyu, Alawi, manyaalheto, manyanankhwelhi ni achishaana ohiiya, anokhalhacha vamoka ni inyu. <verse eid="DEU 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 16:15" />Wo mahuku saba mmweeke mwaapangelha Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu isikukuu vakittu vanohalha aya uthanlha wiira athimichiye. Ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, anouvahani ibarakha wo choolhia chinyu chonkhaye, ni wo ikekhiaye nnoowa mwaateelhiya.<verse eid="DEU 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 16:16" />“Kila nlhopwana munlhokoni mwa attu o Israeli aweeke umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, mikwaha miraru kila iyaakha, vakittu vanohalha aya uthanlha wiira athimichiye vawo. Nihuku no isikukuu yo Pasaka, isikukuu yo ukhunguriya choolhia ni isikukuu yo marapatta. Nansho hiwe aarwaa umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku mathatharu. <verse eid="DEU 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 16:17" />kila ntu akumiheke thoko chinohalha awe wooria wo ulhikaana ni ibarakha chivaheriye awe ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu.<verse eid="DEU 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Waamulhiya milhatu cha attu wo ikekhiaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 16:18" />“Mwaathanlheke attu o waamulha milhatu ni attu o ipilhi akina, o ukhuma mmakoshoni mwinyu ni mmawani mwinyu mmo, nnohalha aya uuvahani Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ni ayo avareke ntheko wo waamulha milhatu cha attu wo ikekhiaye. <verse eid="DEU 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 16:19" />Nhirukunushe ikekhiaye, nhimmwehe ntu wiitho, ni mena nhipochere ittu ukhuma wa ntu. Ukhalhawaya irushwa inootiyelhelha miitho a attu o irusho ihoonie ikekhia, ni ukukureha milhatu cha ntu o makhalhelho oombone. <verse eid="DEU 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 16:20" />Nvarechesheke ikekhiaru, wiira nkhalhe ni uvarelha rata ilhapo inohalha inyu uvahiya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu iyo.<verse eid="DEU 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 16:21" />“Vanotheka inyu madhubahu a Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, nheemeshe nipoto no mwiri uriyoothe wiira ukhalhe phi nipoto na nlhuku nthiyana o woothachiya, Ashera. <verse eid="DEU 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 16:22" />Tho, mena nheemeshe nipoto no malhuku wo nlhatu no uthimicha. Mwapangaka chiicho, Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, anoorushiya.<verse eid="DEU 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="DEU 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 17:1" />“Nhaakumihere Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu isadaka yo ing'ope, ama ikhondoro, ama ipuri yo uremara ihinaateelhiha, ukhalhawaya yeyo phi ittu inaarusha Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu.<verse eid="DEU 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 17:2" />“Mweewakaru wiira iwani imoka munlhokoni mwinyu nlhopwana ama nthiyana howonya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ni uhiya malhehano aya, <verse eid="DEU 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 17:3" />wo uthimicha ni ukavihera milhuku chikina, ama nchuwa, ama mweeri, ama ittotwa cho wiirimu, ama chittu chikina chihilhehenre aka wiira chithimichiye. <verse eid="DEU 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 17:4" />Yakhalhaka etu mwaatti nheewa yoyo mwaha uyo, nkohakoheke etu rata chene. Yooniaka wo ikekhiaye wiira hopanga chiicho, mwiilhaponi mwa attu o Uisraeli, <verse eid="DEU 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 17:5" />paahi munkusheke yoyo nlhopwana uyo ama yoyo nthiyana wonnye uyo mpaka vachereshere iwani inyu iyo, mwamwaateke malhuku mpaka akhweeke. <verse eid="DEU 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 17:6" />Nansho eeviyeke vari attu eelhi ama araru, o woonechesha, hiiviye wo woonecheshiya ni ntu mmoka vekha aya. <verse eid="DEU 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 17:7" />Attu o woonechesha ayo akhalheke phi o uchokholha umwaata malhuku ntu uyo wiira akhwe, ni vavawo attwareke attu akina. Vavawo etu, phi nohalha inyu umalhiha mwaha wo uwonya thoko yolha munlhokoni mwinyu.<verse eid="DEU 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 17:8" />“Vanowooria ukhalha milhatu cho urikarika chinene chihinooria inyu waamulha mmawaani mwinyu, thoko cho wiivananiya, ama wiiva wo uhilhakelha, ama urakalhihaniya, ama milhatu cho mwaha wo nhakhu wa ntu, paahi nkusheke chechiyo milhatu chiyo, nrweeke mpaka vakittu vathanlhiye ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu. <verse eid="DEU 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 17:9" />Wowo etu, nrweeheke wa opochera ishaani ari Alawi, ni wa o waamulha milhatu anovara ntheko wo waamulha attu yeyo ikatema iyo. Mwaahimiachereke, ni ayo anokoohukumulha yoyo nlhatu uyo. <verse eid="DEU 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 17:10" />Yamalhaka, mwapangeke thoko chinre inyu wo ulheheriya, vavawo vakittu vathanlhiye ni Apwiiya Nlhuku vawo. Nansho mwapangeke rata, thoko chinre inyu wo uhimeriya wiira mwapange chiyo. <verse eid="DEU 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 17:11" />Mwapangeke wo ikekhiaye thoko chinohalha aya ulheherani. Nhiwe mwaarukunuwa malhove anohalha aya ulheherani ayo. <verse eid="DEU 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 17:12" />Ntu riyoothe nohalha uvaanyiha chinohimiya ni opochera ishaani, ama attu o waamulha milhatu anovara ntheko yeyo ikatema iyo, yoyo ntu uyo eeviyeke. Vavawo etu, phi nohalha inyu umalhiha mwaha wo uwonya thoko yolha munlhokoni mwinyu. <verse eid="DEU 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 17:13" />Attu onkhaye anowiiwa ni woova, ni wala khanopanga tho ittu yo uhilhoka.<verse eid="DEU 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malheheriyo anaacha amwene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 17:14" />“Vanohalha inyu ukelha wiilhaponi unovahiya inyu ni Apwiiya Nlhuku wiira ikhalhe yawinyu, ni ukhalha mwommo, nkamweera wiira, ‘Nimmareke nchina mwene, thoko chiri aya attu o ilhapo chikina chinonirukureria,’ <verse eid="DEU 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 17:15" />mwanvareke nchina etu ntu nohalha uthanlhiya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu. Yoyo akhumeke munlhokoni mwa attu o Israeli naninyu. Nhiwe mwanvara nchina nlheto, wiira akhalhe mwene inyu, ntu hikhumme munlhokoni mwinyu. <verse eid="DEU 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 17:16" />Tho, yayo amwene ayo ahiwe aahuwa afarasi enchi, ama ahiwe eerelha attu wiira ahokolhie Umisri arwee aakushe afarasi akina enchi, ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku ahowiirelhani wiira, ‘Nhiwe mwaahokholhia tho wowo.’ <verse eid="DEU 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 17:17" />Ni wala ahiwe aakhalha ni manyaahanu enchi, apangaka chiicho etu nrima aya unowa ukelhiya itiyamaru, ni uhiya iphiro cha Apwiiya Nlhuku. Ni tho, ahiwe eeshungera nhakhu mwinchi wo malhuku o ifedha ama idhahabu. <verse eid="DEU 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 17:18" />Vanohalha aya ukhalhelha ihiche yo umwene vawo, alhepeke ikitabu yo alha malhehero alha, o ukhuma nhina ikitabu yo iamuri inoshungiya ni opochera ishaani arii Alawi. <verse eid="DEU 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 17:19" />Akhalhaneke yeyo ikitabu iyo, eeshomelheke kila nihuku vakittu vanokhalha aya, wiira eettucheke iphiro yoombone yo waathimicha Apwiiya Nlhuku aya, ni uttwara rata malhove onkhaye anolheheriya ni iamuri, ni ikekhia ilha. <verse eid="DEU 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 17:20" />Apangaka chiicho, khanowa eewelhiha aneneru, ni wiichoona wiira phi oombone waapwaha attu o Israeli akina, ni uhiya vathetho malhehero alha wo iphiro iriyoothe. Paahi etu anoolhokelha mahuku menchi muutawarani mwaya, anene ayo ni achishaana aya mwiilhaponi mwa attu o Israeli mmo.<verse eid="DEU 17:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="DEU 18" />
  <para style="s1">Isadaka cho uvahiya opochera ishaani ni Alawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 18:1" />“Opochera ishaani Alawi, yaani nikosho nonkhaye na Alawi ahivahiye vakittu variwoothe mwiilhaponi mwa attu o Israeli. Yayo anohalha ukhulhuvelha mipata cho isadaka chinokumuheriya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, <verse eid="DEU 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 18:2" />ni wala ahikhalhe ni ilhapo yo ukhalha yawaya, thoko chiri aya wa attu akina munlhokoni mwa attu o Israeli. Apwiiya Nlhuku phi nohalha waavaha mahalha aya thoko chaalhehilhe aya.<verse eid="DEU 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 18:3" />“Attu vanohalha aya ukumiha isadaka aya yo ing'ope ama ikhondoro, mahalha o uvahiya opochera ishaani akhalheke: Mweto wo uhoolho, marama ni chittu cho mmirimani. <verse eid="DEU 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 18:4" />Mwaavaheke milhipu cho choolhia chinyu, idivai, makhura o izeituni, ni mapururu anochokholha utupulhiya o ikhondoro chinyu. <verse eid="DEU 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 18:5" />Mmakoshoni mwinyu mwonkhaye, Apwiiya Nlhuku ahothanlha nikosho na Alawi nikhalhe phi opochera ishaani mahuku o uhimalha.<verse eid="DEU 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 18:6" />“Yakhalhaka Nlawi riyoothe nokhalha iwani iriyoothe mu Israeli noottuna mwaneneru uthama, nowooria uthama ni urwaa vakittu vakina vathanlhiye ni Apwiiya Nlhuku wiira athimichelhiye, <verse eid="DEU 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 18:7" />ni wowo nowooria uvara ntheko wo opochera ishaani a Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku awe thoko Alawi akina chinovara aya ntheko umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku alhe. <verse eid="DEU 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 18:8" />Apatteke mipatta chaya cho choolhia thoko chinopatta aya opochera ishaani akina, ni ashungeke ittu iriyoothe inorweehelhiya aya ni ashilhoko aya.<verse eid="DEU 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Waamukiya uhiya iphiro chihinottuna awe Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 18:9" />“Vanohalha inyu uphiya mwiilhaponi unovahiya inyu ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, nhiwe mwaattwara iphiro cho urushiha chinopanga aya attu o chechiyo ilhapo chiyo. <verse eid="DEU 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 18:10" />Hikhalhe ntu riyoothe munlhokoni mwinyu nonkumiha mwaamwanawe ukhalha isadaka yo upahiya vamooroni, ni wala hikhalhe ntu o moopa nttiti, wala ntu o waavitulha akhwiri, wala ntu o ulhohera chittu, <verse eid="DEU 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 18:11" />ama ntu o ulhwaa, wala nkhwiri, ama o wuulhumacha ni minepa, ama ni mashoka o unanara, ama attu akhwilhe. <verse eid="DEU 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 18:12" />Ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku anonvenga ntu riyoothe nopanga chechiyo, phi nlhatu etu ninoomolhacha aya makosho onkhaye mwiilhaponi urii umihoolho winyu. <verse eid="DEU 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 18:13" />Nansho nkhalheke attu o wiitimarikha umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu.”<verse eid="DEU 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malhehano o uvahiya namilhohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 18:14" />Yamalheke ashinna Musa ahothepa wiira, “Ilhapo inokelha inyu ukhalhelha iyo, attu aya anottwara iphiro cha attu o mwoopa nttiti ni iphiro cha attu o miruchi, nansho Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu khanoohiyererani mwaatti wiira mpange chiicho.<verse eid="DEU 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 18:15" />“Nansho Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, anonruma namilhohi rii thoko mii, o ukhuma munlhokoni mwa Aisraeli naninyu, ni inyu munrumelhelheke yoyo.<verse eid="DEU 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 18:16" />“Ukhalhawaya nihuku naathukumanne inyu umwaakoni Usinai, mwaholhepelha wo wiira, ‘Khaninottuna wiiwa tho nlhove na Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku ihu, ni mena nihoone tho ulha mooro muulhupalhe ulha, nihiwe naakhwa!’ <verse eid="DEU 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 18:17" />Paahi Apwiiya Nlhuku ahokiirelha wiira, ‘Ahoolhumacha ittu yo ikekhiaye. <verse eid="DEU 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 18:18" />Kinonruma etu mmilhokoni mwaya namilhohi thoko inyuva, kinohalha aka ummaha malhove, ni uyo noohimiacha kila ittu inohalha aka unlhehera. <verse eid="DEU 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 18:19" />Yoyo nowuulhumacha wo ikuru aka, ni Mii kimwanene kinontwarusha ntu riyoothe, hinohalha wiiwelhelha malhove anohalha awe wuulhumacha yoyo namilhohi uyo. <verse eid="DEU 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 18:20" />Nansho yakhalhaka namilhohi riyoothe nowuulhumacha ittu wo nchina naka, ittu kihinamwiirelha aka wiira oolhumache, yoyo eeviyeke wo yoyo nlhatu uyo. Ni anamilhohi akina anohalha wuulhumacha ittu wo nchina no milhuku chikina, ni ayo eeviyeke.’<verse eid="DEU 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 18:21" />“Nnowooria mwaattiva ushanga ni wiira, nnohalha wooria chani uchuwelha nlhove nihikhumme wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="DEU 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 18:22" />Paahi etu, yakhalhaka namilhohi nowiipanga wiira nohimiacha ittu wo ikuru ya Apwiiya Nlhuku, ni ittu iyo ihikhumelhelhaka, yeyo ittu iyo khayaahimiye ni Apwiiya Nlhuku. Yoyo namilhohi uyo ahowiiraka uhimiacha wo ikuru awe mwanene, ni inyu mwaatti nhimwoove yoyo ntu uyo.”<verse eid="DEU 18:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="DEU 19" />
  <para style="s1">Iwani cho uttawelhelha attu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 35:9-34">Waal 35:9-34</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 20:1-9">Nayos 20:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 19:1" />“Yamalhaka baada ya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu waalhakalhiha attu o ilhapo inovaha ayani ayo, ni mwamalhaka uvarelha ni ukhalha mmanupani mwaya, <verse eid="DEU 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 19:2" />mwatengeke iwani ttaaru wowo wiilhaponi unokelha inyu uvahiya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu uwo. <verse eid="DEU 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 19:3" />Mwamalhihaka, mwamianiheke vararu, kila vakittu vakhalheke ni iwani inohalha awe ntu uphiya wo uhihuvahuva, wiira ntu nomwiiva nkhunanawe oorieke uttawelha wowo ni waakiha ukumi awe. <verse eid="DEU 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 19:4" />Yakhalhaka ntu noomwiiva nkhunanawe wo uhilhakelha, hirii mmalhaponi awe khalhayi vawo, attawelheke imoka yo chechiyo iwani chiyo, wiira ookholhe ukumi awe. <verse eid="DEU 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 19:5" />Wo ulhikaaniha, niireke wiira, yakhalhaka ntu noorwaa wiithuphini ni nkhunanawe uuremani ikhuni, ni vanokakha awe mwiri vawo, ipacho inowiikhulha mumminini mwaya nkayaamwiiva ntu nkina ulhe. Ntu thoko yoyo nowooria uttawa nkaarwaa uukhalhani iwani imoka aya wiira ookholhe ukumi awe. <verse eid="DEU 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 19:6" />Nansho yakhalhaka iwani yaari imoka tu, ni iyo yaari utayi chinene, paahi ntu o ulhivelhelhiha nowooria wo urushiya wawe unttwara wowo. Ammareke ni umwiiva yoyo mmwiihilhe nokhwa uyo, inakhalhaka kaahumukumulhiye ukhwa, ni wala yayo eelhi ayo khayaari avenganaka khalhayi vawo! <verse eid="DEU 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 19:7" />Paahi etu phi nlhatu ninoulheheraakani wiira ntengeke iwani ttaaru.<verse eid="DEU 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 19:8" />“Tho yakhalhaka Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu anookhanulha miinano cho ilhapo inyu, thoko chaalhehiye aya ni manyaapwiiya inyu, ni ayo nkayoovahani ilhapo yonkhaye yaalhenhe aya waavaha manyaapwiiya inyu, paahi etu mwoncherereke iwani ttaaru chikina wo uthepa chi iwani ttaaru chi. <verse eid="DEU 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 19:9" />Anokouvahani ilhapo iyo mwaavarechesha malhehero onkhaye anoulheherakani lhelho alha, nkamwaattuna Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu ni uttwara iphiro chaya mahuku onkhaye. <verse eid="DEU 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 19:10" />Mwatengeke chechiyo iwani chiyo, wiira ntu hittenke hiwe eeviya wiilhaponi unokelha inyu uvahiya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu wiira ukhalhe wawinyu, nkamwaareiya milhatu cho nookhwa.<verse eid="DEU 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 19:11" />“Nansho ntu akhalhaka mmalhaponi a nkhunanawe, nkaamwiithelha, nkaamwaatakacha ni umwiiva, nkaattawelha imoka yo chechiyo iwani chiyo, <verse eid="DEU 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 19:12" />vavawo ashulhupalhe o yeyo iwani iyo aarumeke attu ammareke wowo, ni ummwiiha wa attu o ulhivelhelhiha nlhatu wo urihia iphome, wiira eeviye. <verse eid="DEU 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 19:13" />Nhimwoonelhe ikiriri yoyo, vavawo etu phi nohalha inyu umalhiha uwonya wo wiiviya attu ahittenke mwiilhaponi mu Israeli, wiira nkhalhe wo mpuha.<verse eid="DEU 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Miinano cho khalhayi chinene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 19:14" />“Vanohalha inyu ukelha ilhapo inovahiya inyu ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ikhalhe yawinyu uwo, nhikelhe mwakhulha ikhomo cho miinano cha amwaatamana inyu, cheeshiye ni Apwiiya Nlhuku toka khalhayi, ikatema ya manyaapwiiya inyu.<verse eid="DEU 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwaha unaacha attu o uhimiechesha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 19:15" />“Uhimiechesha wa ntu mmoka khunthosha unhukumulha ntu mwaha wo nlhatu wawe uriyoothe wo uwonya, ama wo utteka upannge awe. Uhimiechesha wa attu eelhi ama araru veekha aya phi nohalha wiiwelhelhiya. <verse eid="DEU 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 19:16" />Yakhalhaka ntu noohimiechesha wo woothacha, ni umwootheria ntu riyoothe nlhatu uriyoothe, <verse eid="DEU 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 19:17" />paahi yoyo mwanene uyo ni ntu otheriye milhatu uyo, arweeke umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, ni umihoolho wa attu opochera ishaani, ni wa attu o waamulha milhatu arii munthekoni yeyo ikatema iyo. <verse eid="DEU 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 19:18" />Attu o waamulha milhatu ayo awehaweheke rata yoyo nlhatu uyo, ni yakhalhaka ntu o uhimiechesha uyo nohimiechesha wo woothacha, noomwootheria nkhunanawe milhatu cho woothiya, <verse eid="DEU 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 19:19" />paahi yoyo atwarushiyeke ntwarusho waathananiya utwarushiya ntu ootheriye uyo. Yeyo phi iphiro inohalha inyu umalhiha mwaha wo uwonya thoko yolha munlhokoni mwinyu. <verse eid="DEU 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 19:20" />Ni kila ntu nowiiwa ni woova, ni uwonya thoko yoyo khunowa waakhumelhelha tho munlhokoni mwinyu. <verse eid="DEU 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 19:21" />Nhoonelhe ikiriri attu thoko yayo! Ukumi unowa ulhiviya wo ukumi, ni niitho wo niitho, niino wo niino, moono wo moono ni mweto wo mweto.<verse eid="DEU 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="DEU 20" />
  <para style="s1">Mwaha unaacha ikhoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 20:1" />“Mwarwaaka uwaatakanani ikhoto ni amalhaponi inyu, nkamwoona afarasi, mikukuta cho ifarasi, ni miphingo chulhupalhe cho anakhoto uupwahani mwaattiva, nhoove. Ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu okumihilheni Umisri, anookhalha vamoka ni inyu mwaatti. <verse eid="DEU 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 20:2" />Nhinaaya uchokholha waatakana ikhoto, opochera ishaani eemelheke uhoolho ni weerelha manyaasikari ayo wiira, <verse eid="DEU 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 20:3" />‘Mwaatti, attu o Israeli nkeewani! Lhelho nhaatameria uchokholha waatakana ikhoto ni amalhaponi inyu. Nhikhwe nrima, wala nhoove, ama nhoopopihiye ni amalhaponi inyu ayo, <verse eid="DEU 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 20:4" />ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, phi nohalha uuttukanani mwaati mwaatakane ikhoto ni amalhaponi inyu, ni waakottolhacha.’<verse eid="DEU 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 20:5" />“Yamalhaka vavawo, manyaahoolhelhi o miphingo eerelheke attu wiira, ‘Chani haawo ntu munlhokoni mwinyu mu, thekilhe inupa nansho khanaaya ukelha? Yoyo ahokolhieke etu uwani, hiwe aakhwelha ukhotoni ni ntu nkina nkaalhipulha inupa iyo. <verse eid="DEU 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 20:6" />Tho, chani haawo ntu riyoothe vaa, aanlhe izabibu ni uyo khanalhia milhipu? Yoyo ahokolhieke etu uwani, hiwe aakhwelha ukhotoni ni ntu nkina nkaalhipulha izabibu chiyo. <verse eid="DEU 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 20:7" />Ama haawo nlhopwana riyoothe vaa, nvekilhe mwanthiyana ni uweherera wiira eeshiye ichitamo? Yoyo ahokolhieke etu uwani, hiwe aakhwelha ukhotoni ni nlhopwana nkina nkanthelha nthiyana nvekilhe awe uyo.’<verse eid="DEU 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 20:8" />“Manyaahoolhelhi ayo athepeke weerelha attu wiira, ‘Chani, haawo vaa, ntu khwilhe nrima? Yoyo ahokolhieke etu uwani, hiwe aakwiiha nrima ashikhunanawe, thoko chikhwilhe awe nrima mwanene uyo.’ <verse eid="DEU 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 20:9" />Attu o ipilhi ayo amalhihaka woolhumana attu, paahi aathanlheke ahoolhelhi o miphingo o waahoolheha attu.<verse eid="DEU 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 20:10" />“Vanokelheha inyu iwani waatakana ikhoto, mwoolhumaneke thoko attu o vavawo ayo, yakhalhaka ari tayari uhiya ikhoto ahinaaya waatakana ni inyu mwaatti? <verse eid="DEU 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 20:11" />Attu o yeyo iwani iyo, arumelhelhaka ni uthanana wiiwaanana, paahi attu onkhaye arii mwommo ayo, mwaavaheke ntheko wo utumikelhani. <verse eid="DEU 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 20:12" />Nansho akhotaka uwiiwananani, nkaathanlha waatakana ikhoto, paahi mwarukurerieke ni utiyelhelha yeyo iwani aya iyo, <verse eid="DEU 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 20:13" />ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu ahelhaka iwani iyo mmathathani mwinyu, ni waakottolha, mwaakhapacheke wo uphanga manyaalhopwana onkhaye ni weevakacha. <verse eid="DEU 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 20:14" />Nansho mwaavareke mateeka manyaathiyana ni achishaana aya, mihakhu chaya, mihuwo ni chittu chonkhaye vawani vawo, mwakusheke chikhalheke chawinyu mwaashinene, mweepuhiheke, nhovahiya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu. <verse eid="DEU 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 20:15" />Phi chiichammo chinohalha inyu waapangelha attu o iwani chonkhaye chiri utayi chiyo, toka ilhapo inohalha inyu ukhalhacha mwaatti.<verse eid="DEU 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 20:16" />“Nansho vanohalha inyu uvara iwani wowo mwiilhaponi nnohalha inyu uvahiya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, mweeveke kila ntu, nhikelhe mwaahalhiha ittu iriyoothe. <verse eid="DEU 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 20:17" />Mwaalhalhiheke attu onkhaye: Ahiti, Aamori, Akanaani, Aperizi, Ahivi ni Ayebusi, thoko chinre aya wo ulheeherani Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, <verse eid="DEU 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 20:18" />wiira ahiwe owiittuchihani iphiro chaya cho uhilhoka chaapannge aya wo milhuku chaya, ni inyu mwaatti nkamwaawonya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu.<verse eid="DEU 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 20:19" />“Vanohalha inyu urukureria ni utiyelhelha iwani iyo wo mahuku menchi, nkamwaatakana ni ukottolha, nhiwe mwaakakha miri cho maphepu. Chani miri chihokhalha attu mpaka mmulhushache? Nhikakhache, ukhalhawaya nnowooria ulhia maphepu o chechiyo miri chiyo. <verse eid="DEU 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 20:20" />Mwawulhusheke tu miri chikina, wiira chuukavihereni vanorukureria inyu ni utiyelhelha iwani iyo mpaka vanohalha inyu ukottolha.<verse eid="DEU 20:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="DEU 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ntu eeviye wo uhichuwania wiira eeviye ni apani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 21:1" />“Mwamphwanyaka ntu neeviye ni urihelhiya mmatani wiilhaponi unovahiya inyu ni Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu uwo, wo uhichuwania wiira eeviye ni apani, <verse eid="DEU 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 21:2" />paahi etu ashulhupalhe ni attu o waamulha milhatu inyu arweeke aphimeke urekama uri varii ntembo uyo ni iwani chirii vakhiviru chiyo. <verse eid="DEU 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 21:3" />Yamalhaka, ashulhupalhe o iwani yo vakhiviru chinene ni ntembo uyo, ankusheke mwaang'ope mwanthiyana ri hinaaya upangihiya ntheko uriyoothe wala hinaya uttukelhiya nikongwa, <verse eid="DEU 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 21:4" />anrweeheke unikooteni uri nshepa nihinooma, nikoote nihinolhimiya ama waalhiya ittu. Wowo amuntheke ishiko mwaang'ope uyo. <verse eid="DEU 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 21:5" />Ni opochera ishaani o nikosho ni Alawi ayo aatameke vavawo, ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu ahaathanlha yayo, ni ayo phiri ni ipilhi yo waanyulha milhatu chiriyoothe, ni cho kila nlhatu wo urakalhihaniya. <verse eid="DEU 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 21:6" />Mwaang'ope uyo onthiyaka ishiko iyo, ashulhupalhe onkhaye o iwani aatamme ntembo uyo anyawelheke mathatha aya vachulhu mwaang'ope uyo, <verse eid="DEU 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 21:7" />ni wiira, ‘Khaninamwiiva ulha ntu ulha, ni wala khaninchuwenlhe ntu mwiivilhe. <verse eid="DEU 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 21:8" />Chonte, inyu Apwiiya Nlhuku, mwaahiyerereke attu inyu Aisraeli, mwooponlhe inyu mwaanene ukhuma Umisri, nhaahike iphome ya ntu eeviye hiittenke ulha, nansho mwaahiyerereke wowo utteka uwo.’ <verse eid="DEU 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 21:9" />Paahi wo upanga chiicho khannokhalha ni nlhatu unaacha wiiviya wa yoyo ntu uyo, ukhalhawaya nhopanga ittu ithananiye ni Apwiiya Nlhuku wiira mpange.<verse eid="DEU 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwaha wo manyaathiyana avariye mateeka ukhotoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 21:10" />“Mwarwaaka ukhotoni waatakana ni amalhaponi inyu, ni Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayooworihani waakottolha, nkamwaavara mateeka, <verse eid="DEU 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 21:11" />nkamwamoona mwommo nthiyana orera nkamwaachivelhiya wiira munthelhe, <verse eid="DEU 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 21:12" />paahi, inyu alhopwana nnothanana wiira chiicho va, munkusheke nthiyana uyo uwannyu, ni wowo oowulheke ikharari chawe ni waakulha ihatha chawe, <verse eid="DEU 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 21:13" />arulheke ni ikuwo chaawanre awe vanvanre inyu mateeka vawo, ni awareke ikuwo chikina. Akhalheke mattanga mweeri mmoka, wonlhelha manyanaangoro awe, paahi yamalhaka vavawo nrweeke etu mwankhalhaneke uwannyu, ntu ni ahanu awe. <verse eid="DEU 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 21:14" />Nansho yakhalhakaru kaanyuma nnowoona wiira khanoochivelhani, munhiyerereke etu arweeke uriwoothe unothanana awe urwaa. Nhiwe mena mwanthumiha ama umwiiriha thoko ipotta, ukhalhawaya mwahonkhalhana ni unrupana.<verse eid="DEU 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwaha wo mahalha anomwaacha mwaana o nttara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 21:15" />“Yakhalhaka haawo nlhopwana thenlhe mavasha a manyaathiyana eelhi, ni uyo nonttuna chinene mmoka, umpwaha nkina uyo, ni oyeelhi ayo ahaayaracha achishaana ashilhopwana, ni mwaana o nttara yariye ni nthiyana hinottuniya chinene uyo, <verse eid="DEU 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 21:16" />naphiyaka nihuku no ukawelhachiya achishaana ayo nhakhu aya wo uhiyeriya, yoyo nlhopwana uyo himpange mwaana a nthiyana nonttuna awe chinene uyo ukhalha phi mwaana o nttara, ni unhiya ulhe yariye ni nthiyana hinonttuna awe uyo, ri phi o nttaara wo ikekheene. <verse eid="DEU 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 21:17" />Anttuneke yoyo mwaana o nttara a nthiyana hinonttuna aya uyo, ammaheke mahalha awe o uhiyeriya ayo, ammaheke nhakhu awe uyo mikwaha miilhi.<verse eid="DEU 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwaha wo achishaana o itiyamaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 21:18" />“Yakhalhaka ntu hanaa mwaana mwanlhopwana o itiyamaru, o urukunia, hineewelhelha athumwanawe ama anumwanawe vanomwaamuka aya, <verse eid="DEU 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 21:19" />paahi athumwanawe ama anumwanawe ayo ankusheke ukhuma unupani unokhalha aya ni unrweeha wa ashulhupalhe varii nlhako muulhupalhe wo ukelha vawani. <verse eid="DEU 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 21:20" />Yeereke wo ashulhupalhe ayo wiira, ‘Ulha mwaamwanihu ulha, o itiyamaru ni o urukunia. Khanoniiwelhelha, o umenyekha ni uhapalhiya.’ <verse eid="DEU 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 21:21" />Paahi vavawo etu, manyaalhopwana onkhaye o yeyo iwani awe iyo, amwaateke malhuku mpaka akhweeke. Vavawo etu, phi nohalha inyu umalhiha mwaha wo uwonya thoko yolha munlhokoni mwinyu. Paahi attu onkhaye o Uisraeli anowa wiiwa ni woova.<verse eid="DEU 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malheheriyo makina makina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 21:22" />“Yakhalhakaru ntu howonya chinene, chinophwanelhiya uhukumulhiya wiira eeviye, nkeeviya wo uthomeiya vamwirini, <verse eid="DEU 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 21:23" />iruttu awe iyo ihirupe vamwirini vawo. Nansho avithiyeke nenno nihuku, ukhalhawaya ntu riyoothe nothomeiya vamwirini yoyo holhaviya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku. Nhiwe mwaananariha ittaya ya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, inokelha aya uuvahani wiira ikhalhe yawinyu iyo.<verse eid="DEU 21:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="DEU 22" />
  <para style="s">Malhehero makina makina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 22:1" />“Mwoonaka ing'ope ama ikhondoro ya ntu o Israeli naninyu inapotenre, nhihiye ikukuriachaka, nansho nhakhelheke wa mwanene. <verse eid="DEU 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 22:2" />Nansho yakhalhaka mwanene uyo nokhalha utayi, ni ama khamunchuwenlhe, nhakhelheke uwannyu mpaka mwanene uyo vanohalha awe uwa ukohererani, vavawo munhokolhoshereke. <verse eid="DEU 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 22:3" />Mmweeke mweera chiicho vanoona inyu iphuta ya amwaatamana inyu, ama mwiinjiro awe, ama ittu iriyoothe yaapotenre. Nhihiye wo uhilhoha.<verse eid="DEU 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 22:4" />“Mwoonakaru iphuta ya nlhoko inyu ama ing'ope awe inawulhuwilhe vaphironi, nhihiye wo uhilhoha. Munkaviheke utheesha uhokolhosha uwannyawe.<verse eid="DEU 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 22:5" />“Manyaathiyana ahiware ikuwo cha manyaalhopwana, ni wala nlhopwana hiware ikuwo cha manyaathiyana, ukhalhawaya mwapangaka chiicho, Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu anoorushiya.<verse eid="DEU 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 22:6" />“Mwoonaka iphuuru mphironi, mwirini ama vathi iri ni makhandi ama mooche, ni naangoro narupenlhe makhandi ama mooche ayo, nhinkushe naangoro uyo ni makhandi awe ayo. <verse eid="DEU 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 22:7" />Nkusheke makhandi ayo, ni anaangoro ayo mwaahiyeke avaveke, vavawo nnoopatta nipesha no ukhalha ni ukumi mwinchi.<verse eid="DEU 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 22:8" />“Vanotheka inyu inupa yo naanano, nthekeke nreko wo ishiri ikani yo urukureria itatari, nhiwe mwaakuphulhachiya yakhalhaka ntu noowulhuwa ukhuma vatatarini vawo, nkaakhwa.<verse eid="DEU 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 22:9" />“Nhaalhe miri cho izabibu vamoka ni imbeyu cho miri chikina mmatani mwinyu, mwapangakaru chiicho, choolhia chonkhaye khachinorumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. Kuhii mwanlhe inyu chiyo vekha, nansho ata izabibu ni chittu chikina chonkhaye.<verse eid="DEU 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 22:10" />“Nhilhime imata ni ing'ope ni iphuta chittukelhiye nikongwa nimoka.<verse eid="DEU 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 22:11" />“Nhiware ikuwo chittaviye wo nttoche no mapururu o ikhondoro, ni yo ikuwo yorera yooteelha vamoka.<verse eid="DEU 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 22:12" />“Ntottelheke manjenje o nttoche macheshe umminikoni mwo miinjiro chinowara inyu.<verse eid="DEU 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikano chinaacha manyaalhopwana ni manyaathiyana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 22:13" />“Yakhalhaka nlhopwana nonveka nthiyana ni kaanyuma aya nkaathanana unhiya, <verse eid="DEU 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 22:14" />ni umwootheria wiira hopanga chittu cho wuulhiha muru, ni unnanariha wo wiira khayonne wiira ahothupha mooro ikatema yaavenke awe. <verse eid="DEU 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 22:15" />Paahi etu yakhumelhelhaka chiicho, athumwanawe yoyo mwalhi uyo ahimiechesheke wo wooniha ishuka yaarupelhiye yoyo uhiyu iyo, wiira mwalhi aya uyo aari hinathupa mooro, ni uhimiacha wa ashulhupalhe unlhakoni wo vawani, <verse eid="DEU 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 22:16" />ni weerelha wiira, ‘Nanthelhinhe mwalhi ihu ulha wo ulha ntu ulha, nansho vano khanonttuna tho, <verse eid="DEU 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 22:17" />inthikineeha iri wiira, horomolha chittu cho wuulhiha muru, oolhumachaka etu wiira amphwanye nathumpe mooro. Nansho hii uhimiechesha wihu wiira aari ahinathupha mooro phi ulha wo ishuka yaarupelhiye uhiyu wo nihuku no nthelhi nno ilha.’ <verse eid="DEU 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 22:18" />Vavawo ashulhupalhe o vawani ayo ankusheke nlhopwana uyo ni umwaata ikopo. <verse eid="DEU 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 22:19" />Tho, anlhiviheke yoyo ntu uyo ifaini yo makhobilhi imia o malhuku o isiliva, ni uvahiya anaangoro o yoyo mwalhi uyo, ukhalhawaya yoyo nlhopwana uyo honnanariha yoyo mwalhi a attu o Israeli uyo. Ni yoyo mwalhi uyo phi nohalha ukhalha ahanu awe mahuku onkhaye ni wala khanooria ummaha italaka.<verse eid="DEU 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 22:20" />“Nansho yakhalhaka nlhatu uyo uri wo ikekhiaye, ni wala khaawo malhove o uhimiechesha wo nlhatu no uhithupha wawe mooro, <verse eid="DEU 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 22:21" />arweehiyeke vankhorani wa athumwanawe ni manyaalhopwana o yeyo iwani iyo amwaateke malhuku akhweeke, ukhalhawaya hopanga chittu cho uhilhoka wa attu o Uisraeli, wo ulhavalhava nari wa athumwanawe. Vavawo etu, phi nohalha inyu umalhiha mwaha wo uwonya thoko yolha munlhokoni mwinyu.<verse eid="DEU 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 22:22" />“Yakhalhaka nlhopwana noovariya ugooni ni nthiyana a ntu, onkhaye eelhi ayo, nlhopwana ni nthiyana eeviyeke. Vavawo etu, phi nohalha inyu umalhiha mwaha wo uwonya thoko yolha munlhokoni mwinyu. <verse eid="DEU 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 22:23" />Nlhopwana amphwanyaka vawani mwalhi vekiye, nkanrupana, <verse eid="DEU 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 22:24" />onkhaye eelhi ayo mwaarweeheke vachereshere iwani, aatiyeke malhuku mpaka ukhwa. Mwalhi uyo eeviyeke ukhalhawaya khaakhuwenlhe wiira awe aakihiya inakhalhaka aari vawani. Ni nlhopwana uyo eeviyeke, ukhalhawaya honnanariha mwalhi vekiye ni amwaatamana awe, nkanrupana. Vavawo etu, phi nohalha inyu umalhiha mwaha wo uwonya thoko yolha munlhokoni mwinyu.<verse eid="DEU 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 22:25" />“Nansho yakhalhaka nlhopwana nonkumaana umatani mwalhi vekiye, nkammara wo tuuteni, paahi nlhopwana uyo eeviyeke vekha awe. <verse eid="DEU 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 22:26" />Mwalhi uyo hipangiye ittu iriyoothe, kattenke nlhatu unophwanelha wiiviya. Yoyo mwaha uyo uri thoko wa ntu mwiithelhe nkhunanawe nkaamwiiva ukhalhawaya, <verse eid="DEU 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 22:27" />nlhopwana uyo ammanre mwalhi uyo uchereshere iwani, ni uyo inakhalhaka ahokhuwelha wiira aakihiye, khaawo ntu arweelhe umwaakihani.<verse eid="DEU 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 22:28" />“Yakhalhaka nlhopwana nonkumaana mwalhi hinavekiya, nkammara wo tuuteni, nkaaphwanyeriya, <verse eid="DEU 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 22:29" />nlhopwana uyo aalhiveke athumwanawe mwalhi uyo makhobilhi makhumi nthanu o malhuku o isiliva, ukhalhawaya honnanariha mwalhi uyo. Ni yoyo mwalhi uyo phi nohalha ukhalha ahanu awe ni wala khanooria unhiya ukumi awe wonkhaye.<verse eid="DEU 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 22:30" />“Hikhalhe mena nlhopwana riyoothe nohalha waarupana manyaahanu a athumwanawe.”<verse eid="DEU 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="DEU 23" />
  <para style="s1">Uthamihiya munlhokoni mwa attu a Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 23:1" />Ashinna Musa ahothepa uhimiacha wiira, “Nlhopwana riyoothe huniye ama tupulhiye ittu awe ye ilhopwana, hihiyereriye eethakanihe ni nlhoko wa attu, vanaathimicha aya Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="DEU 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 23:2" />“Ni ntu yariye mmaphumbulhuni, hihiyereriye ukhalha munlhokoni mwa attu a Apwiiya Nlhuku, wala iyari awe, wala ata mpaka iyari awe yo khumi.<verse eid="DEU 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 23:3" />“Khaawo ntu riyoothe o Uamoni, ama o Umoabu, ni iyari chaya chonkhaye, ata iyari aya yo khumi, nohalha uhiyereriya ukelha munlhokoni mwa attu a Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="DEU 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 23:4" />Ukhalhawaya yayo manyaattu ayo ahokhota uuvahani yolhia ni maashi vaari inyu mphironi vaakhuma inyu Umisri, ni ukhalhawaya ahaalhalhia Nabalaamu anaaya Nabeori ukhuma Upethori, ilhapo yo Umesopotamiya, wiira oolhaveni. <verse eid="DEU 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 23:5" />Nansho aneeraka chiicho, Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu khamwiiwelhenlhe Balaamu, ulhava wawe uwo wahorukunuwa nkawaakhalha ibarakha, ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu ahouttunani. <verse eid="DEU 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 23:6" />Paahi etu, mena nhaakavihe yayo manyaattu ayo wiira ahipatte mpuha, wala ahichine mmakhalhelhoni mwaya.<verse eid="DEU 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 23:7" />“Nhaapangelhe ichimwa attu o Uedomu, yayo amuchi inyu, ni wala nhaapangelhe ichimwa attu o Umisri, ukhalhawaya mwahokhalha uwannyaya vaari inyu alheto. <verse eid="DEU 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 23:8" />Achishaana aya ni uchuulhu wo yayo attu o Umoabu ni o Umisri ayo, yayo mwaahiyerereke akelheke munlhokoni mwa attu a Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="DEU 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukwecherera nipuro wiira nikhalhe rata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 23:9" />“Mwarwaaka ukhotoni nkamweesha nipuro, kila mmoka inyu eeshungeke hiinyalhihe wo iphiro iriyoothe, nkoochelha urumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="DEU 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 23:10" />Yakhalhaka munlhokoni mwinyu haawo ntu eenyalhinhe wo ukhumiya ikhanja vaarumpe awe uhiyu, yoyo athameke mwanene, arweeke vachereshere nipuro, hikhalhe vakhiviru ni nipuro. <verse eid="DEU 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 23:11" />Nansho yaphiyaka uchechilho arapeke, ni nchuwa neelhaka ahokolhieke vanipuroni.<verse eid="DEU 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 23:12" />“Nkhalheke ni vakittu vachereshere nipuro unohalha inyu urwaa uriindini. <verse eid="DEU 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 23:13" />Nhina ikaruma chinyu chinohalha inyu ukusha, chikhalheke ni ihipa chinohalha inyu uthipelha malhikiti ni uwuhelha ichoroni chinyu. <verse eid="DEU 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 23:14" />Mapuro inyu areereke, ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu anoovira eetakachaka mmapuroni mwinyu mmo, wiira owenkelheni ni waakottolhacha amalhaponi inyu. Paahi etu nhiwe mwooniha ittu iriyoothe yo unanara munlhokoni mwinyu, mwaahireke chiicho anouhiyani.<verse eid="DEU 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malheheriyo makina makina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 23:15" />“Yakhalhaka ipotta noottawelha uwannyu, nhinhokolhoshe wa mwanene. <verse eid="DEU 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 23:16" />Munkhalhaneke vamoka munlhokoni mwinyu, vakittu vanohalha awe uthanlha vawo. Nhimpangelhe ichimwa.<verse eid="DEU 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 23:17" />“Hikhalhe ntu riyoothe, nlhopwana ama nthiyana munlhokoni mwa attu o Israeli, nohalha ulhavalhava mmanupani mwo ulhapelha milhuku chaya. <verse eid="DEU 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 23:18" />Tho, nchurukhu uriyoothe unohalha upattiya ukhuma muulhavalhavani mmo, uhirweehiye unupani wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, uthaphulha ishaani. Ukhalhawaya nlhopwana ama nthiyana nopanga yoyo nhapo uyo, nowaathunalhiha Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="DEU 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 23:19" />“Vanonkopiha inyu ntu o Israeli naninyu nchurukhu ama yoolhia, hinlhivihe mahalha o vachulhu. <verse eid="DEU 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 23:20" />Nlheto munlhiviheke mahalha o vachulhu vanomwaashimiha inyu, nansho kuhii wa nlhoko inyu. Ukhalhawaya mwapangaka chiicho, nnoovahiya ibarakha mmithekoni mwinyu mwonkhaye, ni wiilhaponi unokelha inyu urwaa ukhalhelhani uwo.<verse eid="DEU 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 23:21" />“Vanottuka inyu ishaani wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, nhicherewihe uthaphulha, ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu anoukohani, ni inyu nnowiirelhiya wiira nhowonya. <verse eid="DEU 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 23:22" />Mwaahittukeke ishaani khannopatta milhatu cho uwonya, <verse eid="DEU 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 23:23" />nansho muupuwelheke ishaani ittukilhe inyu. Ukhalhawaya mwaahaalhelha Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu wo uttuna winyu.<verse eid="DEU 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 23:24" />“Mwaviraka mmatani mwa amwaatamana inyu mwaalhiye izabibu, nlhieke izabibu chinothanana inyu mwaanene, nansho nhirukulhe izabibu chikina cho ukusha muutingoni mwinyu. <verse eid="DEU 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 23:25" />Mwaviraka mmatani mwa amwaatamana inyu nlhimiye choolhia, nnowooria uthikilha machashi ni ukhuura, nansho nhiwie imboopo wiira nkhwache choolhia cho ukusha uwannyu.<verse eid="DEU 23:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="DEU 24" />
  <para style="s1">Mwaha wo uhiyana nthelhi ni uhokolhelhana tho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 24:1" />“Yakhumelhelhaka nthiyana ahothelhiya, ni kaanyuma alhopwana ayo nkayoona wiira khanchivelhiya, ukhalhawaya ahoona ittu yo uhilhoka, nkayammaha ikaratasi yo italaka ni unhokolhosha uwannyawe, <verse eid="DEU 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 24:2" />ni nthiyana uyo nkaathelhiya ni nlhopwana nkina, <verse eid="DEU 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 24:3" />tho yoyo nlhopwana o nayelhi uyo nkammaha italaka kaanyuma, ama akhwaaka, <verse eid="DEU 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 24:4" />paahi nlhopwana o upachera ulhe khinooria tho unhokolhelha yoyo nthiyana uyo. Ukhalhawaya honyalhihiya wo iphiro ihinooria urumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. Upanga chiicho phi waarusha Apwiiya Nlhuku, wiilhaponi unokelha aya uuvahani ukhalhe wawinyu uwo.<verse eid="DEU 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malheheriyo makina makina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 24:5" />“Nlhopwana thenlhe naanano hirwee ukhotoni wala hivahiye ntheko nkina uriwoothe. Ahiiyeke akhalheke chiicho iyaakha imoka, wiira akhalheke uwaani apuheke ni ahanu awe.<verse eid="DEU 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 24:6" />“Ntu riyoothe hikushe nshilho no ushilhelha ama nahaa, wiira eemesheriye iponi, ukhalhawaya upanga chiicho inokhalha thoko ukusha ukumi wa ntu uyo.<verse eid="DEU 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 24:7" />“Ntu riyoothe ammaraka wo machiri Muisraeli nanawe ni umpanga ipotta awe, ama unthumiha upottani, yoyo ntu uyo eeviyeke. Vavawo etu, phi nohalha inyu umalhiha mwaha wo uwonya thoko yolha munlhokoni mwinyu.<verse eid="DEU 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 24:8" />“Tho, ntu akelhiyaka makutulha mwiiruttuni, nvarechesheke rata ni uttwara malheheriyo a opochera ishaani Alawi. Nvarechesheke thoko chinre aka wo ulheherani, phi chiichammo chinothananiya inyu upanga. <verse eid="DEU 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 24:9" />Muupuwelheke vaari inyu munkwahani ukhuma Umisri, Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu chenre aya wo waapangelha Namiriamu.<verse eid="DEU 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 24:10" />“Mwamwaashimihaka namwaatamana inyu ittu iriyoothe, nhikelhe unupani wawe, ni ukusha ittu yo weemeshera iponi, <verse eid="DEU 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 24:11" />nansho munlhitelhelheke vathe, munhiyeke mwanene ayo oovahekeni. <verse eid="DEU 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 24:12" />Yakhalhaka nshikini, ni uyo nouvahani ikuwo awe, nhikhalhane yeyo iponi iyo mpaka uhiyu, <verse eid="DEU 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 24:13" />munhokolhoshereke kila nihuku uchechilho, wiira uhiyu eekhunelhe ni ulhapelhelhani ibarakha. Mwapangaka chiicho, yeyo phi ittu yoombone umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu.<verse eid="DEU 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 24:14" />“Nhinnyenge nkibarua inyu nshikini, ama ntu o uvekelha, akhalhe Muisraeli naninyu ama mmoka a alheto anokhalhacha mwiilhaponi mwinyu. <verse eid="DEU 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 24:15" />Kila nihuku nchuwa nihinaya wiilha, munlhiveke nshahara awe wo nihuku nno, ukhalhawaya yoyo nshikini, ni machiri awe ayo phi nokhulhuvelha awe, hiwe onlhelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, ni inyu nkamwaapatta milhatu cho uwonya.<verse eid="DEU 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 24:16" />“Manyanaangoro ahiiviye wo milhatu chipangiye ni achishaana aya, mena achishaana ahiiviye wo milhatu cho uwonya wa manyanaangoro aya. Kila ntu eeviyeke wo uwonya wawe mwaanene.<verse eid="DEU 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 24:17" />“Nhirukunushe ikekhiaye cha alheto, ni cha achishaana ohiiya. Mena nhikushe ikuwo yo nankhwelhi wiira nvarelhe iponi. <verse eid="DEU 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 24:18" />Muupuwelheke wiira ni inyu mwaatti mwaari ipotta Umisri, ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ahoukumihani ukhuma wowo. Phi nlhatu etu no uvahani alha malhehero alha lhelho.<verse eid="DEU 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 24:19" />“Vanokhungura inyu choolhia mmatani mwinyu, ni ulhiyalha machashi makina mwommo, nhihokholhelhe tho wiira mwarokotanihe, mwaahiyereke alheto, manyanankhwelhi ni achishaana ohiiya. Mwapangaka chiicho, Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu anovaherani ibarakha wo mitheko chinyu chonkhaye. <verse eid="DEU 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 24:20" />Mwapukhunyaka mizeituni chinyu wiira nthomolhe maphepu aya, nhihokolhelhe tho upukhunya maritta aya, nansho mwaahiyereke alheto, manyanankhwelhi ni achishaana ohiiya. <verse eid="DEU 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 24:21" />Vanorukulha inyu izabibu mmamatani mwinyu, nhihokolhelhe tho urokottanihani izabibu chihalhehanlhe, nansho mwaahiyereke alheto, manyanankhwelhi ni achishaana ohiiya, aweeke aarokottanihacha. <verse eid="DEU 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 24:22" />Mmweeke mwoopuwelha wiira ni inyu chiicho mwaari ipotta Umisri. Phi nlhatu etu no uuvahani nna nlhehero nna lhelho.”<verse eid="DEU 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="DEU 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 25:1" />“Yakhalhaka indewo ya attu eelhi munlhokoni mwa attu o Israeli, nkaarwaa wa attu o waamulha milhatu wiira aamulhiye, mmoka aya nkoonia wiira khattenke, ni nkina nkaahukumulhiya, <verse eid="DEU 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 25:2" />paahi etu ulhe hukumulhiye waatiya ikopo ulhe, o waamulha amwiirelheke wiira arupeke vathi aatiyeke ikopo chinolhikaana ni uwonya wawe. <verse eid="DEU 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 25:3" />Aatiyeke ikopo makhumi ncheshe, nansho chihipwahe vavawo. Mwonchereraka vavawo, nnompangelha ittu yo uhilhoka nlhoko inyu, nnoomulhiha muru.<verse eid="DEU 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 25:4" />“Tho, nhittuke ing'ope uwano ikatema vanovara aya ntheko wo weepetta choolhia umatani.<verse eid="DEU 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inothananiya aya ntu nokelha manupa a munnawe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 25:5" />“Yakhalhaka attu eelhi ashilhopwana o nthunkwa nimoka anokhalhacha vakittu vamoka, ni mmoka aya nkaakhwa wo uhinhiya mwaana mwanlhopwana, ahanu a yoyo rimenlhe uyo, ahivekiye ni ntu nkina, hirii o yeyo imbumba ya ntu khwilhe iyo. Nhima awe ntu khwiilhe uyo phi nothananiya ukelha manupa wa nankhwelhi uyo ni waayaracha ashaana. <verse eid="DEU 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 25:6" />Mwaana mwanlhopwana o nttara nohalha uyaria uyo, nowaalhakelhelhiya wiira o ntu rimelhe ulhe, wiira nchina nawe nihikhwe mwiilhaponi Uisraeli. <verse eid="DEU 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 25:7" />Nansho yakhalhaka nhima awe ntu khwilhe uyo khanothanana ukelha manupa, paahi etu yoyo nthiyana uyo arweeke umihoolho wa ashulhupalhe o iwani ni uhimia wiira, ‘Nhima aya owannyaka akhwilhe ayo, nookhota uchiniha nchina naya wiira nihipotere munlhokoni mwa attu o Israeli. Khanottuna ukelha manupa a onnawe arimeelhe.’ <verse eid="DEU 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 25:8" />Yamalhaka, ashulhupalhe o iwani iyo amwiihaneke yoyo nlhopwana uyo ni umuulhumana. Yakhalhaka noothepa umindelha nlhove nawe no ukhota ukelha manupa nno, <verse eid="DEU 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 25:9" />nthiyana nankhwelhi uyo arweeke umihoolho wa yayo ashulhupalhe o iwani ayo, anrulheke ikiatu awe imoka ni unshuwelha ishenye wiitho ni umwiirelha wiira, ‘Phi chiichammo inothananiya upangelhiya ntu nokhota ukelha manupa a munnawe ni unnyarelha ashaana.’<verse eid="DEU 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 25:10" />“Ni iwani awe munlhokoni mwa attu o Uisraeli inohalha wiihaniya, ‘Imbumba ya ntu aarulhiye ikiatu.’<verse eid="DEU 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malheheriyo makina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 25:11" />“Ashilhopwana eelhi aatakanaka, ni nthiyana a mmoka aya nkaakaviha owannyawe ni ummara umattepe naatakana ni owannyawe ulhe, <verse eid="DEU 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 25:12" />yoyo muntupulheke moono awe wo wiimonono, wala nhimoonelhe ikiriri.<verse eid="DEU 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 25:13" />“Nhikushe munrupani mwinyu ni chittu cho uphimelha cho inamuna piilhi, imoka yo ulhemelha ni ikina yo waalhuwa. Nhintumiye kapani o woothacha uphimelha chittu. <verse eid="DEU 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 25:14" />Mena nhikhalhe ni chittu cho uphimelha chittu cho inamuna piilhi unupani winyu, imoka yo wunnuwa ni imoka ikaani. <verse eid="DEU 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 25:15" />Akapani ni chittu chinyu cho uphimelha chilhikaaneke ulhemelha waya, wiira mpatte nipesha no ulhokelha chinene wiilhaponi unovahiya inyu ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu uwo. <verse eid="DEU 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 25:16" />Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, anowaavenga attu onkhaye anopangacha chittu thoko chechiyo.<verse eid="DEU 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malheheriyo o weeva attu o Uamaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 25:17" />“Muupuwelheke chittu chaapangelhiye inyu ni attu o Uamaleki, ikatema vaari inyu munkwahani ukhuma Umisri. <verse eid="DEU 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 25:18" />Ikatema yokelhenlhe ayani mphironi, vaari inyu attu o uririyacha ni waatakacha attu onkhaye aawa utulhi winyu anoochelhe. Attu o Uamaleki khayoonve Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="DEU 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 25:19" />Paahi etu, ikatema Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, vanohalha aya uuvahani ilhapo nkamweettuwa waatakachiya ni amalhaponi inyu onkhaye anourukureriani, mwaarimeelhiheke attu o Uamaleki onkhaye wiira ahuupuwelhiye tho. Nhikelhe mwalhiyalha!”<verse eid="DEU 25:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="DEU 26" />
  <para style="s1">Isadaka cho nlhalha wo ukhunguriya choolhia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 26:1" />Ashinna Musa ahothepa tho uhimia wiira, “Vanohalha inyu uphiya ni ukhalha mwiilhaponi unovahiya inyu ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ikhalhe yawinyu ni ukhalha wowo, <verse eid="DEU 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 26:2" />mwakusheke muutingoni mpatta wo milhipu cho kila choolhia chinohalha inyu ukhungura wiilhaponi unovahiya inyu ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, mpaka vakittu Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu vathanlhilhe aya wiira athimichelhiye. <verse eid="DEU 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 26:3" />Mwaarwelheke opochera ishaani anopanga ntheko yeyo ikatema iyo, ni weerelha wiira, ‘Lhelho nna kinoorumelhelha umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku aka wiira kihokelha mwiilhaponi yaalhenhe aya manyaapwiiya ihu wiira anoonivaha.’<verse eid="DEU 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 26:4" />“Ni opochera ishaani ayo vanohalha aya ukusha utingo uyo mmathathani mwinyu ni weesha umihoolho wo madhubahu ya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, <verse eid="DEU 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 26:5" />nromolheke malhove alha umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu wiira, ‘Athumwanaka aari ntu o Uaramu, aathemwathemwa uwo ni uwo, yamalheke ahokhuruwa ni urwaa Umisri nkayaakhalha wowo thoko alheto. Yayo vamoka ni ashilhoko aya yarii attu vakani tu wowo, nansho nkaakhalha ilhapo yuulhupalhe, yo machiri ni yo attu enchi. <verse eid="DEU 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 26:6" />Nansho attu o Umisri ahonipangelha ushilhilhi, khaanitwarusha ni unikhanyereriha upanga ntheko woorika wo upotta. <verse eid="DEU 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 26:7" />Yamalheke naholhenlha Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku a manyaapwiiya ihu, nkayeewa wunlha wihu, ni woona uhuvihiya wihu, ntheko wo urika ni unyengiya wihu. <verse eid="DEU 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 26:8" />Paahi, Apwiiya Nlhuku wo moono aya wo machiri wookwelhe, ahonikumiha wowo Umisri uwo iphiro yo woopopiha, yo uthikineha ni yo ushangiha. <verse eid="DEU 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 26:9" />Nkayaaniwiiha vaa, ni univaha ilhapo inolhoka ulhima ni uhuwelha mihuwo ilha. <verse eid="DEU 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 26:10" />Ni vano kihaawiihera Apwiiya Nlhuku, milhipu cho choolhia cho ilhapo anivahilhe aya.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 26:10">“Yamalhaka mweesheke utingo uyo vathi, umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu ni ukhoroma umihoolho waya. <verse eid="DEU 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 26:11" />Ni inyu mwattapelhelheke moombone onkhaye ovahenre ayani Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, inyuva vamoka ni amuchi inyu. Alawi vamoka ni alheto anokhalhacha mwiilhaponi mwinyu anoottapelhelha vamoka ni inyu.<verse eid="DEU 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 26:12" />“Kila baada yo iyaakha ttaaru, kila mmoka inyu aweeke akumiheke isadaka yo mpatta mmoka wo mipatta khumi yo choolhia chawe chonkhaye, wo nlhatu wa Alawi ni alheto, manyanankhwelhi ni achishaana ohiiya, wiira apatte yolhia yonkhaye inothanana aya vanokhalha aya mmawani mwinyu. <verse eid="DEU 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 26:13" />Yamalhakaru, mmweeke mweera umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu wiira, ‘Kihokumiha uwannyaka nifungu nitakatifu, nkakaavaha Alawi, alheto, manyanankhwelhi ni achishaana ohiiya, thoko chikilhehenre inyu wiira kipange. Akinahiya urumelhelha malhehero inyu mena akilhiyanlhe. <verse eid="DEU 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 26:14" />Akalhilhie nifungu no yeyo isadaka iyo vaari aka kunlhaka vawo, akaakumihilhe vathe vaari aka kihirumelhelhiyaka umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, ni mena akaakumihilhe isadaka iyo wa attu akhwilhe. Kihorumelhelhani inyu Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku aka, kihopanga kila ittu ikilhehenre inyu inaacha isadaka. <verse eid="DEU 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 26:15" />Mmweheke vathi ukhuma makhalhelho inyu matakatifu o wiirimu, mwaavaheke ibarakha attu inyu o Israeli, ni ilhapo nnivahilhe inyu thoko chaalhupelhenlhe inyu manyaapwiiya ihu, ilhapo inolhoka ulhima ni uhuwelha mihuwo.’<verse eid="DEU 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Attu a Apwiiya Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 26:16" />“Lhelho va, Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu anoulheherani wiira nvareke malhehero aya onkhaye alha. Nkhalheke attu o wiiwelhelha malhehero ni upanga wo nrima wonkhaye ni wo nnepa wonkhaye. <verse eid="DEU 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 26:17" />Lhelho nna nhaarumelhelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, ukhalha Nlhuku inyu, ni wiira nnoottwara iphiro chaya ni uvara ikano chaya, iamuri chaya, malhehero aya ni urumelhelha nlhove naya anene. <verse eid="DEU 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 26:18" />Ni lhelho nna Apwiiya Nlhuku ahoolhumacha anene wiira mwaatti phi attu aya anenene, nthanlhiye munlhokoni mwa attu onkhaye o velhaponi va thoko chilhenhe aya. Ni ayo anoulheherani wiira nvarechesheke iamuri chaya chonkhaye. <verse eid="DEU 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 26:19" />Anoupangani inyuva ukhalha attu o machiri upwaha ilhapo chonkhaye chuupilhe aya. Nnowinkelha nchina naya, ni attu anoushipani ni utotopelhani. Mwaatti nnookhalha attu aya atakatifu thoko chinre aya wo ulheha.”<verse eid="DEU 26:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="DEU 27" />
  <para style="s1">Malhuku meelhi aalhepiye Malhehero a Apwiiya Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 27:1" />Paahi ashinna Musa vamoka ni ashulhupalhe o Israeli, ahoolhumacha ni weerelha attu wiira, “Mvarechesheke iamuri chonkhaye chinouvahaakani lhelho chi. <verse eid="DEU 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 27:2" />Nihuku nne vanohalha inyu ulhapuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani ni ukelha mwiilhaponi nnovahiya inyu ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, mweemesheke malhuku molhupalhe ni ushiringa. <verse eid="DEU 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 27:3" />Mwalhepeke vachulhu waya vawo, malhove onkhaye o iamuri chonkhaye chilha, vanohalha inyu ukelha ilhapo yo nhakhu ni yo ulhoka ulhima ni uhuwelha mihuwo inouvaha ayani Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku a manyaapwiiya inyu, yaalhehilhe aya iyo. <verse eid="DEU 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 27:4" />Vanohalha inyu ukhalha ukhopelhelhe wo mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, mweemesheke malhuku vachulhu mwaako wo Uebali, thoko chinouhimeriakani lhelho va, ni ushiringa. <verse eid="DEU 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 27:5" />Mwaathekelheke Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu madhubahu o malhuku o uhihemiya vavawo vakittu vawo. <verse eid="DEU 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 27:6" />Eiyo, ukhalhawaya madhubahu ariyoothe nnothananiya inyu waathekelha Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, athekiyeke wo malhuku o uhihemiya ni iyuuma. Vavawo vachulhu madhubahu vawo, mwaakumihereke Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, isadaka chinyu cho upahiya vamooroni. <verse eid="DEU 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 27:7" />Mwaakumihereke isadaka cho uwiiha mpuha, ni ulhelhia vavawo, ni uttapelhelha umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu. <verse eid="DEU 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 27:8" />Ni vachulhu malhuku ashiringiye ayo mwalhepeke wo woonia malhove onkhaye, ni malhehero a Apwiiya Nlhuku alha.”<verse eid="DEU 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 27:9" />Paahi yamalheke, ashinna Musa vamoka ni opochera ishaani Alawi nkayeerelha attu onkhaye o Israeli wiira, “Umaalhiiye, nkiiwelhelheke inyu attu o Israeli. Lhelho nna inyuva nhokhalha attu a Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu. <verse eid="DEU 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 27:10" />Paahi etu, nrumelhelheke nlhove na Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ni uttwara malheheriyo aya anoulheheraakani lhelho alha.”<verse eid="DEU 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ulhaviya attu o Itiyamaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 27:11" />Paahi nenno nihuku ashinna Musa nkayaalhehera attu yeeraka, <verse eid="DEU 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 27:12" />“Mwamalhihaka ulhapuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, alha makosho alha eemelheke vachulhu mwaako wo Ugerizimu wiira aalhepelhelhe attu ibarakha: Nikosho ni Nasimioni, ni Nalawi, ni Nayuda, ni Naisakari, ni Nayusufu, ni na Nabenyamini. <verse eid="DEU 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 27:13" />Ni alha makosho alha aweeke yeemelha vachulhu mwaako wo Uebali, wiira ahimiache malhove o ulhaviya attu: Nikosho ni Narobeni, ni Nagadi, ni Naasheri, ni Nadani, ni na Nanaftali. <verse eid="DEU 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 27:14" />Ni Alawi yaatangachereke attu onkhaye o Israeli wo nlhove nuulhupalhe wo wiira:<verse eid="DEU 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 27:15" />“ ‘Alhaviyeke ntu riyoothe nolhapelha ittu yo uhemiya ama yo uhaniya, ni weemesha wo nivitho ittu ikooroshiye ni mathatha a ntu okoorosha chittu, ukhalhawaya yeyo phi ittu inaarusha Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:15">“Ni attu onkhaye arumelhelheke, ‘Aye!’<verse eid="DEU 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 27:16" />“ ‘Alhaviyeke ntu riyoothe hinaarumelhelha athumwanawe ama anumwanawe.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:16">“Ni attu onkhaye arumelhelheke, ‘Aye!’<verse eid="DEU 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 27:17" />“ ‘Alhaviyeke ntu riyoothe nothamiha ikhomo yo wooniha mwiinano ni amwaatamana awe.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:17">“Ni attu onkhaye arumelhelheke, ‘Aye!’<verse eid="DEU 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 27:18" />“ ‘Alhaviyeke ntu riyoothe nonthwelhelhiha ntu ohoona mphironi.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:18">“Ni attu onkhaye arumelhelheke, ‘Aye!’<verse eid="DEU 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 27:19" />“ ‘Alhaviyeke ntu riyoothe norukunusha ikekhiaye ya nlheto, ama yo mwaana ohiiya, ama yo nankhwelhi.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:19">“Ni attu onkhaye arumelhelheke, ‘Aye!’<verse eid="DEU 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 27:20" />“ ‘Alhaviyeke nlhopwana norupa ni mmoka a manyaahanu a athumwanawe, ukhalhawaya hoolhiha muru athumwanawe ayo.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:20">“Ni attu onkhaye arumelhelheke, ‘Aye!’<verse eid="DEU 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 27:21" />“ ‘Alhaviyeke ntu riyoothe nonthelhakacha mwannama riyoothe.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:21">“Ni attu onkhaye arumelhelheke, ‘Aye!’<verse eid="DEU 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 27:22" />“ ‘Alhaviyeke ntu riyoothe norupa ni arokorawe, akhalhe mwaamwana a athumwanawe ama a anumwanawe.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:22">“Ni attu onkhaye arumelhelheke, ‘Aye!’<verse eid="DEU 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 27:23" />“ ‘Alhaviyeke ntu riyoothe norupa ni ahokohi awe.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:23">“Ni attu onkhaye arumelhelheke, ‘Aye!’<verse eid="DEU 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 27:24" />“ ‘Alhaviyeke ntu riyoothe nomwiiva ntu wo nivitho.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:24">“Ni attu onkhaye arumelhelheke, ‘Aye!’<verse eid="DEU 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 27:25" />“ ‘Alhaviyeke ntu riyoothe nopochera nchurukhu wiira amwiive ntu o uhikhalha ni nlhatu.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:25">“Ni attu onkhaye arumelhelheke, ‘Aye!’<verse eid="DEU 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 27:26" />“ ‘Alhaviyeke ntu riyoothe hinorumelhelha malhove alha o malhehero alha ni urumelhelha.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:26">“Ni attu onkhaye arumelhelheke, ‘Aye!’<verse eid="DEU 27:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="DEU 28" />
  <para style="s">Ibarakha wa attu anorumelhelha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 26:3-13">Ala 26:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:12-24">Itor 7:12-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 28:1" />“Mwaarumelhelheke Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ni uvarechesha wo nrima nlhove kinouhimeriakani lhelho nna, anoupangani ukhalha vachulhu, waapwaha makosho onkhaye o velhaponi va. <verse eid="DEU 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 28:2" />Mwaarumelhelhaka Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu nnoovahiya ibarakha chinottwara chi:<verse eid="DEU 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 28:3" />“Apwiiya Nlhuku anoohelha ibarakha iwani chinyu ni ipuwa chinyu.<verse eid="DEU 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 28:4" />“Apwiiya Nlhuku anouvahani ibarakha yo waapatta achishaana enchi, choolhia chinchi, ing'ope ni ikhondoro chinchi.<verse eid="DEU 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 28:5" />“Apwiiya Nlhuku anouvahani ibarakha yo uruweria choolhia chinchi, ni inyipo chinyu cho wuthuwanyera mikatte khachinokhalha chiicho.<verse eid="DEU 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 28:6" />“Apwiiya Nlhuku anouvahani ibarakha kila vanohohalha inyu ukhalha, ni kila ittu inohalha inyu upanga.<verse eid="DEU 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 28:7" />“Apwiiya Nlhuku anouvahani machiri o waakottolha amalhaponi inyu vanoukelhelha ayani. Anoukelhelhelhani wo iphiro imoka, nansho anouttawani wo iphiro saba.<verse eid="DEU 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 28:8" />“Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu anoohelha ibarakha chaya mmakhupini mwinyu nnoshungerera inyu choolhia, ni mmithekoni mwinyu mwonkhaye. Anouvahani ibarakha mwiilhaponi mwonkhaye nnokelha inyu uvahiya.<verse eid="DEU 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 28:9" />“Apwiiya Nlhuku anoupangani nkhalhe attu aya atakatifu, thoko chinre aya wo ulhelhani, mwarumelhelhaka nlhove naya yayo Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu ayo, ni uttwara iphiro chaya. <verse eid="DEU 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 28:10" />Tho, ilhapo chonkhaye velhaponi chinoowoovani, choonaka wiira Apwiiya Nlhuku ahothanlhani mwaattiva ukhalha phi attu aya. <verse eid="DEU 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 28:11" />Apwiiya Nlhuku anouvahani ibarakha yo chittu chinchi: Ibarakha cho achishaana enchi, cho mihuwo ni choolhia mmamatani, wiilhaponi waalhupelhenlhe aya waavaha manyaapwiiya inyu. <verse eid="DEU 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 28:12" />Apwiiya Nlhuku anouhulhelhani nikhupi naya noombone no wiirimu, anoorupiha ipulha velhaponi wo nlhalha aya, ni uvaherani ibarakha munthekoni mwinyu. Nnowa mwaashimiha attu o ilhapo chikina, nansho mwattiva khannowa mwaashima ittu. <verse eid="DEU 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 28:13" />Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu anoupangani nkhalhe phi o uchokholha, kuhii o umalhihera. Nnoothepa urwaa miholhoholho, kuhii attu o uhokolhia utulhi, mwavarechesha malhehero aya anouvahaakani lhelho alha ni urumelhelha upanga. <verse eid="DEU 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 28:14" />Nansho nhaarukunuwe wo iphiro iriyoothe, nkamwaattwara ni ukavihera milhuku chikina.<verse eid="DEU 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Itatako cho ukhota urumelhelha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 26:14-46">Ala 26:14-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 28:15" />“Nansho mwaahirumelhelheke nlhove na Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ama mwaahirumelhelheke ni upanga chinothanana aya, ni uttwara malhove aya onkhaye ni ikano chinouhimeriakani lhelho chilha, paahi nnoolhaviya malhavo onkhaye alha:<verse eid="DEU 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 28:16" />“Apwiiya Nlhuku anoolhava iwaani ni imata chinyu.<verse eid="DEU 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 28:17" />“Apwiiya Nlhuku anoolhava ittutu chinyu cho ukhungurelha, wiira nhiruwerie choolhia, ni inyipo chinyu cho wuthuwanyera mikatte.<verse eid="DEU 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 28:18" />“Apwiiya Nlhuku anowaalhava achishaana inyu, choolhia chinyu cho mwiilhaponi, ni mihuwo chinyu chinoolhaviya wiira chihunchererie.<verse eid="DEU 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 28:19" />“Apwiiya Nlhuku anoolhava kila ittu inohalha inyu upanga.<verse eid="DEU 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 28:20" />“Mwaawonyaka ni waahiya waarumelhelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, anouwiiherani mariro, uhiiwanana, ni uhuvahuva mmithekoni mwinyu mwonkhaye, mpaka vanohalha aya urimeelhihani lhakalhaka, wo uhipicha. <verse eid="DEU 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 28:21" />Anouwiiherani mareta ahinotondova, mpaka attu onkhaye vanohalha aya urimeelhacha lhakalhaka wiilhaponi unorwaa inyu ukhalha yawinyu uwo. <verse eid="DEU 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 28:22" />Apwiiya Nlhuku anowaatani wo uwiiherani mareta o uraulhihana, itekusha, anammatu, ntukutta no uthepa, nttona, iphioo yo machiri, ni ittapwe yinchi. Chechiyo chittu chiyo chinoutwarushani mpaka vanohalha inyu onkhaye urimeelhacha. <verse eid="DEU 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 28:23" />Irimu inowuuma nko thoko ishaaba yo riipa, wo uhirupa ipulha, ni ilhapo inookhalha thoko iyuuma. <verse eid="DEU 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 28:24" />Apwiiya Nlhuku khanorupiha upulha, nansho anowaaruma anaayupuru ni ntukurukhu, chuurupelheni mpaka vanohalha inyu urimeelhachihiya.<verse eid="DEU 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 28:25" />“Apwiiya Nlhuku anouhiyani nkottolhiye ni amalhaponi inyu. Nnorwaa waatakana wo iphiro imoka, nansho nnowaatawa wo iphiro saba. Ni attu onkhaye o velhaponi vanohalha aya uwoonani, wo chittu chuupantteni, anowoovacha. <verse eid="DEU 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 28:26" />Vanohalha inyu ukhwaacha vawo, mitembo chinyu chinookhalha yolhia ya ashinuni ni ashinama, wo uhikhalha ntu o woomolhacha. <verse eid="DEU 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 28:27" />Apwiiya Nlhuku anoutwarushani wo uwiipihani anammatu thoko eepihiye aya attu o Umisri, anohalha uphulia ni uhelhani makhwata, anouhelhani uvelhe ni unena uhinolhamiya. <verse eid="DEU 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 28:28" />Apwiiya Nlhuku anouwiiherani mariro o ukelhiya ihalhahalha, nnookhalha attu ohoona ni uthakaneelhiya irusho. <verse eid="DEU 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 28:29" />Nnohalha weeta wo waapapelhacha uthana thoko attu ohoona, ni mena khannoria upanga mitheko chinyu. Nnookhalha attu o waakhiya chittu kila nkwaha, ni khannokhalha ni ntu o ukaviherani.<verse eid="DEU 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 28:30" />“Nnoowa mwaaveka ashimialhi, nansho attu akina anoowa waarupana wo tuteni. Mwathekaka manupa attu akina phi anowa ukhalha mmanupani mmo. Mwaalhaka mizabibu attu akina phi nowa aakhungura. <verse eid="DEU 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 28:31" />Ing'ope chinyu chinoowa chaahithakachiya mwaashinene mwoonaka, nansho kannolhawiha ata ipilhipicha imoka yo inama aya. Iphuta chinyu chinookushiya wo machiri mwaashinene mwoonaka, ni mena khannohokolhosheriya. Ikhondoro chinyu anoovahachiya amalhaponi inyu, ni mena khanokhalha ntu o ukavihani waachiichiha. <verse eid="DEU 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 28:32" />Achishaana inyu ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana anoorweehiya wa attu akina ukhalha ipotta mwaashinene mwoonaka, nkamwaaweherera uthana wonkhaye wiira ahokolhie, nansho nhikhalhaka ni machiri o upanga ittu iriyoothe.<verse eid="DEU 28:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 28:33" />“Attu ahinaachuwelha inyu anookusha choolhia chonkhaye cho velhaponi winyu, ni maphepu o ntukutta ninyu, nhipattaka ittu, nansho waakakhachiya ni utwarushiya wo mahuku o uhimalha. <verse eid="DEU 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 28:34" />Nnoowa mwaakelhiya ihalhahalha wo nlhatu no chittu chinohalha inyu woona ni miitho inyu mwaashinene. <verse eid="DEU 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 28:35" />Apwiiya Nlhuku anowiipihani analhipwe o uweria ahinolhamia mmakuthani mwinyu, anouwanelhani toka vattomelhani mpaka unyaani.<verse eid="DEU 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 28:36" />“Apwiiya Nlhuku anourweehani inyuva ni amwene inyu, anohalha inyu waavara nchina, mpaka ilhapo nhinochuwelha inyu, mena manyaapwiiya inyu khayaachuwenlhe. Ni wowo nnokolhapelha milhuku chikina cho miri ni cho malhuku. <verse eid="DEU 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 28:37" />Ni inyu nnokookhalha ittu yo ushangiya, yo upangelhiya mattepwa, ni yo uheulhachiya mmilhokoni mwa attu onkhaye o ilhapo inohalha inyu urweehiya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="DEU 28:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 28:38" />Nnokowaalha imbeyu chinchi, nansho nnowa ukhungura vakani, ukhalhawaya anashombe anolhiacha choolhia chinyu chiyo. <verse eid="DEU 28:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 28:39" />Nnokowaalha mizabibu ni ulhimelha, nansho khannorukulha izabibu chiyo, wala uwuria idivai aya, ukhalhawaya ankhonya anoolhiacha. <verse eid="DEU 28:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 28:40" />Nnookhalha ni miri cho mizeituni kila vakittu mwiilhaponi mwinyu, nansho kannokhalhana makhura, ukhalhawaya itoolho cho izeituni chiyo chinoomoracha. <verse eid="DEU 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 28:41" />Nnowaayaracha achishaana ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana, nansho khanokhalhacha awinyu, anookushiya mateeka. <verse eid="DEU 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 28:42" />Anashombe anoolhiacha choolhia chonkhaye ni mathaakhuru o miri cho maphepu, mmamatani mwinyu.<verse eid="DEU 28:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 28:43" />“Alheto anokhalhacha mwiilhaponi mwinyu anoothepa upatta machiri, ni inyu mwaatti nnoothepa uwukuwa kila nihuku. <verse eid="DEU 28:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 28:44" />Yayo manyaattu ayo anowaashimihani mwaatti nchurukhu, nansho inyuva khannokhalha ni ittu yo waashimiha. Ni wo umalhihera yayo manyaattu ayo anoowa ootawarani.<verse eid="DEU 28:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 28:45" />“Yayo onkhaye ayo anoupattani mwaatti, ni uttwarani mpaka nrimeelhihiye, ukhalhawaya khanrumelhenlhe nlhove na Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ni uvarechesha iamuri chaya ni malhehero ovanheni aya ayo. <verse eid="DEU 28:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 28:46" />Nansho chiyo chinookhalha phi cho uhimiechesha ihukumu ya Apwiiya Nlhuku uwannyu, ni iyari chinyu mahuku o uhimalha. <verse eid="DEU 28:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 28:47" />Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu ahouvahani ibarakha kila iphiro, nansho mwaattiva khamwaakavihenre wo nrima wo uteelhiya ni ushangarara. <verse eid="DEU 28:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 28:48" />Paahi etu nnowaapangelha ntheko amalhaponi inyu, anohalha aya Apwiiya Nlhuku waaruma ookelhelheni. Ni inyu nookhalha ni ithalha, nttona, ushauchi, ni kila ittu inoumalhelhani. Paahi amalhaponi inyu anoutwarushani chinene mpaka vanohalha inyu urimeelhacha.<verse eid="DEU 28:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 28:49" />“Apwiiya Nlhuku anowiiha ukhuma utayi ilhapo imoka ihinochuwelha inyu nuulhumo naya, yuukelhelheni wo waakuvia thoko nrepo. <verse eid="DEU 28:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 28:50" />Yayo attu o woopiha wiitho ni o ushilhilhi ayo, khanowa aalhoha ashulhupalhe mena woonelha ikiriri ashimirawo, <verse eid="DEU 28:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 28:51" />anookhuurakacha mihuwo chinyu ni ulhia choolhia chinyu, mpaka vanohalha aya urimeelhihani. Khanowa oohiyerani choolhia, wala idivai, wala makhura, wala ing'ope ama ikhondoro mpaka ithalha vanohalha aya urimeelhani. <verse eid="DEU 28:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 28:52" />Yayo attu ayo anourukureriani ni utiyelhelhani kila vakittu wiilhaponi mwinyu nvahiye inyu ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, mpaka ishiri chinyu chinorukureria iwani ni ingome chaakhulhuvelha inyu chiwulhushiye vathi.<verse eid="DEU 28:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="DEU 28:53" />“Ikatema vanohalha inyu urukureriya ni utiyelhelhiya ni amalhaponi inyu, nnoowolhia ithalha chinene, mpaka nnowaakhuura achishaana inyu nvahiye inyu ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu. <verse eid="DEU 28:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="DEU 28:54" />Ata ntu o maalha chinene lhelhiye rata chinene, nowa anthuwa yoolhia nhima awe, ahanu awe anaattuna awe ni mwaamwanawe halhenlhe, <verse eid="DEU 28:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="DEU 28:55" />mena khanowa annyukuthulhelha ata mmoka aya, inama ya achishaana awe nohalha awe waakhuura ayo. Khannowa mwaahalhelhiya ni ittu iriyoothe ikatema yo urukureriya ni utwarushiya ni amalhaponi mwiilhaponi mwinyu mwonkhaye. <verse eid="DEU 28:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="DEU 28:56" />Ata nthiyana o maana chinene, lhelhiye rata, o rera chinene, o nhakhu, hinapacha unyikalha ittaya wo nnyaa nawe nowa upanga ittu thoko yeyo. <verse eid="DEU 28:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="DEU 28:57" />Yeyo ikatema yo urukureriya ni utiyelhelhiya iyo unowa ukhalha ithalha, ata nowa ankhuura mwaamwanawe mwankani, nnyanre awe ni ithokwa inokhuma vatulhi baada yo uyaria mwaana ilhe, wo uhaanyukuthulhelha ata owannyawe naattuna awe, ama mmoka a achishaana awe.<verse eid="DEU 28:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="DEU 28:58" />“Mwaahikhalheke ni irusho cho upanga malhove onkhaye o malheheriyo alhepiye nkitabuni alha, ni mwaahithimicheke ni ushungerera nchina nitakatifu no woopiha na Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, <verse eid="DEU 28:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="DEU 28:59" />paahi, Apwiiya Nlhuku anouwiiherani inyuva ni achishaana inyu ntwarusho nihiri no kawaida, ntwarusho no uweria nihinolhamiya ni o mahuku onkhaye, ni mareta oweria o uhimalha. <verse eid="DEU 28:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="DEU 28:60" />Anouwiiherani tho, mareta mwoova inyu mwiilhaponi Umisri alhe, ni ayo anouttwarattwarani mahuku onkhaye. <verse eid="DEU 28:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="DEU 28:61" />Anouwiiherani mareta o kila iphiro, ni ntwarusho nikina nihiromolhiye nkitabuni mwo malhehero mu mpaka nrimeelhache. <verse eid="DEU 28:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="DEU 28:62" />Inakhalhaka mwaattiva nri enchi thoko ittotwa cho wiirimu, nansho nnookhalha vakani, ukhalhawaya khanrumelhenlhe nlhove na Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu. <verse eid="DEU 28:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="DEU 28:63" />Tho, Apwiiya Nlhuku thoko chenre aya wo uteelhiya wiira nchine ni ukhalha enchi, phi chiichammo Apwiiya Nlhuku chinohalha aya uteelhiya uwiiherani mareta ni urimeelhihani. Ni inyu mwaatti nnoowa mwaathamihiya wiilhaponi nnorwehiya inyu wiira nkhalhe mwawinyu mmo.<verse eid="DEU 28:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="DEU 28:64" />“Apwiiya Nlhuku anoumwarushani mmilhokoni mwo ilhapo chonkhaye, ukhuma mpata mmoka wo ilhapo mpaka nkina, ni wowo nnokokavihera milhuku chikina cho miri ni cho malhuku, milhuku chihipanche inyu mwaashinene, ata ashulhupalhe inyu uchuwelha. <verse eid="DEU 28:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="DEU 28:65" />Khannokhalha ni mpuha uriwoothe vakittu winyu vo wiittuwa mwaashinene, wala mmilhokoni mwo chechiyo ilhapo chiyo. Wowo Apwiiya Nlhuku anowa ovahani nipampa no nrima, naawiriphi mmiithoni ni uhuvihiya munrimani. <verse eid="DEU 28:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="DEU 28:66" />Mahuku onkhaye nnoohalha mwoovaka uthana ni uhiyu, wiira amalhaponi inyu anowiivakachani. <verse eid="DEU 28:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="DEU 28:67" />Mirima chinyu chinoowoova kila ittu inohalha inyu woona. Wichishu nnoowa mweera, ‘Yakaari uchechilho,’ ni uchechilho weelhaka nnowiira, ‘Yakaari wichishu.’ <verse eid="DEU 28:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="DEU 28:68" />Apwiiya Nlhuku anouhokolhoshani Umisri wo nkwaha wo mmelini, nkwaha waahimilhe aya wiira khannorwaa tho. Wowo nnokoolhikacha wiithumiha wa amalhaponi inyu ukhalha ipotta, nansho khaawo ata ntu nohalha uthumani.”<verse eid="DEU 28:68" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="DEU 29" />
  <para style="s">Malhehano a Apwiiya Nlhuku ni attu o Israeli Umoabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 29:1" />Alha phi malhove o malhehano a Apwiiya Nlhuku aalhehenre aya ashinna Musa wiira apange ni attu o Israeli wiilhaponi Umoabu, wuncherera malhehano a Apwiiya Nlhuku apannganne aya umwaakoni Usinai alhe.<verse eid="DEU 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 29:2" />Ashinna Musa aheehana vamoka attu o Israeli onkhaye nkayeerelha wiira, “Mwahoona mwaashinene Apwiiya Nlhuku chaapangenlhe aya amwene o Umisri, attu aya o ipilhi, akarumiya aya ni ilhapo aya yonkhaye. <verse eid="DEU 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 29:3" />Mwaahona mariro molhupalhe, ithikineha ni cho ushangiha chaapannge aya. <verse eid="DEU 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 29:4" />Nansho mpaka lhelho nna Apwiiya Nlhuku kouvanheni irusho yo uchuwelha, miitho o woona, mena maaru o wiiwa! <verse eid="DEU 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 29:5" />Wo iyaakha makhumi ncheshe, mii kahouholhelhani uthakoni, ikuwo chinyu chaawara inyu khachathalhilhe mena iratu chinyu khachathakhanlhe. <verse eid="DEU 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 29:6" />Khamwalhilhie nkatte mena uwuria idivai, ama yo uhapalha iriyoothe ilhe, nchuwelhe wiira Apwiiya Nlhuku phi Nlhuku inyu.<verse eid="DEU 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 29:7" />“Ni vaaphilhe inyu va vakittu va, amwene Nasihoni o Uheshboni ni amwene Naogu o Ubashani ahowaacha uwaatakanani ni hii, nansho nahaakottolha, <verse eid="DEU 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 29:8" />nkanaakusha ilhapo aya, ni waakawelha attu o makosho a Narobeni, ni Nagadi, ni inusu ikina nikosho ni Namanase ikhalhe nhakhu aya. <verse eid="DEU 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 29:9" />Paahi etu, mwiishungeke wiira nvarelhelhe malhove onkhaye o malhehano alha, wiira nvarehiye munthekoni mwinyu mwonkhaye.<verse eid="DEU 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 29:10" />“Lhelho nna, mwattiva onkhaye nheemelha umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu: Ahoolhelhi o makosho, ashulhupalhe inyu, attu inyu o ipilhi, <verse eid="DEU 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 29:11" />achishaana inyu ni manyaahanu inyu, alheto anokhalha mmilhokoni mwinyu, anorema ikhuni ni urikelhani maashi. <verse eid="DEU 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 29:12" />Lhelho nrii va wiira mweeshe malhehano alha, anopanga aya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu lhelho alha, nrumelhelhe <verse eid="DEU 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 29:13" />wiira ahimiecheshe ukhalha attu aya, ni ayo akhalhe Nlhuku inyu, thoko chaalhupenlhe aya manyaapwiiya inyu, Aburahimu, Naisaka, ni Nayakhobo. <verse eid="DEU 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 29:14" />Ni mena akineesha malhehano alha lhelho wo nlhatu winyu vekhayaru, ni uromolha malhavo aya, ni wala akineesha wo nlhatu no alhe ari vamoka ni hii lhelho, umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku ihu, <verse eid="DEU 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 29:15" />nansho tho, wa attu ahiri vamoka ni hii lhelho va.<verse eid="DEU 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 29:16" />“Nhochuwelha chenre ihu wo ukhalha wiilhaponi Umisri, ni chenre ihu wo uvira mwiilhaponi mwa attu akina mpaka nkanaaphiya va. <verse eid="DEU 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 29:17" />Mwahoona isinyago chaya cho urushiha, milhuku cho miri ni cho malhuku, cho isiliva ni cho idhahabu. <verse eid="DEU 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 29:18" />Mwiishungeke wiira hikhalhe nlhopwana, nthiyana, ama attu o unupani winyu, ama o nikosho nirinoothe nineemelha va lhelho, ninohalha waahiya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, urwaa ukaviherani milhuku cho ilhapo chikina. Yelha ittu ilha inookhalha thoko mithithari chinohalha umelha ni uyara maphepu o uwawa, o uhapalha. <verse eid="DEU 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 29:19" />Yakhalhaka baada yo wiiwa malhove o malhehano alhupelhihiye inyu alha, ntu nkeerumelhelha mwaneneru munrimani mwawe, ni wiichona wiira ri salama, nansho nkaattwara itiyamaru awe mwaneneru, yeyo ittu iyo inowarimeelhiha attu onkhaye, attu o uhilhoka ni attu oombone. <verse eid="DEU 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 29:20" />Apwiiya Nlhuku khanonhiyerera yoyo ntu uyo, ni urushiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku ni ihache aya chinoopharelha vachulhu wa yoyo ntu uyo, ulhaviya wonkhaye ulhephiye nkitabuni mu unommweelha, ni Apwiiya Nlhuku anonlhakalhiha kabisa yoyo ntu uyo. <verse eid="DEU 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 29:21" />Apwiiya Nlhuku anonhaulha ni umpanga yoyo ittu yo ulhikaaniheriya mmilhokoni mwo makosho onkhaye o attu o Israeli, wiira apatte mareta wo ulhikaana ni ulhaviya wonkhaye wo malhehano ulhepiye nkitabuni ulha.<verse eid="DEU 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 29:22" />“Mwi iyari chinyu chinowa, achishaana inyu ni alheto o ukhuma ilhapo cho utayi, anowa woona Apwiiya Nlhuku chenre aya wo uwiiha mareta ni uhuva mwiilhaponi mu. <verse eid="DEU 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 29:23" />Ilhapo yonkhaye inoochara uka ni maakha, nkayaavia mooro ni uhikhalha ni ittu, khiiwo imbeyu inohalha waalhiya ni umelha ittu iriyoothe. Phi thoko chaari aya ikatema Apwiiya Nlhuku vaarimelhinhe aya iwani cho Usodoma ni Ugomora, Uadima ni Useboimu, wo urushiya waya chinene. <verse eid="DEU 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 29:24" />Eiyo, attu o ilhapo chonkhaye chinowa cheera, ‘Nlhatuni, Apwiiya Nlhuku no waapangelha chiicho attu o ilha ilhapo ilha? Wu urushiya waya wo uthepa wu unotangachani?’ <verse eid="DEU 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 29:25" />Ni waakhulha waya unowa ukhalha wo wiira, ‘Ukhalhawaya ahohiya malhehano a Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku a manyaapwiiya aya, aapannge aya vaakumihilhe aya ukhuma ilhapo yo Umisri, <verse eid="DEU 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 29:26" />nkaarwa ukaviherani ni uthimicha milhuku chikina, chahaachuwenlhe aya mpacho vawo, mena Apwiiya Nlhuku khaavahilhe. <verse eid="DEU 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 29:27" />Vavawo etu, urushiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku wahopharelha vachulhu wa attu o ilha ilhapo ilha, ni uwiiha malhavo onkhaye alhepiye nhina ilha ikitabu ilha. <verse eid="DEU 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 29:28" />Ni ayo Apwiiya Nlhuku, wo urushiya ni uthunalha waya chinene, ahaathamihacha ukhuma wiilhaponi waya nkaarihelha wiilhaponi ukina thoko chiri aya lhelho va.’<verse eid="DEU 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 29:29" />“Chittu chivithiye phi cha Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, nansho alhe apatakunlhe aya alhe phi awihu, ni achishaana ihu wo mahuku o uhimalha, wiira nipangeke malhove onkhaye o malhehero aya alha.”<verse eid="DEU 29:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="DEU 30" />
  <para style="s1">Nikhulhuvelho noombone no mahuku anowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 30:1" />Yamalheke, ashinna Musa ahothepa uhimia eeraka wiira, “Kihouvahani wiira nthanlheke, iriyari yo ibarakha ni ulhaviya. Chechiyo chittu chonkhaye chiyo choupattakani mwaattiva mmilhokoni mwinyu, nkamwoopuwelha uriwoothe, unohalha inyu umwarushelhiya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, <verse eid="DEU 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 30:2" />nkamwaahokolhelha Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, mwaattiva vamoka ni achishaana inyu, nkamwaarumelhelha nlhove naya wo nrima winyu wonkhaye ni wo nnepa winyu wonkhaye, nlhove kinoulheheraakani lhelho nna, <verse eid="DEU 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 30:3" />vavawo Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu anouhokholhosherani moombone inyu, ni uwonelhani ikiriri ni uthothokanihani tho ukhuma wiilhaponi umwarushelhiye inyu. <verse eid="DEU 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 30:4" />Ni ata yakhalhaka mmwarushelhiye utayi chinene velhaponi va, Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu anouthothokonihani ni uhokolhoshani, <verse eid="DEU 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 30:5" />wiira nkhalhelhe tho ilhapo yaakhanlhe aya manyaapwiiya inyu. Ni ayo anouvaherani chinene, ni ukhalha attu enchi waapwaha manyaapwiiya inyu. <verse eid="DEU 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 30:6" />Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu anoupangani mwaattiva vamoka ni achishaana inyu, nkalhe ni nrima wo urumelhelha wiira mwaattune yayo wo nrima winyu wonkhaye ni wo nnepa winyu wonkhaye, wiira mpatte ukhalha akumi. <verse eid="DEU 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 30:7" />Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, anowaahelha ulha ulhaviya ulha, amalhaponi inyu ohuvihilheni. <verse eid="DEU 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 30:8" />Ni inyu nnoorumelhelha nlhove na Apwiiya Nlhuku ni uvarechesha malhehero aya onkhaye kinouvahaakani lhelho alha. <verse eid="DEU 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 30:9" />Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu anouvaherani wo kila ittu inohalha inyu upanga, nnookhlha ni achishaana enchi, ni ing'ope chinchi, ni imata chinyu chinooruweria choolhia. Ukhalhawaya anoothanana tho uvaherani, thoko chaattunne aya waavahera manyaapwiiya inyu, <verse eid="DEU 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 30:10" />yakhalhaka nnoorumelhelha nlhove naya ni uvarechesha iamuri ni malheheriyo aya alhepiye nkitabuni mwo malhehero mmo, ni waahokolhelha Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu wo nnepa winyu wonkhaye ni wo nrima inyu wonkhaye.<verse eid="DEU 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 30:11" />“Malhehero anouvahaakani lhelho kahiwe o urika chinene uwannyu, mena khari utayi ni inyu mwaatti. <verse eid="DEU 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 30:12" />Khariwo wiirimu ata mwiire wiira, ‘Mpani nohalha uwelha nchulhu wiirimu uniwiihera wiira niiwelhelhe ni urumelhelha?’ <verse eid="DEU 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 30:13" />Mena khaarii ukhopelhelhe ibahari, ata mwiire, ‘Mpani nohalha ulhapuwa ibahari aniwiihere wiira niweelhelhe ni urumelhelha?’ <verse eid="DEU 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 30:14" />Kuhiwe mena, ari vakhiviru ni inyu mwaatti, ari mmalhakuni mwinyu ni mmaminepani mwinyu, wiira mpangache.<verse eid="DEU 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 30:15" />“Lhelho nna kinouvahani wiira nthanlheke arii oombone, ama o uhilhoka, ukumi ama nookhwa. <verse eid="DEU 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 30:16" />Mwarumelhelhaka malhehero a Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu anouvahaakani lhelho aalha, nkamwaattuna Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu ni upanga iphiro chaya ni uvarechesha malhehero aya, ni ihukumu chaya paahi nnookhalha akumi ni wunchereria, ni Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu anouvahani ibarakha wiilhaponi unorwaa inyu ukhalhelhani. <verse eid="DEU 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 30:17" />Nansho mwathephiyaka ni ukhota wiira nhiiwelhelhe, nkamwaapurulhiya wiira nlhapelhe milhuku chikina ni ukavihera, <verse eid="DEU 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 30:18" />mii kinouhimeriani lhelho va wiira, nnoorimeelhacha. Khannokhalha akumi wo mahuku menchi wiilhaponi unorwaa inyu ukusha ikhalhe yawinyu, ukhopelhelhe mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani. <verse eid="DEU 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 30:19" />Kinowiihana irimu ni ilhapo choonecheshe vachulhu winyu lhelho nna, wiira kihouvahani nthanlhe iriyari yo ukumi ama nookhwa, iriyari yo ibarakha ni ulhaviya. Paahi nthanlheke ukumi inyuva ni iyari inyu wiira nkhalhe akumi, <verse eid="DEU 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 30:20" />mwaattunaka Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, mwarumelhelhaka nlhove naya ni uvaraana. Ukhalhawaya upanga chiicho, phi upatta ukumi wo mahuku o uhimalha, ni ukhalha wiilhaponi Apwiiya Nlhuku waalhehilhe aya manyaapwiiya inyu, Aburahimu, Naisaka ni Nayakhobo wiira anouvahani.”<verse eid="DEU 30:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="DEU 31" />
  <para style="s1">Nayoshua anookusha nipuro na ashinna Musa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 27:12-23">Waal 27:12-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 31:1" />Yamalheke, ashinna Musa nkaathepa woolhumana attu o Israeli onkhaye, <verse eid="DEU 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 31:2" />nkeerelhacha wiira, “Mii vano kihoolhuvalha, ki ntu o iyaakha imia imoka ni makhumi meelhi, vano akirina machiri o uvara ntheko. Tho, Apwiiya Nlhuku ahokihimeria wiira akinolhapuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani. <verse eid="DEU 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 31:3" />Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu anouhoolhelhani ni ukottolha ilhapo chinokhalha wowo, wiira mwakhalheke mwiilhaponi mwaya. Nayoshua anookhalha nhoolhelhi inyu thoko chihimmie aya Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="DEU 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 31:4" />Apwiiya Nlhuku anoorimeelhihacha chechiyo ilhapo chiyo thoko chaakottonlhe Nasihoni ni Naogu, mamwene a Uamori, ni ilhapo aya. <verse eid="DEU 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 31:5" />Apwiiya Nlhuku anouvahani ukottolha vachulhu waya, ni nnokowaapangelha thoko chinre aka wo ulheherani. <verse eid="DEU 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 31:6" />Mwiilhipiheke ni ukhalha ni machiri, mena nhoovache ama woopopihiya ni yayo manyaattu ayo, ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu anoweeta vamoka ni inyu mwaatti. Yayo khanohiya ukaviherani ni mena khanourihani.”<verse eid="DEU 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 31:7" />Yamalheke, ashinna Musa nkayeehana Nayoshua, nkayaahimiacha umihoolho wa attu o Israeli onkhaye ni weerelha wiira, “Mwiilhipiheke, nkhalheke o machiri, ukhalhawaya inyuva phi nohalha waaholhelha attu alha urwaa ukhalhelhani wiilhaponi Apwiiya Nlhuku weerenlhe aya manyapwiiya aya wiira anowaavaha, ni inyuva mwaavaheke ikhalheke yawaya. <verse eid="DEU 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 31:8" />Apwiiya Nlhuku phi nouhoolhelhani, yayo anookhalha vamoka ni inyu mwaatti, yayo khanohiya ukaviherani ni mena khanourihani. Paahi etu, nhoove wala nhikhwe nrima.”<verse eid="DEU 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malhehero ashomiyeke kila baada yo iyaakha saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 31:9" />Paahi, ashinna Musa aholhepa malhehero ayo, nkaavaha opochera ishaani o nikosho ni Alawi aari ni ntheko wo ukusha Nsanduku no Malhehano a Apwiiya Nlhuku, ni ashulhupalhe onkhaye o Israeli. <verse eid="DEU 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 31:10" />Yamalheke, nkayaalhehera ahimiaka wiira, “Kila iyaakha yo saba, iyaakha yo ufutiya milhatu, mwaashomelheke attu ikatema yo isikukuu yo marapatta. <verse eid="DEU 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 31:11" />Yeyo iyaakha iyo, attu o Israeli vanowa aya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, vakittu vanohalha aya uthanlha, mmweeke mwaashomelha attu onkhaye o Israeli alha malhehero alha. <verse eid="DEU 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 31:12" />Mwaathukumaniheke attu, manyaalhopwana ni manyaathiyana, achishaana ni alheto anokhalhacha wiilhaponi winyu, wiira kila mmoka eeweke malhove alha, ni wiittucha waathimicha Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ni uvarechesha malhove o malhehero alha. <verse eid="DEU 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 31:13" />Wo wiira chiicho, ayari aya ahinapacha wiiwa malhehero a Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, eewe ni wiittucha waathimicha Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ikatema yonkhaye nnokhalha inyu wiilhaponi unorwaa inyu ukhalha ukhopelhelhe wo mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani.”<verse eid="DEU 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malhehero o umalhihera a Apwiiya Nlhuku wa ashinna Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 31:14" />Paahi, Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha ashinna Musa wiira, “Nihuku ninyu no ukhwa nihaatameria. Mweehaneke Nayoshua, mmweeke vamoka uri Nihema Nitakatifu wiira kaavahe malhehero.” Paahi, ashinna Musa ni Nayoshua nkayaarwaa waari Nihema Nitakatifu, <verse eid="DEU 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 31:15" />ni Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaakhumelhelha mwommo, unipotoni no nihute anari aneemenlhe unlhakoni wo Nihema.<verse eid="DEU 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 31:16" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha ashinna Musa wiira, “Nhomwaatameria vano nookhwa, ni baada yo ukhwa winyu, attu anookihiya ni wuntha malhehano kaalhehananne aka, anookihiya ni urwaa uthimicha milhuku chikina cho ilhapo inorwaa aya ukhalhelha iyo. <verse eid="DEU 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 31:17" />Vavawo urushiya waka unowa waapharelha vachulhu waya nenno nihuku nno, ni mii kinowaahiya ni uvitha ikhove aka utayi, ni ayo anorimeelhihiya. Chittu cho uhilhoka chinchi, ni uhuvihiya chinowakelhelha mpaka vanohalha aya uchuwelha wiira uhilhoka uwo unaapatta ukhalhawaya Nlhuku aya khaawo mmilhokoni mwaya. <verse eid="DEU 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 31:18" />Wo ikekhiaye kinowaavitha ikhove aka, ukhalhawaya ahopanga chittu cho uhilhoka ni urukunuwelha milhuku chikina.<verse eid="DEU 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 31:19" />“Vano etu nlhepeke nna nchipo nna, mweettuchiheke attu o Israeli wiira ukhalhe phi ittu yo uhimiechesha waka vachulhu waya. <verse eid="DEU 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 31:20" />Vanohalha aka waarweeha wiilhaponi unolhoka ulhima ni uhuwa mihuwo, thoko kaalhupenlhe aka manyapwiiya inyu uwo, ni ayo nkayaalhia nkayaawona ni uneneva, anowa aarukunuwelha milhuku chikina ni uthimicha, anookikhotacha ni wuntha malhehano aka. <verse eid="DEU 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 31:21" />Vanohalha aya upatta mariro menchi ni uhuvihiya, nchipo nna ninoohimiechesha, kwaani khanowa aalhiyalhiya ni iyari chaya. Ukhalhawaya ata vano, kihinaya waarweeha wiilhaponi kaalhupenlhe aka waavaha, kihochuwelha chittu chinoopuwelha aya wiira apangache.”<verse eid="DEU 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 31:22" />Paahi ashinna Musa aholhepa nenno nchipo nno, ni nenno nihuku nkayeettuchiha attu o Israeli.<verse eid="DEU 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 31:23" />Yamalheke, Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha Nayoshua, anaaya Nanuni, wiira, “Mwiilhipiheke, nkhalheke o machiri, ukhalhawaya nnowaaholhelha attu o Israeli wiilhaponi waalhupenlhe aka waavaha, ni mii kinookhalha vamoka ni inyuva.”<verse eid="DEU 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 31:24" />Ashinna Musa amalhiheke ulhepa malhove o Malhehero toka uchokholhelha mpaka umalhelha, <verse eid="DEU 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 31:25" />aheerelha Alawi yaari ni ntheko wo ukusha Nsanduku no Malhehano na Apwiiya Nlhuku nne wiira, <verse eid="DEU 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 31:26" />“Nkusheke ikitabu yo Malhehero ilha, mweesheke vakhiviru ni Nsanduku no Malhehano na Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, wiira ikhalhe ittu yo uhimiechesha uwaachani mwaatti ni attu o Israeli onkhaye. <verse eid="DEU 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 31:27" />Ukhalhawaya kihochuwelha mwaatti chiri inyu attu o urukunuwacha ni o uvaanyiha. Yakhalhaka nhaakhotta Apwiiya Nlhuku ikatema kiriaka nkumi vamoka ni inyu va, inohalha ukhalha chani vanohalha aka ukhwa vawo? <verse eid="DEU 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 31:28" />Mwaathukumanihacheke umihoolho waka ashulhupalhe onkhaye o makosho inyu ni ahoolhelhi inyu, wiira eewe malhove anoolhumacha aka alha, ni chiyo irimu ni ilhapo chihimiecheshe vachulhu waya. <verse eid="DEU 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 31:29" />Ukhalhawaya kihochuwelha wiira baada yo ukhwa waka nnookhalha attu o uwonya, ni uhiya iphiro kulhehenreakani wiira nttwareke. Ni mahuku anowa ayo nnookelhiya ni mariro, wo nlhatu no upanga chittu cho uhilhoka umihoolho wa Apwiiya ni waathunalhiha wo mitheko chinyu.”<verse eid="DEU 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nchipo na ashinna Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 31:30" />Yamalheke, ashinna Musa ahohokolhelhacha malhove o nchipo nno umihoolho wa attu onkhaye o Israeli aathukumanne.<verse eid="DEU 31:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="DEU 32" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 32:1" />“Mwiiwelhelheke inyu irimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:1">mwiiwelhelhe inyu ilhapo, malhove kinohimia aka.<verse eid="DEU 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 32:2" />Meettuchiho aka anoomora vathi thoko ipulha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">malhove aka anoomora thoko ukame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">thoko mmeevelha uminyepuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">thoko mwaapulha vachulhu mathaakhuru makithi.<verse eid="DEU 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 32:3" />Ukhalhawaya kinootangacha nchina na Apwiiya Nlhuku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:3">ni waahimiachera attu uyuulhupalhe aya.”<verse eid="DEU 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 32:4" />“Apwiiya Nlhuku phi mwalha wo ukumi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">ntheko aya uri wo uchuwania,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">iphiro chaya chonkhaye phi cho ikekhiaye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">Yayo phi Nlhuku o ukhulhuvelhiya, o ikekheene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">yayo anopanga chittu cho ukhulhuvelhiya ni cho ikekhiaye.<verse eid="DEU 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 32:5" />Nansho mwaatti khannokhulhuvelhiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">mwaatti khanhi achishaana aya tho wo nlhatu no uwonya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">inyuva phi iyari cho uwonya ni cho hiiwa.<verse eid="DEU 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 32:6" />Nnooria chani waalhiva chechiyo Apwiiya Nlhuku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">mwaatti attu akumbafu ni o uhikhalha ni irusho?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">Chani yayo kahii athumwaninyu owuupilheni inyu mwaatti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">opanngeni ukhalha velhaponi?”<verse eid="DEU 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 32:7" />“Muupuwelheke mahuku avinre,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">muupuwelheke iyaakha chivinre cho iyari chinchi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">mwaakoheke manyanaangoro inyu, ni ayo anouchuwelhihani ittu yaakhumelhenlhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">mwaakoheke ashulhupalhe inyu, ni ayo anouhimeriachani chittu cho khalhayi.<verse eid="DEU 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 32:8" />Nlhuku Muulhupalhe chenre awe wo waakawelha makosho nhakhu aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">vaakawanihilhe aya attu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">kila ilhapo ahovaha miinano chaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">wo ulhikaana chiri aya attu o Israeli.<verse eid="DEU 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 32:9" />Nansho ahaashungerera attu o nikosho ni Nayakobo ukhalha phi awaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:9">yayo ahaathanlha ukhalha nhakhu aya.”<verse eid="DEU 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 32:10" />“Aaphwannye uthakoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">uthakoru waawuka iphioo yo machiri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">Aheenanelha ni waashunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">aheenanelha thoko imboni yo niitho naya.<verse eid="DEU 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 32:11" />Thoko nrepo vanolhitelhelha aya iphuru aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">ni uthupathupa vachulhu makhandi aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">ookolhaka mapupha aya wiira aavarelhelhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">ni waakusha vachulhu yo mapupha aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">Apwiiya Nlhuku ahaashunga attu o Israeli wiira ahiwulhuwache.<verse eid="DEU 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 32:12" />Apwiiya Nlhuku ayo anene ahohoolhelha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:12">ni khaariwo nlhuku nkina nlheto aakaviha.”<verse eid="DEU 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 32:13" />“Ahaaviriha mipata cho nchulhu cho ilhapo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">ni ayo aholhia choolhia cho mmamatani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">Nkaavaha uwama wo umwalhani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">ni makhura o mizeituni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">chaakonda vachulhu mwalha wo ulhipa.<verse eid="DEU 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 32:14" />Ing'ope ni ipuri chaya chahokumiha mapelhe menchi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">nkaakhalha ni ikhondoro choreracha cho ukhuma Ubashani, ipuri ni ing'ope,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">Ahaavaha ingaano yoombone chinene, ni idivai yo naanano nkaawuriacha.”<verse eid="DEU 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 32:15" />“Attu o Israeli ahokhalha ni mihakhu, nansho ahokelhiya itiyamaru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">ahoneneva nkayaashichiracha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">yamalheke nkayanhiya Nlhuku oopilhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">nkayankhotacha Moopolhi aya o machiri.<verse eid="DEU 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 32:16" />Isinyago cho milhuku chaya chahaahelha ihache ni ichuku Apwiiya Nlhuku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:16">nkachaathotheria wiira athunalhe wo mitheko chaya cho urushiha.<verse eid="DEU 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 32:17" />Nkayaalhapelha mashoka o unanara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">milhuku chahaachuwenlhe aya, mena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">milhuku cho naanano chikhumelhelhe mahuku o naanano va,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">chahaathimicheriye ni manyaashulhupalhe aya, mena.<verse eid="DEU 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 32:18" />Ahonlhiyalha Nlhuku aya, Moopolhi aya o machiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:18">Mwalha wovahilheni ukumi.”<verse eid="DEU 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 32:19" />“Apwiiya Nlhuku ahoona yoyo mwaha uyo, nkayoohiyani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:19">nkaakhotacha achishaana aya, ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana.<verse eid="DEU 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 32:20" />‘Kinowaavitha ikove aka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">koone umalhelha waya unowa ukhalha chani.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">Ukhalhawaya yayo phi iyari ipotenre,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">attu o uhikhulhuvelhiya wo iphiro iriyoothe.<verse eid="DEU 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 32:21" />Ahokithotheria wiira koone ihache wo ittu ihirii nlhuku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">ahokithunalhiha wo nlhatu no isinyago chihemilhe aya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">Wiira kaathunalhihe, kinoowaaruma attu o nikosho na attu akumbafu wiira aakelhelhe.<verse eid="DEU 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 32:22" />Urushiya waka uhoparelha thoko mooro,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">unoopaha mpaka vathi unaminepa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">unorimeelhiha ilhapo ni chittu chiriwo mwommo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">unoopahacha mithithari cho miako.”<verse eid="DEU 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 32:23" />“ ‘Kinoochariha mariro vachulhu waya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:23">kinowaamalhihera miupa chaka.<verse eid="DEU 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 32:24" />Anookhwa wo ithalha ni mareta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">anorimelhihiya ni mareta molhupalhe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">Kinowaaruma mashene aakhuure,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">ni inwaa cho uhapalha chaalhumakache.<verse eid="DEU 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 32:25" />Ikhoto inooweevakacha attu o mmawani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">woova unootawara mmanupani mwaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">ashimirawo ashilhopwana ni ashimialhi anoweevakachiya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">ata achishaana anaamwa ni ashulhupalhe o ipwii.<verse eid="DEU 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 32:26" />Kahohimia wiira kinowaalhakalhiha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:26">ni ulhiyalhiya ahuupuwelhiye tho ni ntu riyoothe.<verse eid="DEU 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 32:27" />Nansho akinaahiya amalhaponi aya eetitihache,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">wiira ahaakottolha attu aka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">uno mii kimwanene phi alhakalhinhe!’<verse eid="DEU 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 32:28" />“Attu o Israeli phi attu o uhikhalha ni irusho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:28">attu aya kharina irusho cho nhina ata vakani.<verse eid="DEU 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 32:29" />Ahoochelha uchuwelha akottolhiye wo nlhatu waani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:29">khachuwenlhe ittu yaani yaakhumelhenlhe.<verse eid="DEU 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 32:30" />Ntu mmoka onrie chani waakottolha attu elufu imoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">ama attu eelhi onrie chani waakottolha attu elufu khumi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">Ukhalhawaya wiira Nlhuku aya haahiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">Apwiiya Nlhuku aya ahaahiya.<verse eid="DEU 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 32:31" />Ata amalhaponi aya ahochuwelha wiira milhuku chaya khachirina machiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:31">kharina machiri thoko Nlhuku a attu o Israeli.<verse eid="DEU 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 32:32" />Ukhalhawaya amalhaponi aya ahonta thoko attu o Usodoma ni Ugomora,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:32">thoko mizabibu chinoyara izabibu cho uhapalha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:32">ikhuchhe chaya cho uwawa.<verse eid="DEU 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 32:33" />Ari thoko idivai ikooroshiye wo isumu yo uhapalha yo inwaa.”<verse eid="DEU 32:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 32:34" />“Apwiiya Nlhuku anowuupuwelha chittu chipannge aya amalhaponi aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:34">nansho anoweherera ikatema yaayaka, awe aattwarusha.<verse eid="DEU 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 32:35" />Apwiiya Nlhuku anowaahokolhoshera ni waatwarusha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">ikatema inoowa vanohalha aya uwulhuwacha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">ukhalhawaya nihuku naya no umalhelha niri vakhiviru chinene.<verse eid="DEU 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 32:36" />Apwiiya Nlhuku anowaakiha attu aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">ikatema vanohalha aya woona wiira machiri aya ahomalha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">ni woonelha ikiriri anamitheko aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">vanoona aya wiira khaawo hanlhe, ttukiye ama neethi.<verse eid="DEU 32:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 32:37" />Phi vavawo Apwiiya Nlhuku vanohalha aya waakoha attu aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:37">‘Chiri vayi milhuku cho machiri chaakhulhuvelha inyu chilhe?<verse eid="DEU 32:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 32:38" />Chaalhilhie isadaka chinyu cho upahiya vamooroni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">ni idivai mwaavahilhe inyu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">Paahi chiweeke etu chuukaviheni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">nhiyeke chechiyo chuwaakihekeni vano!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 32:39" />“ ‘Mii phi Nlhuku, kiri vekha aka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">mena khaawo nkina kaahikhalhe mii va.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">Kinowiiva ni uwiiha ukumi, kinoorakalhiha ni ulhamiha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">ni khaawo nooria ukichiichiha ittu inopanga aka.<verse eid="DEU 32:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 32:40" />Wo ikekhiaye, Mii phi Nlhuku nkumi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:40">Kinoothesha moono aka uchulhu ni ulhupelha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:40">thoko chinokhalha aka mahuku o uhimalha,<verse eid="DEU 32:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 32:41" />wiira kinoonona uphanga aka wo wiithia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">ni woona wiira ikekhiaye inoovarecheshiya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">Kinowaalhivereriha amalhaponi aka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">ni waatwarusha ahinokittuna alhe.<verse eid="DEU 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 32:42" />Miupa chaka chinoowuva iphome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">uphanga aka unoweevakacha onkhaye ahinokittuna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">Akinonhalhiha ata mmoka naatakana ni mii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">ata attu arakalhihiye ni attu attukiye anoowiivakachiya.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 32:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 32:43" />“Mwaatti attu o ilhapo nttapelhelheke vamoka ni attu a Apwiiya Nlhuku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">ukhalhawaya yayo anolhivereriha iphome ya anamitheko aya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">Anoolhivihera wa amalhaponi aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">ni uhiyerera uwonya wa attu aya.”<verse eid="DEU 32:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 32:44" />Yamalheke, ashinna Musa ni Nayoshua, anaaya Nanuni, ahohokolhelha malhove o nchipo nna, wiira attu o Israeli onkhaye eewacheke.<verse eid="DEU 32:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malheheriyo o umalhihera a ashinna Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 32:45" />Ashinna Musa vaamalhinhe aya waahimeriacha attu o Israeli alha malhove onkhaye alha, <verse eid="DEU 32:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 32:46" />nkayeera wiira, “Nshungeeheke munrimani mwinyu malhove onkhaye kinouvahakani lhelho alha. Mwaalhehereke achishaana inyu wiira attwaracheke wo nrima malhove onkhaye o Malhehero alha. <verse eid="DEU 32:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 32:47" />Ukhalhawaya Malhehero alha kahii malhoveru, nansho phi ukumi inyu, wo Malhehero alha nnookhalha mahuku menchi velhaponi unorwaa inyu ukhalhelha, ukhopelhelhe mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani.”<verse eid="DEU 32:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 32:48" />Nenno nihuku, Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha ashinna Musa wiira, <verse eid="DEU 32:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 32:49" />“Mmwelheke mwaako wo Uabarimu ulha, mwaako wo Unebo uri ilhapo yo Umoabu, unowehana ni iwani yo Uyeriko, mwooneke ilhapo yo Ukaanani kinaavaha aka attu o Israeli wiira akhalhelheke wowo. <verse eid="DEU 32:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 32:50" />Yamalhaka, nnokookhwa wowo umwaakoni uwo, mwalhutaaneke ni manyaapwiiya inyu, thoko onninyu Naharuni chaakhwilhe aya umwaakoni Uhori, nkalhutaana ni manyaapwiiya aya, <verse eid="DEU 32:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 32:51" />ukhalhawaya mwaatti eelhi va, mwahohiya ukhulhuvelhiya winyu umihoolho waka, ni umihoolho wa attu o Israeli vaari inyu mwalha wo Umeriba, vakhiviru ni iwani yo Ukadeshi, uthako wo Usini, nkamwoochelha ukithimicha umihoolho wa attu o Israeli. <verse eid="DEU 32:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 32:52" />Nnokowoona ilhapo iri umihoolho winyu, nansho khannokelha wiilhaponi unaavaha aka attu o Israeli uwo.”<verse eid="DEU 32:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="DEU 33" />
  <para style="s">Ashinna Musa anowaavaha ibarakha makosho o Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 33:1" />Ilha phi ibarakha ashinna Musa, ntu a Nlhuku yaalhapelhenlhe aya attu o Israeli ahinaaya urimeelha. Yenre wiira,<verse eid="DEU 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 33:2" />Apwiiya Nlhuku ahowa akhumaka umwaakoni Usinai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">ahonikhumelhelha umwaakoni Useiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">ahoweha ukhuma umwaakoni Uparani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">Ahokhumelhelha munlhokoni mwa maelufu o minepa o wiirimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">ni mooro unoparelha moono aya wo wiimonono.<verse eid="DEU 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 33:3" />Apwiiya Nlhuku ahaattuna attu aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">ni anowenkelha attu aya onkhaye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">Chiichammo etu ninoowooroma vamietoni waya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">ni urumelhelha iamuri chaya.<verse eid="DEU 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 33:4" />Ashinna Musa ahonilhehera wiira nirumelhelhe Malhehero,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:4">iri phi ittu yoombone chinene mwiilhaponi mwihu.<verse eid="DEU 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 33:5" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkaakhalha amwene o attu o Israeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:5">ikatema ahoolhelhi aya vaakumaana aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:5">ni makosho onkhaye vaathukumanne aya.<verse eid="DEU 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 33:6" />Ashinna Musa nkayoolhumacha weerelha attu o nikosho ni Narobeni wiira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:6">“Narobeni akhalheke akumi, ahikhwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:6">ni attu aya ahikhalhe vakani.”<verse eid="DEU 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 33:7" />Wa attu o nikosho ni Nayuda enre wiira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">“Inyu Apwiiya Nlhuku mwiiwelhelheke wunlha wa attu o nikosho ni Nayuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">mwaalhutaaniheke tho ni attu akina alhe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">Mwaatakaneke wo miono chinyu wo nlhatu waya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">mwaakaviheke attu o nikosho ni Nayuda aakottolhe amalhaponi aya.”<verse eid="DEU 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 33:8" />Wa attu o nikosho ni Nalawi, enre wiira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">“Inyu Apwiiya Nlhuku mwaapatakulhelheke attu o nikosho ni Nalawi uttuna winyu wo ulhoheriya wo iphiro yo Urimu ni Thumimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">wo iphiro ya akarumiya inyu o ukhulhuvelhiya, Nalawi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">mwalhikanche inyu Umasa uwo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">nkamwaavilhelha umaashini Umeriba.<verse eid="DEU 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 33:9" />Alawi ahooniha uuthimichani inyuva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">upwaha chinaathimicha aya manyaathumwanaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">nkayaalhiyalhacha ashilhoko aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">ahaachuwelhache ata achishaana aya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">ukhalhawaya aheweelhelha malheheriyo inyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">ni uvarechesha malhehano inyu.<verse eid="DEU 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 33:10" />Ni eettuchihe attu arumelhelhe malheheriyo inyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">eettuchihe attu o Israeli malhehero inyu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">Alawi atushereke ubani umihoolho winyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">isadaka chikumi cho upahiya umadhubahuni winyu.<verse eid="DEU 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 33:11" />Inyuva Apwiiya Nlhuku nhelheke ibarakha machiri aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">nrumelhelheke ntheko unopanga aya wo miono chaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">nkottolhelheke utayi machiri a amalhaponi aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">machiri a attu anaavenga ayo wiira aheemelhe tho.”<verse eid="DEU 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 33:12" />Wa nikosho ni Nabenyamini enre wiira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">“Nna phi nikosho anottuna aya Apwiiya Nlhuku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">ni nno ninookhalha rata vakhiviru ni ayo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">Yayo phi neesha vakhakaachani waya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">ni weenanelha ikatema yonkhaye.”<verse eid="DEU 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 33:13" />Wa attu o nikosho ni Nayusufu enre wiira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">“Apwiiya Nlhuku ahelheke ibarakha yo ukame wo ukhuma nchulhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">ni ibarakha yo marapo o maashi.<verse eid="DEU 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 33:14" />Ilhapo aya ivahiyeke ibarakha cho maphepu oombone anotokotta ilhimwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:14">maphepu oombone anotokotta kila nlhaalha.<verse eid="DEU 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 33:15" />Ilhapo aya yo miako cho khalhayi, ichare maphepu oombone o kila nikosho.<verse eid="DEU 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 33:16" />Ilhapo aya ichareke chonkhaye chiri choombone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">ivahiyeke ibarakha wo mpuha wa Apwiiya Nlhuku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">oolhumanche vethupini vaapharelha mooro.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">Chilha ibarakha chilha chaakhuruwelheke attu o nikosho ni Nayusufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">ukhalhawaya aari nashirongora munlhokoni mwa ashilhoko aya.<verse eid="DEU 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 33:17" />Nayusufu ari ni machiri thoko n'dume no ing'ope no nttara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">inyaka chaya phi cho inari ilhopwana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">Naefraimu anookhalha ni chechiyo inyaka maelufu khumi chiyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">ni Namanase wo maelufu chiicho.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">Wo chechiyo, anookekhelha makosho, mpaka mwiinano wo umalhelha ilhapo.<verse eid="DEU 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 33:18" />Wa attu o nikosho ni Nazabuloni ni o nikosho ni Naisakari enre wiira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:18">“Nazabuloni, nteelhiyeke munkwahani mwinyu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:18">ni inyu Naisakari, nteelhiyeke mmaheemani mwinyu.<verse eid="DEU 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 33:19" />Anowaalhatulha attu umiakoni waya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">ni wowo attu anokumihacha isadaka chinothananiya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">Ukhalhawaya anohalha upatta nhakhu aya ukhuma ubaharini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">ni nhakhu wo ukhuma munhaavani umbwaani.”<verse eid="DEU 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 33:20" />Wa attu nikosho ni Nagadi, enre wiira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">“Athimichiye Nlhuku naavaha Nagadi vakittu volhupalhe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">Nagadi aneethelha thoko kharamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">onthe moono ama vattomelhani.<verse eid="DEU 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 33:21" />Aheethanlhelha vakittu voombone upwaha vakittu vonkhaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">vakittu veeshiya nipuro na nholhelhi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">Ahaaholhelha attu ni waarumelhelha Apwiiya Nlhuku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">ahopanga ntheko wa Nlhuku wa attu o Israeli.”<verse eid="DEU 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 33:22" />Wa attu o nikosho ni Nadani enre wiira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:22">“Nadani ari thoko mwaakharamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:22">nothuphathupha ukhuma Ubashani.”<verse eid="DEU 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 33:23" />Wa attu o nikosho ni Nanaftali enre wiira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">“Inyuva Nanaftali phi nvaheriye chinene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">nchanre ibarakha cha Apwiiya Nlhuku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">ilhapo inyu phi mpata wo uchawa uri nthapwi no Ugalilaya.”<verse eid="DEU 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 33:24" />Wa attu o nikosho ni Naasheri yenre wiira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">“Avahiye ibarakha Naasheri, waapwaha achishaana onkhaye a Nayakhobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">attuniyeke ni ashilhoko aya onkhaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">ni ilhapo aya ichareke miri cho mizeituni cho waamiya makhura.<verse eid="DEU 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 33:25" />Ilhapo chinyu chinkelhiyeke milhako cho yuuma ni ishaaba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:25">Ukumi inyu ulhokelheke mahuku aya onkhaye!”<verse eid="DEU 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 33:26" />Ashinna Musa nkaamalhihera wo uhimia wiira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">“Inyuva attu o Israeli, khaawo nlhuku ri thoko Nlhuku inyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">novira wiirimu munchakarimiani wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">novira wiirimu uwa uukaviherani.<verse eid="DEU 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 33:27" />Nlhuku o mahuku o uhimalha phi ittawelhelho inyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">machiri aya anowoonia velhaponi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">Ahoomolhacha amalhaponi umihoolho winyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">ahaalhehera wiira, mwaarimeelhiheke.<verse eid="DEU 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 33:28" />Paahi etu, attu o Israeli ahokhalhacha rata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">achishaana a Nayakobo vekha aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">ilhapo yaachanre choolhia ni idivai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">ilhapo yaari ni irimu inomoriha ipulha vanlhaalhani.<verse eid="DEU 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 33:29" />Nhoreeriya mwaatti attu o Israeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Mpani ri thoko inyuva mwaatti, attu mwookholhiye ni Apwiiya Nlhuku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">ari phi ichushuru inowinkelhani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">ni uphanga unoovahani ipilhi yo ukottolha!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Amalhaponi inyu anowaacha anokhoromanche umihoolho winyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">ni inyuva nnowaanyikalhelha vathi.”<verse eid="DEU 33:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="DEU 34" />
  <para style="s">Ukhwa wa ashinna Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 34:1" />Paahi, ashinna Musa nkaathama vaari nikoote no Umoabu, nkaarwa umwaakoni Unebo, nkaawelha vachulhu mwaako, Upisga vakhiviru ni Uyeriko. Vavawo Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayooniha ilhapo yonkhaye: Ukhuma Ugileadi mpaka Unadani, <verse eid="DEU 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 34:2" />ilhapo yonkhaye i Nanaftali, ilhapo i Naefraimu ni i Namanase, ilhapo yonkhaye yo Uyuda mpaka ibahari yo Umediteraniya, <verse eid="DEU 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 34:3" />ithuphi yo Unegebu ni ithuphi yo nikoote no Uyeriko, ilhapo yo mitende mpaka Usoari. <verse eid="DEU 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 34:4" />Yamalheke, Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha ashinna Musa wiira, “Ilha phi ilhapo kilhupenlhe aka wa Aburahimu, Naisaka ni Nayakhobo wiira kinowaavaha iyari aya ilhe. Kihowoonihani mwoone wo miitho inyu mwaashinene, nansho khannophiya wowo.”<verse eid="DEU 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 34:5" />Paahi ashinna Musa anamitheko a Apwiiya Nlhuku nkaarimeelha wowo wiilhaponi Umoabu uwo, wo ulhikaana ni nlhove na Apwiiya Nlhuku naahimilhe aya. <verse eid="DEU 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 34:6" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkaavitha ashinna Musa unikote no Umoabu, vakhiviru ni iwani yo Ubeth Peori, nansho mpaka lhelho nna, khaawo ntu nochuwelha vakittu vari nihiye naya. <verse eid="DEU 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 34:7" />Ashinna Musa aarimelhe anari ni malhipa o iyaakha imia imoka ni makhumi meelhi, miitho aya aari ahinakelhiya ipiphi, ni aari ntu o wiikayakaya ni ari o machiri. <verse eid="DEU 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 34:8" />Attu o Israeli ahonlhacha wonlhelha ashinna Musa wo mahuku makhumi mararu, unikoteni Umoabu. Yamalheke vavawo, mahuku o ukhalhiya mattanga ayo ahomalha.<verse eid="DEU 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 34:9" />Paahi, Nayoshua anaaya Nanuni ahochara iphumu yo ukhalha ni irusho, ukhalhawaya aari anamanlhe uvahiya ibarakha ni ashinna Musa. Paahi etu, attu o Israeli ahaarumelhelha Nayoshua ni uttwara malhove a Apwiiya Nlhuku, aavanhe aya ashinna Musa.<verse eid="DEU 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 34:10" />Toka vavawo, khanakhumelhelha tho namilhohi o ulhikaana thoko ashinna Musa u Israeli, oolhumanne ni Apwiiya Nlhuku wo woonana wo miitho aya. <verse eid="DEU 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 34:11" />Khaawo namilhohi nkina aarumiye ni Apwiiya Nlhuku aapannge ithikineeha ni cho ushangiha wa amwene o Umisri, ni wa akavihi aya ni wo ilhapo aya yonkhaye yo Umisri. <verse eid="DEU 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 34:12" />Khaawo namilhohi nkina pannge ittu yuulhupalhe ni yo woopiha thoko yaapannge aya ashinna Musa umihoolho wa attu o Israeli onkhaye.<verse eid="DEU 34:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 34" />
</usx>